hadiths[600]{hadithnumber,text}:
"601","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, farmaya: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, farmaya: Amr ibn Dinar ne hum se bayan kiya ke unhon ne Amr ibn Aws al-Thaqafi ko kehte hue suna: main ne Abdullah ibn Amr ibn al-As ko kehte hue suna: Rasul Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne mujh se farmaya: Allah ke nazdeek sab se mehboob roza Dawud ka roza hai, woh ek din roza rakhte aur ek din iftar karte, aur Allah ke nazdeek sab se mehboob namaz Dawud ki namaz hai, woh aadhi raat sote, us ka teesra hissa qiyam karte aur us ka chhata hissa sote."
"602","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, farmaya: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, farmaya: Amr ibn Dinar ne hum se bayan kiya, farmaya: main ne Abu al-Abbas jo nabina hain un ko kehte hue suna: main ne Abdullah ibn Amr ko kehte hue suna: Rasul Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam mere ghar mein mere paas tashreef laye aur farmaya: kya mujhe ye khabar nahi di gayi ke tum raat bhar qiyam karte ho aur din bhar roza rakhte ho, main ne arz kiya: main aisa karta hun, Aap ne farmaya: aisa na karo, kyunke tumhari aankhon ka tum par haq hai, aur tumhari jaan ka tum par haq hai, aur tumhare ahl-e-khana ka tum par haq hai, aur agar tum aisa karoge to tumhari aankh thak jayegi aur tumhari jaan ukta jayegi, pas qiyam bhi karo aur so bhi, aur roza bhi rakho aur iftar bhi karo."
"603","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, farmaya: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, farmaya: Amr ne hum se bayan kiya, farmaya: Abu Qabus jo Abdullah ibn Amr ke azaad karda ghulam hain unhon ne mujhe khabar di ke unhon ne Abdullah ibn Amr ko kehte hue suna: Rasul Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya: rehem karne walon par Rahman rehem farmayega, tum zameen walon par rehem karo, aasman wale tum par rehem karenge."
"604","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, farmaya: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, farmaya: Amr ibn Dinar ne hum se bayan kiya, farmaya: Abu Qabus ne mujhe khabar di ke unhon ne Abdullah ibn Amr ko kehte hue suna: Rasul Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya: qata-e-rehmi se rishta-dari Rahman ki ek shaakh hai, jo use jodega Allah use jodega, aur jo use katega Allah use katega."
"605","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, farmaya: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, farmaya: Bashir ibn Sulayman Abu Ismail ne hum se bayan kiya, Mujahid ibn Jabr se, ke Abdullah ibn Amr ne ek bakri zibah karne ka hukm diya aur apne khadim se farmaya: kya tum ne hamare Yahudi padosi ko kuch diya, kyunke main ne Rasul Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ko farmate hue suna: Jibril Alaihis Salam mujhe padosi ke baare mein musalsal takeed karte rahe hatta ke main ne gumaan kiya ke woh use waris bana denge."
"606","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, farmaya: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, farmaya: Bashir ibn Sulayman Abu Ismail aur Fitr ibn Khalifa jo darzi hain unhon ne hum se bayan kiya, Mujahid se, Abdullah ibn Amr se, unhon ne farmaya: Rasul Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya: silah-rehmi karne wala badla chukane wala nahi hai, balke silah-rehmi karne wala woh hai ke jab us se rishta kata jaye to woh use jode."
"607","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, farmaya: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, farmaya: Dawud ibn Abi Hind ne hum se bayan kiya, farmaya: main ne al-Shabi ko kehte hue suna: ek aadmi Abdullah ibn Amr ke paas aaya jabke main un ke paas tha, logon ki gardanein phalangta hua hatta ke un ke samne baith gaya, phir bola: mujhe koi aisi baat bayan karo jo tum ne Rasul Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam se suni ho, aur mujhe do aadil shakhs se riwayat na karo, Abdullah ibn Amr ne farmaya: main ne Rasul Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ko farmate hue suna: Musalman woh hai jis ki zaban aur haath se Musalman mehfooz rahen, aur muhajir woh hai jo burai ko chhod de, ya unhon ne farmaya: use chhod de jise Allah ne mana farmaya hai."
"608","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, farmaya: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, aur Ibn Abi Khalid ne hum se bayan kiya, al-Shabi se, Abdullah ibn Amr se, Nabi Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam se, aur unhon ne do aadil shakhs ka zikr nahi kiya."
"609","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, farmaya: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, farmaya: hum ne ise Dawud ibn Shabur aur Yaqub ibn Ata se suna, Amr ibn Shuayb se, un ke walid se, un ke dada Abdullah ibn Amr se, unhon ne farmaya: Rasul Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne us khazane ke baare mein farmaya jise koi aadmi paye: agar tum use aabaad basti mein ya aam guzargah par pao to us ka elaan karo, aur agar tum use zamana-e-jahiliyat ke khandar mein, ya ghair aabaad basti mein, ya aam guzargah se hat kar pao to us mein aur rikaz mein panchwan hissa hai."
"610","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, farmaya: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, farmaya: Dawud ibn Shabur aur Muhammad ibn Ajlan ne hum se bayan kiya, aur mujhe Ibn Ajlan ki hadith behtar yaad hai, Amr ibn Shuayb se, un ke walid se, un ke dada Abdullah ibn Amr se, unhon ne farmaya: Rasul Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya: mutakabbir log Qiyamat ke din chhoti cheontiyon ki tarah mardon ki surat mein jama kiye jayenge, unhen har taraf se zillat dhanke hogi, unhen Jahannam mein Bulas naam ki qaidgah ki taraf hanka jayega, unhen aagon ki aag dhanke hogi, unhen Teenat al-Khabal yani ahl-e-Jahannam ki peep pilayi jayegi."
"611","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Isra'il ne hum se bayan kiya, Abu Ishaq se, Wahb ibn Jabir se, Abdullah ibn Amr ibn al-As se, unhon ne kaha: Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya: Aadmi ke gunah hone ke liye yahi kafi hai ke woh unhen zaya kar de jinhen woh khilata hai."
"612","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Al-Zuhri ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Maine Humayd ibn Abd al-Rahman ibn Awf ko kehte hue suna: Maine Muawiya ibn Abi Sufyan ko Ashura ke din Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ke minbar par suna jabke unhon ne apni aasteen se balon ki ek lat nikali thi, kehte hue: Ae Ahl-e-Madina! Tumhare ulama kahan hain? Maine Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ko is jaisi cheez se mana farmate hue suna, farmaya: Bani Isra'il usi waqt halak hue jab unki auraton ne inhen apnaya."
"613","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Al-Zuhri ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Maine Humayd ibn Abd al-Rahman ko kehte hue suna: Maine Muawiya ibn Abi Sufyan ko Ashura ke din Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ke minbar par suna, kehte hue: Maine Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ko farmate hue suna: Main roza rakh raha hun, pas tum me se jo is ka roza rakhna chahe to roza rakhe."
"614","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Yahya ibn Sa'id ne hum se bayan kiya ke unhon ne Muhammad ibn Hayyan ko Abdullah ibn Muhayriz se riwayat karte hue suna, unhon ne kaha: Maine Muawiya ibn Abi Sufyan ko kehte hue suna: Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya: Ruku aur sajde me mujh se aage mat badho, kyunke main bhari ho gaya hun; jab bhi main ruku me tum se pehle karun to uthte waqt tum mujhe pa lete ho, aur jab bhi main sajde me tum se pehle karun to uthte waqt tum mujhe pa lete ho."
"615","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ibn Ajlan ne hum se bayan kiya, Muhammad ibn Yahya ibn Hayyan se, Ibn Muhayriz se, Muawiya se, Nabi Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam se isi ki manind, magar unhon ne kaha: Kyunke main bhari ho gaya hun."
"616","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Amr ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Maine Wahb ibn Munabbih ko Sana me unke ghar me suna — aur unhon ne apne ghar me mujhe akhrot khilaya — apne bhai se riwayat karte hue, Muawiya ibn Abi Sufyan se, ke Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya: Sawal me israar mat karo; kyunke Allah ki qasam, tum me se koi mujh se kisi cheez ka sawal nahi karta ke sawal use mujh se nikalwata hai phir main use use de deta hun jabke main use napasand karta hun, aur jo maine use diya us me us ke liye barkat hoti hai."
"617","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hisham ibn Hujayr ne hum se bayan kiya, Tawus se, unhon ne kaha: Maine Ibn Abbas ko kehte hue suna: Ye Muawiya ke khilaf daleel hai unke is qaul me: Maine Marwa par dehati ustre se Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ke baal kate — Ibn Abbas kehte hain: jab unhon ne mut'a se mana farmaya tha."
"618","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Talha ibn Yahya ne hum se bayan kiya, apne chacha Isa ibn Talha se, ke unhon ne Muawiya ibn Abi Sufyan ko kehte hue suna: Maine Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ko farmate hue suna: Jab pukarne wala kahe: Allah sab se bada hai, Allah sab se bada hai, to kaho: Allah sab se bada hai, Allah sab se bada hai. Aur jab woh kahe: Main gawahi deta hun ke Allah ke siwa koi mabud nahi, to kaho: Aur main bhi gawahi deta hun. Aur jab woh kahe: Main gawahi deta hun ke Muhammad Allah ke Rasool hain, to kaho: Aur main bhi gawahi deta hun. Phir khamosh raho."
"619","Sufyan ne kaha: Aur Mujammi' ibn Yahya al-Ansari ne hum se bayan kiya, Abu Umama ibn Sahl se, Muawiya se, Nabi Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam se isi ki manind."
"620","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Al-Zuhri ne hum se ek se zyada martaba bayan kiya — main is par tumhen gawah banata hun — unhon ne kaha: Salim ibn Abdullah ne mujhe khabar di, apne walid se, unhon ne kaha: Maine Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam, Abu Bakr aur Umar ko janaze ke aage chalte hue dekha."
"621","Humein Al-Humaydi ne bayan kiya, farmaya: Humein Sufyan ne bayan kiya, farmaya: Humein Al-Zuhri ne bayan kiya, Salim ibn Abdullah se, unhon ne apne walid se ke unhon ne Allah ke Rasool Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ko mimbar par farmate hue suna: Tum mein se jo Jumuah ke liye aaye to use ghusl karna chahiye."
"622","Humein Al-Humaydi ne bayan kiya, farmaya: Humein Sufyan ne bayan kiya, farmaya: Humein Abdullah ibn Dinar ne bayan kiya, Ibn Umar se, Nabi Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam se isi ki manind."
"623","Humein Al-Humaydi ne bayan kiya, farmaya: Humein Sufyan ne bayan kiya, farmaya: Humein Ismail ibn Umayya aur Ayyub al-Sakhtiyani ne bayan kiya, Nafi se, Ibn Umar se, Nabi Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam se isi ki manind."
"624","Humein Al-Humaydi ne bayan kiya, farmaya: Humein Sufyan ne bayan kiya, farmaya: Humein Al-Zuhri ne bayan kiya, Salim se, unhon ne apne walid se ke Allah ke Rasool Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya: Bilal raat mein azan deta hai, pas khao aur piyo yahan tak ke tum Ibn Umm Maktum ki azan sun lo."
"625","Humein Al-Humaydi ne bayan kiya, farmaya: Humein Sufyan ne bayan kiya, farmaya: Humein Al-Zuhri ne bayan kiya, Salim se, unhon ne apne walid se ke Allah ke Rasool Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya: Jab tum mein se kisi ki biwi us se masjid jane ki ijazat mange to woh use na roke. Sufyan ne farmaya: Log samajhte hain ke woh raat ke bare mein hai."
"626","Humein Al-Humaydi ne bayan kiya, farmaya: Humein Sufyan ne bayan kiya, farmaya: Humein Al-Zuhri ne tanha bayan kiya, na mere sath koi tha aur na un ke sath, farmaya: Mujhe Salim ibn Abdullah ne khabar di, unhon ne apne walid se ke Allah ke Rasool Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya: Jo shakhs aisa ghulam beche jis ke pas maal ho to us ka maal usi ka hai jis ne use becha magar yeh ke kharidar shart lagaye; aur jo shakhs khajur ke darakht ta'beer ke baad beche to un ka phal bechne wale ka hai magar yeh ke kharidar shart lagaye."
"627","Humein Al-Humaydi ne bayan kiya, farmaya: Humein Al-Zuhri ne bayan kiya, farmaya: Mujhe Salim ibn Abdullah ne khabar di, unhon ne apne walid se, unhon ne farmaya: Maine Allah ke Rasool Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ko dekha jab woh namaz shuru karte to apne dono hath kandhon ke barabar uthate, aur jab ruku ka irada karte, aur jab ruku se apna sar uthate; aur dono sajdon ke darmiyan nahi uthate the."
"628","Humein Al-Humaydi ne bayan kiya, farmaya: Humein Al-Walid ibn Muslim ne bayan kiya, farmaya: Maine Zayd ibn Waqid ko Nafi se bayan karte hue suna: Ke Abdullah ibn Umar jab kisi shakhs ko namaz padhte dekhte is haal mein ke woh har jhukne aur uthne ke waqt apne hath nahi uthata to use kankariyan marte yahan tak ke woh apne hath uthata."
"629","Humein Al-Humaydi ne bayan kiya, farmaya: Humein Sufyan ne bayan kiya, farmaya: Humein Al-Zuhri ne bayan kiya, farmaya: Mujhe Salim ne khabar di, unhon ne apne walid se, unhon ne farmaya: Maine Allah ke Rasool Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ko dekha, jab safar un par jaldi dalta to Maghrib aur Isha ko jama karte."
"630","Humein Al-Humaydi ne bayan kiya, farmaya: Humein Sufyan ne bayan kiya, farmaya: Humein Al-Zuhri ne bayan kiya, Salim se, unhon ne apne walid se ke Allah ke Rasool Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya: Hasad nahi magar do mein: Ek woh shakhs jis ko Allah ne Quran diya aur woh raat aur din ki ghariyon mein us ke sath qiyam karta hai; aur ek woh shakhs jis ko Allah ne maal diya aur woh raat aur din ki ghariyon mein us mein se kharch karta hai."
"631","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Al-Zuhri ne hum se bayan kiya, Salim ibn Abdullah se, un ke walid se, unhon ne farmaya: Rasulullah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya: Jab tum so jao to apne gharon mein aag jali hui na chhoro."
"632","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Al-Zuhri ne hum se bayan kiya — Allah ki qasam — Salim se, un ke walid se, ke Rasulullah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya: Paanch janwar hain: jo inhen qatal kare us par koi gunah nahin, ehram mein ho ya ehram ke baghair: kawwa, cheel, bichchhu, chooha aur katne wala kutta. Sufyan se kaha gaya: Ma'mar ise Al-Zuhri se, Urwa se, Aisha se riwayat karte hain; to unhon ne kaha: Al-Zuhri ne hum se bayan kiya, Allah ki qasam, Salim se, un ke walid se; unhon ne Urwa ka Aisha se zikr nahin kiya."
"633","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Al-Zuhri ne hum se bayan kiya, Salim se, un ke walid se, unhon ne farmaya: Rasulullah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya: Saanpon ko qatal karo, aur do dhaariyon wale aur dum katay hue ko, kyunke ye beenai ko zail karte hain aur hamal gira dete hain. Unhon ne kaha: Aur Abdullah har saanp ko qatal karte thay jo unhen milta, yahan tak ke Abu Lubaba — ya Zayd ibn al-Khattab — ne unhen ek saanp ke peeche lage hue dekha to kaha: Gharon walay (saanp) mana kar diye gaye hain. Sufyan ne kaha: Al-Zuhri is mein hamesha kehte thay: Zayd ya Abu Lubaba."
"634","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Al-Zuhri ne hum se bayan kiya, Salim se, un ke walid se, ke Rasulullah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya: Nahusat teen cheezon mein hai: ghode mein, aurat mein aur ghar mein. Sufyan se kaha gaya: Lekin log is mein kehte hain: Hamza se; Sufyan ne kaha: Maine Al-Zuhri ko is hadees mein Hamza ka zikr karte hue kabhi nahin suna."
"635","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Al-Zuhri ne hum se bayan kiya, Salim se, un ke walid se: ke Rasulullah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne phal ko us ke pakne ke zahir hone se pehle bechne se mana farmaya, aur phal ko khajooron ke badle bechne se mana farmaya. Ibn Umar ne farmaya: Aur Zayd ibn Thabit ne mujhe khabar di ke Rasulullah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne araya ki bai ki ijazat di."
"636","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Al-Zuhri ne hum se bayan kiya, Salim se, un ke walid se, ke Rasulullah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya: Ahl-e-Madina Zul-Hulayfa se ehram bandhte hain, Ahl-e-Shaam Juhfa se, aur Ahl-e-Najd Qarn se. Aur unhon ne mujh se bayan kiya, halaanke maine ise nahin suna: ke Rasulullah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya: Aur Ahl-e-Yaman Yalamlam se."
"637","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Al-Zuhri ne hum se bayan kiya, Salim ibn Abdullah se, un ke walid se, unhon ne farmaya: Nabi Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne Umar ko apne walid ki qasam khate hue suna to farmaya: Beshak Allah tumhen apne baapon ki qasam khane se mana farmata hai. Umar ne farmaya: Allah ki qasam, us ke baad maine us ki qasam kabhi nahin khai, na jaan boojh kar aur na naqal karte hue. Al-Humaydi ne kaha: Sufyan ne kaha: Maine Muhammad ibn Abd al-Rahman, jo Aal-e-Talha ke azaad karda hain — Arabi ke aalim thay — ko kehte hue suna: Aur na naqal karte hue: yaani kisi doosre se naqal karna, us ki khabar dena ke us ne us ki qasam khai."
"638","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Al-Zuhri ne hum se bayan kiya, Salim se, un ke walid se: ke Rasulullah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne Ansar mein se ek shakhs ko apne bhai ko haya ke baare mein naseehat karte hue suna to Rasulullah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya: Haya iman mein se hai."
"639","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Al-Zuhri ne hum se bayan kiya, Salim se, un ke walid se: ke ek shakhs Rasulullah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ke samne khada hua aur un se poochha ke ehram wala haji kaunsa libas pehenta hai. Unhon ne farmaya: Na qamees pehne, na amama, na shalwar, na burnus, na koi aisa kapda jise zaafran ya wars laga ho, aur na moze, siwaye us ke jo jootiyan na paye; jo jootiyan na paye to unhen kaat le yahan tak ke wo takhnon se neeche ho jayen."
"640","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ismail ibn Umayya, Ayyub al-Sakhtiyani, Ayyub ibn Musa aur Ubaydullah ibn Umar ne hum se bayan kiya, Nafi se, Ibn Umar se, Nabi Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam se isi ki manind, siwaye is ke ke unhon ne hadees ke aakhir mein kaha: Aur na koi aisa kapda jise zaafran ya wars laga ho."
"641","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, farmaya: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, farmaya: Main ne al-Zuhri se suna, aur unhon ne hum se Salim ibn Abdullah se, un ke walid se bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Main ne Allah ke Rasul Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ko farmate hue suna: Raat ki namaz do do rakat hai; phir jab tum fajr ka khauf karo to use ek ke sath witr kar lo."
"642","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, farmaya: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, farmaya: Aur Amr ibn Dinar ne hum se Tawus se, Ibn Umar se, Nabi Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam se isi ki manind bayan kiya."
"643","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, farmaya: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, farmaya: Abdullah ibn Abi Labid ne hum se Abu Salama se, Abdullah ibn Umar se, Nabi Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam se isi ki manind bayan kiya."
"644","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, farmaya: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, farmaya: Abdullah ibn Dinar ne hum se bayan kiya, farmaya: Main ne Ibn Umar ko farmate hue suna: Main ne ek shakhs ko Allah ke Rasul Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam se sawal karte hue suna jabke Aap mimbar par the: Hum mein se koi raat ko kis tarah namaz parhe? Nabi Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya: Do do rakat karke; phir jab tum fajr ka khauf karo to use ek ke sath witr kar lo jo tumhare guzishta ko taaq bana degi. Sufyan ne farmaya: Aur ye un mein sab se behtar hai."
"645","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, farmaya: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, farmaya: al-Zuhri ne hum se Salim se, un ke walid se bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Allah ke Rasul Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya: Jo shakhs kutta rakhe siwae shikari kutte ya maveshi ke kutte ke, us ke sawab mein se har roz do qirat kam kar diye jate hain."
"646","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, farmaya: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, farmaya: Abdullah ibn Dinar ne hum se bayan kiya, farmaya: Main Ibn Umar ke sath Banu Muawiya ki taraf gaya, aur un ke kutton ne hum par bhonka, to Ibn Umar ne farmaya: Main ne Allah ke Rasul Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ko farmate hue suna: Jo shakhs shikari kutte ya maveshi ke kutte ke siwa kutta rakhe, us ke sawab mein se har roz do qirat kam kar diye jate hain."
"647","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, farmaya: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, farmaya: al-Zuhri ne hum se Salim se, un ke walid se bayan kiya ke ek shakhs Nabi Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ki khidmat mein aaya aur arz kiya: Main ne Laylat al-Qadr falan falan raat mein dekhi; to Nabi Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya: Main dekhta hun ke tumhare khwab muwafiq ho gaye hain, pas use aakhri das mein, us ki taaq raaton mein, ya baqi saat mein talash karo. Sufyan ne farmaya: Shak meri taraf se hai, al-Zuhri ki taraf se nahin."
"648","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, farmaya: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, farmaya: al-Zuhri ne hum se bayan kiya, farmaya: Abu Bakr ibn Ubaydullah ibn Abdullah ibn Umar ne mujhe khabar di ke unhon ne apne dada Abdullah ibn Umar ko farmate hue suna: Allah ke Rasul Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya: Jab tum mein se koi khae to use apne dahne hath se khana chahiye; aur jab piye to use apne dahne hath se pina chahiye; kyunke shaitan apne baen se khata hai aur apne baen se pita hai."
"649","Sufyan ne farmaya: Aur main ne Ma'mar se use baad mein al-Zuhri se, Salim se, un ke walid se bayan karte hue suna, to main ne un se kaha: Ai Abu Urwa, ye to sirf Abu Bakr se hai; to Ma'mar ne farmaya: Hum ne use pesh kiya tha. Aur Sufyan kabhi kabhi farmate: Ye us mein se hai jo hum ne pesh kiya tha."
"650","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, farmaya: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, farmaya: Zayd ibn Aslam ne mujh se bayan kiya, farmaya: Mere walid ne mujhe Abdullah ibn Umar ki taraf bheja, aur main un ke pas baghair ijazat ke dakhil ho gaya, to unhon ne mujhe sikhate hue farmaya: Jab tum aao to ijazat talab karo; aur jab ijazat di jae to dakhil hote waqt salam karo. Aur un ke bete ke bete, Abdullah ibn Waqid ibn Abdullah ibn Umar, ek naya kapra ghasitte hue guzre, to unhon ne un se farmaya: Ai mere bete, apna tehband upar uthao; kyunke main ne Allah ke Rasul Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ko farmate hue suna: Allah us shakhs ki taraf nahin dekhta jo takabbur mein apna kapra ghasitta hai."
"651","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, farmaya: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, farmaya: al-Jarr mein is ghar ke nigehban Majida ke khandan ke azaad karda Umayya ibn Hafs ibn Muhallaf ne hum se bayan kiya, farmaya: Maine Muslim ibn Yannaq ko kehte hue suna: Main Abdullah ibn Khalid ibn Asid ke ghar ke darwaze par Abdullah ibn Umar ke sath tha, jab ek naujawan guzra jabke uska tehband latka hua tha, to Ibn Umar ne us se kaha: Apna tehband upar uthao, kyunke maine Rasulullah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ko farmate hue suna: Allah us shakhs ki taraf nahi dekhta jo takabbur se apna kapda ghaseet-ta hai."
"652","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, farmaya: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, farmaya: Abdullah ibn Abi Labid ne hum se bayan kiya — jo Madina ke ibadat guzaron mein se the — farmaya: Maine Abu Salama ibn Abd al-Rahman ko kehte hue suna: Maine Ibn Umar ko kehte hue suna: Maine Rasulullah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ko farmate hue suna: Dehati log tum par tumhari namaz ke naam mein ghalib na aayen, kyunke woh to sirf Isha hai; woh use Atama kehte hain kyunke woh oonton ka doodh dohne mein der karte hain — ya unhon ne kaha: oonton ke sath. Sufyan ne kaha: Ibn Abi Labid ne isi tarah shak ke sath kaha."
"653","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, farmaya: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, farmaya: Abdullah ibn Dinar ne hum se bayan kiya — hum ne un se takrar aur tafseel ke sath suna — farmaya: Ibn Umar ko kehte hue suna: Rasulullah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne wala ko bechne aur use hibah karne se mana farmaya. Un se kaha gaya: Shuba ne Abdullah se is par qasam li thi; unhon ne kaha: Lekin hum ne un se qasam nahi li; hum ne un se ise kai martaba suna. Phir Sufyan hanse."
"654","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, farmaya: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, farmaya: Ibn Dinar — yani Abdullah ibn Dinar — ne hum se bayan kiya ke unhon ne Ibn Umar ko kehte hue suna: Hum ne Rasulullah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam se sunne aur itaat par baiat ki, aur jab hum un se baiat karte to woh humen talqeen farmate hue kehte: Jahan tak tum se ho sake."
"655","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, farmaya: Sufyan aur Salih ibn Qudama ne hum se Abdullah ibn Dinar se, unhon ne Abdullah ibn Umar se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Nabi Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam se dabb ke bare mein pucha gaya, to Aap ne farmaya: Na main use khata hun aur na us se mana karta hun."
"656","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, farmaya: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, farmaya: Hisham ibn Urwa ne hum se apne walid se, unhon ne Nabi Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam se isi ki manind bayan kiya."
"657","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, farmaya: Salih ibn Kaysan ne hum se Salim ibn Abdullah se, unhon ne apne walid se bayan kiya: ke Nabi Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam jab hajj, umra ya ghazwe se wapas aate aur bulandi par chadhte to farmate: Allah ke siwa koi mabud nahi, woh akela hai uska koi shareek nahi; usi ki badshahat hai aur usi ke liye hamd hai, aur woh har cheez par qadir hai; laut-ne wale, insha Allah, tauba karne wale, ibadat karne wale, apne Rab ki hamd karne wale; Allah ne apna wada pura farmaya, apne bande ki madad farmai, aur akele hi Ahzab ko shikast di."
"658","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, farmaya: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, farmaya: Abdullah ibn Umar ne hum se Nafi se, unhon ne Ibn Umar se, unhon ne Nabi Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam se isi ki manind bayan kiya, magar unhon ne: Insha Allah nahi kaha. Sufyan se kaha gaya: Kya is mein: sajda karte hue hai? Unhon ne kaha: Bahut mumkin hai, lekin mujhe yaad nahi."
"659","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, farmaya: Sufyan aur Salih ibn Qudama al-Jumahi al-Madani ne hum se bayan kiya, farmaya: Abdullah ibn Dinar ne hum se bayan kiya ke unhon ne Ibn Umar ko kehte hue suna: Rasulullah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya: Do shakhs teesre ko chhod kar sargoshi na karen."
"660","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, farmaya: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, farmaya: Ubaydullah ibn Umar ne hum se is se behtar taur par Nafi se, unhon ne Ibn Umar se bayan kiya ke Rasulullah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya: Do shakhs teesre ko chhod kar sargoshi na karen. Unhon ne kaha: Aur jab Ibn Umar sargoshi ka irada karte jabke woh teen hote, to chautha shakhs bula lete."
"661","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, Yahya ibn Said se, Al-Qasim ibn Muhammad se, ke Ibn Umar ne Yahya ibn Hayyan se kaha: Kya tum qatl ko koi cheez nahi dekhte, jab ke Rasool Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya: Do aadmi teesre ko chhor kar aapas me sargoshi na karein."
"662","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan aur Abd al-Aziz ibn Muhammad ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Muslim ibn Abi Maryam ne hum se bayan kiya: Ali ibn Abd al-Rahman Al-Muawi ne mujhe khabar di, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Ibn Umar ke pehlu me namaz parhi aur kankariyon ko ulat-pulat kiya, phir jab woh farigh hue to unhon ne kaha: Kankariyon ko mat phero, kyunke kankariyon ko pherna shaitan ki taraf se hai; aur waisa karo jaisa tum ne Rasool Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ko karte dekha, main ne kaha: Aap ne Rasool Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ko kis tarah karte dekha, to unhon ne apna dayan haath apni dayin raan par rakha — aur Abu Bakr ne teen ungliyan band kin aur shahadat ki ungli uthai — aur apna bayan haath apni bayin raan par rakha aur use phela diya."
"663","Sufyan ne kaha: Aur Yahya ibn Said ne hum se ise Muslim se bayan kiya, phir jab main Muslim se mila to unhon ne mujh se bayan kiya, is me izafa karte hue: Aur yeh shaitan ka makkhi urane wala pankha hai; is tarah kehte hue koi ghafil nahi rehta — aur Al-Humaydi ne apni ungli uthai, Muslim ne kaha: Aur ek aadmi ne mujh se bayan kiya ke us ne Sham ke ek girja me nabiyon ko tasveer me apni namaz me is tarah kehte dekha — aur Al-Humaydi ne apni ungli uthai."
"664","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Musa ibn Uqba ne mujh se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Salim ibn Abdullah ko apne walid se bayan karte suna, unhon ne kaha: Jab Rasool Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne tehband ke bare me jo farmaya so farmaya, to Abu Bakr ne kaha: Ae Allah ke Rasool, mera tehband ek taraf se dhalk jata hai, Aap ne farmaya: Tum un me se nahi ho."
"665","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, aur Amr ne Tawus se, Nabi Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam se is ki manind bayan kiya."
"666","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Aur Muhammad ibn Ajlan ne hum se bayan kiya, Said ibn Abi Said se, Ubayd ibn Jurayj nami ek aadmi se jo Ibn Umar ke sath rehte the, ke us ne Abdullah ibn Umar se sawal kiya, kehte hue: Main ne aap ko ek kaam karte dekha jo aap ke kisi sathi ko karte nahi dekha: main ne dekha ke aap ihram nahi bandhte yahan tak ke aap ki sawari aap ko lekar seedhi khari ho jaye; main ne dekha ke aap yeh chamre ki naalain pehente hain aur inhi me wuzu karte hain; main ne dekha ke aap Baitullah me se sirf in do ruknon ko chhute hain; aur main ne dekha ke aap apni dadhi ko peele rang se rangte hain, Ibn Umar ne use jawab diya, kehte hue: Main ne Rasool Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ko dekha ke woh ihram nahi bandhte the yahan tak ke un ki sawari un ko lekar seedhi khari ho jati; main ne un ko dekha ke woh yeh chamre ki naalain pehente the aur inhi me wuzu karte the; main ne un ko dekha ke woh is Ghar me se sirf in do ruknon ko chhute the; aur main ne un ko dekha ke woh apni dadhi ko peele rang se rangte the."
"667","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ubaydullah ibn Umar ne hum se sattar saal se zyada pehle bayan kiya, Nafi se, Ibn Umar se, unhon ne kaha: Umar Nabi Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ke paas aaye aur kaha: Ae Allah ke Rasool, mujhe aisa maal mila hai jaisa maine kabhi nahi paya, Khaybar me sau hisse, aur main is ke zariye Allah ka qurb chahta hun, Nabi Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya: Ae Umar, asl ko rok kar rakho aur us ki paidawar ko sadqe me de do."
"668","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abdullah ibn Dinar ne hum se bayan kiya, Ibn Umar se, unhon ne kaha: Rasool Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne Ahl-e-Hijr ke bare me farmaya: In azab diye gaye logon ke paas rote hue ke siwa dakhil na ho; agar tum rote hue na ho to un ke paas dakhil na ho, kyunke mujhe dar hai ke jo un par aaya woh tum par aa jaye."
"669","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ibn Jurayj ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Main Nafi ke paas aaya, aur unhon ne ek thaila rakh diya aur main us par baith gaya, aur unhon ne mujhe meri takhtiyon par imla karaya, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Abdullah ibn Umar ko kehte suna: Rasool Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya: Jab do fareeq tijarat karein to un me se har ek ko ikhtiyar hai jab tak woh juda na ho jayein, magar yeh ke un ki bai shart-e-khiyar par ho, unhon ne kaha: Aur Ibn Umar jab koi kharidari karte aur use lazim karna chahte to thora sa chal kar phir wapas aate."
"670","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abdullah ibn Dinar ne hum se bayan kiya ke unhon ne Abdullah ibn Umar ko kehte suna: Rasool Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya: Do bai karne walon me se har ek ko ikhtiyar hai jab tak woh juda na ho jayein, magar yeh ke un ki bai shart-e-khiyar par ho; aur agar woh shart-e-khiyar par ho to woh lazim ho gayi."
"671","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abdullah ibn Dinar ne hum se bayan kiya ke unhon ne Abdullah ibn Umar ko kehte hue suna: Rasulullah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya: Jab koi Yahudi tumhen salam kare to woh sirf kehta hai: As-sam alaikum, to tum kaho: Wa alaikum. Abdullah ibn Dinar ne kaha: Ek Yahudi shakhs tha jo phir Musalman ho gaya, aur woh Ibn Umar ko salam karta tha, aur jab Ibn Umar us ke salam ka jawab dete to Wa alaikum kehne se zyada kuch izafa na karte; to woh shakhs kehta: Ae Abu Abd al-Rahman, main Musalman ho gaya hun, phir bhi woh Wa alaikum kehne se zyada kuch izafa na karte."
"672","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abdullah ibn Dinar ne hum se bayan kiya ke unhon ne Ibn Umar ko kehte hue suna: Umar ne Rasulullah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam se pucha: Kya hum mein se koi shakhs halat-e-janabat mein so sakta hai? Aap ne farmaya: Haan, jab woh wuzu kar le, aur agar chahe to kha bhi sakta hai."
"673","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abdullah ibn Dinar ne hum se bayan kiya ke unhon ne Ibn Umar ko kehte hue suna: Maine Rasulullah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ko dekha ke Aap har hafta Quba paidal aur sawar tashreef late the, aur maine Ibn Umar ko dekha ke woh har hafta Quba sawar aur paidal ate the."
"674","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Musa ibn Uqbah ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Maine Salim ibn Abdullah ko kehte hue suna: Maine Ibn Umar ko kehte hue suna: Ye Al-Bayda hai jis ke bare mein tum Rasulullah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam par jhoot bolte ho; Allah ki qasam, Rasulullah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne sirf Zul-Hulaifa ki masjid ke paas se ihram bandha tha."
"675","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ayyub al-Sakhtiyani ne hum se bayan kiya, Nafi se, Ibn Umar se, unhon ne kaha: Maine Rasulullah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ko farmate hue suna: Hazir hun, Ae Allah, hazir hun; hazir hun, Tera koi shareek nahin, hazir hun; beshak hamd aur ne'mat Tere hi liye hai, aur badshahat; Tera koi shareek nahin. Unhon ne kaha: Aur Abdullah ibn Umar izafa karte hue kehte: Hazir hun, hazir hun, hazir hun, aur Teri khidmat mein; hazir hun, aur bhalai Tere hathon mein hai. Yehi hai jo Sufyan kaha karte the: Hazir hun, aur raghbat aur amal Teri taraf hai."
"676","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Asim ibn Muhammad al-Umari ne hum se bayan kiya, apne walid se, Abdullah ibn Umar se, ke Rasulullah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya: Agar log tanhai ke bare mein woh jante jo main janta hun, to koi sawar kabhi raat mein akela safar na karta."
"677","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Muhammad ibn Ishaq ne hum se bayan kiya, Nafi se, Ibn Umar se: ke Munqidh ko zamana-e-jahiliyat mein sar par ek zakhm laga jo dimagh tak pahunch gaya, jis se us ki zaban mutassir hui, aur jab woh saudaa karta to len-den mein dhoka kha jata. Rasulullah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne us se farmaya: Saudaa kar, aur keh: Dhoka nahin, aur phir tujhe teen din tak ikhtiyar hasil hai. Ibn Umar ne kaha: Pas maine use saudaa karte hue suna, kehte hue: La khidhabah."
"678","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Mamar ne hamen khabar di, al-Zuhri se, Salim se, apne walid se, ke Rasulullah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya: Tum logon ko sau oonton ki tarah paoge jin mein mushkil se koi sawari ke qabil oont hoga."
"679","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ubaydullah ibn Umar ne hum se bayan kiya, Nafi se, Ibn Umar se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya: Tum mein se koi shakhs kisi shakhs ko us ki jagah se utha kar phir khud wahan na baithe; balke wus'at aur kushadgi paida karo."
"680","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sadaqah ibn Yasar ne hum se bayan kiya, Nafi se: ke Ibn Umar Makkah aur Madinah ke darmiyan ek darakht ke paas se guzarte jis ke neeche Nabi Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam saya farmaya karte the, aur woh door daraz jagah se us ke liye pani late yahan tak ke us ke neeche daal dete."
"681","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: main ne Ubaydullah ibn Umar ko kai martaba kehte hue suna, unhon ne kaha: main ne Nafi ko kehte hue suna: main ne Abdullah ibn Umar ko kehte hue suna: main raat ya din me jis waqt woh chahe kisi ko namaz parhne se mana nahi karta, lekin main sirf waisa hi karta hun jaisa main ne apne sathiyon ko karte hue dekha; aur Allah ke Rasul Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya: Apni namaz ke liye suraj ke tulu hone ya us ke ghurub hone ka qasd na karo. Sufyan se kaha gaya: Ye Hisham se riwayat kiya jata hai. Unhon ne kaha: main ne Hisham ko is ka zikr karte hue kabhi nahi suna."
"682","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ibn Jurayj ne hum se bayan kiya, Nafi se, unhon ne kaha: main ne Ibn Umar ko Al-Safa par ek jagah khare hue dekha, aur Allah ki qasam mera khayal hai ke unhon ne Allah ke Rasul Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ko us me khare hue dekha tha."
"683","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Amr ibn Dinar ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: hum ne Ibn Umar se us shakhs ke bare me pucha jis ne umrah kiya aur Baitullah ka saat pheron se tawaf kiya lekin Al-Safa aur Al-Marwah ke darmiyan sai nahi ki: kya woh apni biwi ke paas ja sakta hai? Ibn Umar ne kaha: Allah ke Rasul Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam aaye aur Baitullah ka saat pheron se tawaf kiya, Maqam ke peeche do rakaten namaz parhi, aur Al-Safa aur Al-Marwah ke darmiyan sai ki, aur farmaya: Allah ne farmaya: Beshak tumhare liye Allah ke Rasul me behtareen namuna hai."
"684","Amr ne kaha: hum ne Jabir ibn Abdullah se pucha, to unhon ne kaha: woh aurat us ke qareeb na jaye jab tak woh Al-Safa aur Al-Marwah ke darmiyan sai na kar le."
"685","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Amr ibn Dinar ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ibn Umar se kaha gaya: Abu Nuhayk, Makkah ke logon me se ek shakhs, bahut zyada khana khata hai. Ibn Umar ne kaha: Allah ke Rasul Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya: Momin ek aant se khata hai, jabke kafir saat aanton se khata hai. Phir us shakhs ne kaha: Raha main, to main Allah aur Us ke Rasul par iman rakhta hun."
"686","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Amr ibn Dinar ne hum se bayan kiya, Salim ibn Abdullah se, un ke walid se, ke Allah ke Rasul Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya: Jab ghulam do aadmiyon ke darmiyan mushtarak ho aur un me se ek apna hissa azad kar de, to agar woh maal-dar ho to us par buland tareen qeemat se, ya unhon ne kaha: munsifana qeemat se na kam lagayi hui na zyada barhayi hui, muqaddar lagaya jayega, phir woh apne shareek ko us ke hisse ka muawza dega, phir woh mukammal tor par azad ho jayega. Sufyan ne kaha: Amr is tarah is me shak kiya karte the."
"687","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Amr ibn Dinar ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: main ne Said ibn Jubayr ko kehte hue suna: main ne Ibn Umar ko kehte hue suna: main ne Allah ke Rasul Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ko lian karne wale dono se kehte hue suna: Tumhara hisab Allah ke paas hai; tum me se ek jhuta hai; tumhare liye us aurat tak koi rasta nahi. Unhon ne kaha: Ai Allah ke Rasul, mera maal, mera maal. Unhon ne farmaya: Maal ka tumhe koi dawa nahi; agar tum ne us ke bare me sach kaha to ye us ke badle hai jo tum ne us ki sharmgah ko halal kiya, aur agar tum ne us ke bare me jhut kaha to ye tumhare liye us se aur bhi door hai."
"688","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ayyub al-Sakhtiyani ne hum se bayan kiya ke unhon ne Said ibn Jubayr ko kehte hue suna: main ne Ibn Umar se pucha, kehte hue: Ai Abu Abd al-Rahman, ek shakhs ne apni biwi se lian kiya. Ibn Umar ne mujh se apne hath se kaha, is tarah apni shahadat aur darmiyani ungli se: Allah ke Rasul Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne Banu Ajlan ke do bhaiyon me tafreeq kar di aur farmaya: Allah janta hai ke tum me se ek jhuta hai, to kya tum me se koi tauba karne wala hai? Sufyan ne kaha: Ayyub ne pehle hum se ise Amr ki majlis me bayan kiya tha, phir Amr ne un ki ye hadith bayan ki, aur Ayyub ne un se kaha: Tum, ai Abu Muhammad, ise mujh se behtar bayan karte ho."
"689","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Amr ibn Dinar ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: main ne Ismail al-Shaybani ko kehte hue suna: main ne apne khajur ke darakhton ke upar jo tha use sau wasq khajuron ke badle becha; agar zyada nikle to un ka tha, aur agar kam nikle to un ke zimme tha. To main ne Ibn Umar se is ke bare me pucha, to unhon ne kaha: Allah ke Rasul Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne is se mana farmaya, siwa is ke ke unhon ne araya ki ijazat di."
"690","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: hum se Amr ne al-Zuhri se mulaqat se pehle bayan kiya, al-Zuhri se, Salim se, un ke walid se, unhon ne kaha: main ne Allah ke Rasul Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ko Jumuah ki namaz ke baad do rakaten parhte hue dekha, aur main ne unhe Zuhr se pehle do rakaten aur us ke baad do rakaten, Maghrib ke baad do, aur Isha ke baad do parhte hue dekha. Ibn Umar ne kaha: Aur mujh se zikr kiya gaya, halanke main ne nahi dekha, ke Nabi Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam jab fajr tulu hoti to do rakaten parha karte the."
"691","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Amr ibn Dinar ne hum se bayan kiya, Ibn Umar se, unhon ne farmaya: Hum Nabi Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ke sath ek safar mein thay, aur main Umar ke ek sarkash naujawan oont par sawar tha; woh mujh par ghalib aa jata aur logon se aage nikal jata, to Umar usay rokte aur wapas lautate, phir woh phir aage nikal jata aur Umar usay rokte aur wapas lautate; Nabi Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne Umar se farmaya: Isay mere hath bech do; unhon ne arz kiya: Yeh aap ka hai, Ae Allah ke Rasool; Aap ne farmaya: Isay mere hath bech do; pas unhon ne usay Rasool Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ke hath bech diya, aur Nabi Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya: Yeh tumhara hai, Ae Abdullah ibn Umar, is ke sath jo chaho karo."
"692","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Ayyub ibn Musa ne hum se bayan kiya, Nafi se, Ibn Umar se, unhon ne farmaya: Rasool Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne sone ki ek anguthi banwai, phir usay phenk diya, aur chandi ki ek anguthi banwai jis ka nagina usi mein se tha, aur us ke nagine ko hatheli ke andar ki taraf rakha, aur us par naqsh farmaya: Muhammad, Rasool Allah; aur us par naqsh karne se mana farmaya; aur yehi woh hai jo Muayqib se Aris ke kunwen mein giri."
"693","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Ibn Abi Najih ne hum se bayan kiya, Mujahid se, unhon ne farmaya: Main Ibn Umar ke sath Al-Thaniyyah tak gaya aur main ne un se Rasool Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam se riwayat karte hue ek hadith ke siwa kuch na suna; unhon ne farmaya: Hum Nabi Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ke sath thay aur khajoor ke darakht ka guda laya gaya, to Aap ne farmaya: Main ek darakht ko janta hun jis ki misal Musalman aadmi ki misal jaisi hai; mere dil mein aaya ke woh khajoor ka darakht hai, aur main bolna chahta tha, phir main ne dekha ke main logon mein sab se chhota hun, to main khamosh raha; Nabi Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya: Woh khajoor ka darakht hai."
"694","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Sufyan ne Abdullah ibn Dinar se riwayat kiya, Ibn Umar se, unhon ne farmaya: Umar ne mujh se farmaya: Kash tum ne woh keh diya hota to woh mere nazdeek falan falan se zyada mehboob hota, ya unhon ne farmaya: surkh oonton se zyada mehboob hota."
"695","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Ayyub ibn Musa, Ubaydullah ibn Umar aur Ayyub al-Sakhtiyani ne hum se bayan kiya; unhon ne Nafi ko farmate hue suna: Ibn Umar ne umrah ka ihram bandha jab woh Madinah se rawana hue, farmate hue: Agar mujhe roka gaya to main waisa hi karunga jaisa Rasool Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne kiya; jab woh Al-Bayda pahunche to farmaya: Un ka muamla to ek hi hai; main tumhen gawah banata hun ke main ne apne umrah ke sath Hajj ko lazim kar liya hai; unhon ne farmaya: Phir woh Makkah pahunche, Baitullah ka saat martaba tawaf kiya, Maqam ke peeche do rakat namaz parhi, aur Al-Safa aur Al-Marwah ke darmiyan sai ki, phir farmaya: Main ne Rasool Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ko isi tarah karte hue dekha; Ayyub ibn Musa ne hadith mein izafa kiya: Jab woh Qudayd pahunche to wahan qurbani ka janwar kharida aur usay sath hank kar le gaye."
"696","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Ayyub ibn Musa ne hum se bayan kiya, Nafi se, Ibn Umar se, unhon ne farmaya: Rasool Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne Utarid par dhari daar reshmi chogha dekha aur usay us ke liye napasand farmaya aur usay us se mana farmaya; phir Aap ne Umar ko usi jaisa tohfe mein ata farmaya; unhon ne arz kiya: Ae Allah ke Rasool, Aap ne Utarid ke choghe ke bare mein jo farmaya so farmaya, phir bhi aap mujhe yeh tohfe mein de rahe hain; Aap ne farmaya: Main ne yeh tumhen pehenne ke liye nahin diya; main ne to yeh tumhen aurton ko pehnane ke liye diya hai."
"697","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Ibn Abi Najih ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Main ne Ismail ibn Abd al-Rahman ibn Abi Dhuayb al-Asadi ko farmate hue suna: Hum Ibn Umar ke sath Al-Hima ki taraf nikle; jab suraj ghurub hua to hum ne un se kehne mein jhijhak ki: Utariye aur namaz parhiye; jab shafaq ghaib hui to woh utre aur humen Maghrib parhai, teen rakat, phir salam phera, aur Isha do rakat parhi, phir hamari taraf mutawajjah hue aur farmaya: Main ne Rasool Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ko isi tarah karte hue dekha; Sufyan ne farmaya: Ibn Abi Najih jab yeh hadith bayan karte to aksar is mein yeh na kehte: Jab shafaq ghaib hui; woh kehte: Jab ufaq ki safedi chali gayi aur Isha ki tariki aa gayi, to woh utre aur namaz parhi; to main ne un se is ke bare mein kaha, to unhon ne farmaya: Ismail ne to sirf kaha: Shafaq ghaib hui; lekin main isay napasand karta hun, is liye main is tarah kehta hun, kyun ke Mujahid ne hum se bayan kiya ke al-shafaq din hai; Sufyan ne farmaya: Pas main ek martaba is tarah riwayat karta hun, aur dusri martaba is tarah."
"698","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Ibn Abi Najih ne hum se bayan kiya, apne walid se, ek aadmi se: Ke ek aadmi ne Ibn Umar se Yaum-e-Arafah ke roze ke bare mein pucha; Ibn Umar ne farmaya: Main ne Rasool Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ke sath Hajj kiya aur Aap ne us din roza na rakha; main ne Abu Bakr ke sath Hajj kiya aur unhon ne us din roza na rakha; main ne Umar ke sath Hajj kiya aur unhon ne us din roza na rakha; main ne Uthman ke sath Hajj kiya aur unhon ne us din roza na rakha; aur na main us din roza rakhta hun, na us ka hukm deta hun, na us se mana karta hun."
"699","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Amr ne hum se bayan kiya, Abu al-Thawrayn al-Jumahi se, unhon ne farmaya: Main ne Ibn Umar se Yaum-e-Arafah ke roze ke bare mein pucha, to unhon ne mujhe us se mana farmaya."
"700","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Ismail ibn Umayyah ne hum se bayan kiya, Nafi se, Ibn Umar se, unhon ne farmaya: Rasool Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya: Tum mein se koi dusre aadmi ke maweshiyon ka doodh us ki ijazat ke baghair na dohe; kya tum mein se koi yeh pasand karega ke koi us ke godam ke darwaze par aaye, us ka darwaza tor de, aur us ka ghalla bikher de; un ka zakhira shuda ghalla to un ke maweshiyon ke thanon mein hi hai."
"701","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ismail ibn Umayyah ne hum se bayan kiya, Nafi se, Ibn Umar se, unhon ne kaha: Allah ke Rasul Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne ghoron ke darmiyan daud ka muqabla karwaya, Aap ne un mein se jo sadhe hue the unhein Al-Hafya se Banu Zurayq ki masjid tak rawana kiya aur jo sadhe hue nahin the unhein Thaniyyat al-Wada se Banu Zurayq ki masjid tak rawana kiya, Ibn Umar ne kaha: Aur main un logon mein se tha jinhon ne daud lagayi aur mera ghora mujhe lekar ek ghaati mein ghus gaya aur mujhe gira diya."
"702","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, Musa ibn Uqbah se, Nafi se, Ibn Umar se: ke Nabi Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne Banu al-Nadir ke maal ko katwaya aur jalwaya, Sufyan ne kaha: Maine ise un se nahin suna."
"703","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ismail ibn Umayyah ne hum se bayan kiya, Nafi se, Ibn Umar se, unhon ne kaha: Allah ke Rasul Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam Umar se mile jabke woh apne safar mein keh rahe the: Mere baap ki qasam, mere baap ki qasam, Aap ne farmaya: Beshak Allah tumhein apne baapon ki qasam khane se mana farmata hai, jo qasam khana chahe to Allah ki qasam khaye ya khamosh rahe."
"704","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Yazid ibn Abi Ziyad ne hum se bayan kiya, Abd al-Rahman ibn Abi Layla se, Ibn Umar se, unhon ne kaha: Allah ke Rasul Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne ek dasta rawana kiya, unhon ne dushman ka samna kiya to log shikast khakar bhaag gaye, hum Madinah aaye aur us mein chhup gaye, kehte hue: Ai Allah ke Rasul, hum bhag jane wale hain, to Allah ke Rasul Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya: Balke tum ladayi ki taraf palat kar aane wale ho aur main tumhara pusht-panah hun."
"705","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Muhammad ibn Suqah ne hum se bayan kiya, Muhammad ibn Ali se, ke unhon ne unhein kehte hue suna: Ibn Umar jab koi baat sunte to na us mein izafa karte na kami karte, na us se aage badhkar kisi aur baat ki taraf jate na us se kam par rehte, Ubayd ibn Umayr ne bayan kiya jabke Ibn Umar baithe hue the ke Nabi Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya: Munafiq ki misaal us bakri ki tarah hai jo do rewadon ke darmiyan ho, ek baar ise ye takkar marta hai aur ek baar wo takkar marta hai, Ibn Umar ne kaha: Bakrion ke do baithne ki jagahon ke darmiyan, un se kaha gaya: Ai Abu Abd al-Rahman, do baithne ki jagahon aur do rewadon ke darmiyan ek hi baat hai, lekin Ibn Umar ne do baithne ki jagahon ke siwa kisi baat par israar nahin kiya jaisa unhon ne suna tha."
"706","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ayyub al-Sakhtiyani ne hum se bayan kiya, Said ibn Jubayr se, Ibn Umar se, unhon ne kaha: Allah ke Rasul Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne reham mein jo hamal hai us ke hamal ki bai se mana farmaya."
"707","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ayyub al-Sakhtiyani ne hum se bayan kiya, Nafi se, Ibn Umar se, unhon ne kaha: Allah ke Rasul Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya: Jo qasam khaye aur kahe: Agar Allah Taala ne chaha, to us ne istisna kar liya."
"708","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ayyub al-Sakhtiyani ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Maine Nafi ko kehte hue suna: Maine Ibn Umar ko kehte hue suna: Umar ne zamanah-e-jahiliyat mein Masjid-e-Haram mein ek raat ke itikaf ki nazar mani thi, to unhon ne Allah ke Rasul Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam se pucha to Aap ne unhein ek raat itikaf karne aur apni nazar puri karne ka hukm farmaya."
"709","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ayyub ne hum se bayan kiya, Nafi se, Ibn Umar se, unhon ne kaha: Allah ke Rasul Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam Fatah ke din Makkah mein Usamah ibn Zayd ke oont par sawar hokar dakhil hue yahan tak ke usay Kaabah ke sahan mein bithaya, phir Uthman ibn Talhah ko chabi ke liye bulwaya to woh apni walida ke paas gaye lekin unhon ne unhein dene se inkar kar diya, unhon ne kaha: Tum mujhe zaroor dogi warna meri kamar se talwar zaroor niklegi, to unhon ne unhein chabi de di aur unhon ne darwaza khola, Allah ke Rasul Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam dakhil hue, Aap ke sath Usamah ibn Zayd, Bilal aur Uthman ibn Talhah the, aur unhon ne kuch der ke liye darwaza un par band kar liya, main ek taqatwar naujawan tha to jab darwaza khola gaya main jaldi se darwaze par pahuncha aur Bilal mujhe mile, maine kaha: Ai Bilal, Nabi Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne kahan namaz padhi, unhon ne kaha: Do agle sutunon ke darmiyan, aur main un se ye puchna bhul gaya ke unhon ne kitni padhin."
"710","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Misar ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Maine Simak al-Hanafi ko kehte hue suna: Maine Ibn Umar se Baitullah mein namaz ke bare mein pucha to unhon ne kaha: Us mein namaz padho kyunke Allah ke Rasul Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne us mein namaz padhi hai, aur ek aur aayega jo tumhein rokega to us ki baat na manna, to main Ibn Abbas ke paas gaya aur un se pucha to unhon ne kaha: Us ke tamam hisse ki taraf rukh karo aur us ka koi hissa apne peeche na chhodo."
"711","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ayyub ne hum se bayan kiya, Nafi se, Ibn Umar se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne humein Najd ki taraf ek sariya mein bheja, to hamare hisse mein barah barah oont aaye, aur humein ek ek oont nafal ke taur par zyada diya gaya."
"712","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ayyub ne hum se bayan kiya, Nafi se, unhon ne kaha: Ibn Umar ko halat-e-ehram mein sardi lagi, to unhon ne Nafi se kaha: Mere upar koi cheez daal do, to maine un par ek burnus daal diya, to woh naraz hue aur kaha: Tum ne mere upar use daal diya halanke maine tumhein bataya tha ke Rasulullah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne is se mana farmaya hai?"
"713","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ayyub ne hum se bayan kiya, Nafi se, Ibn Umar se: ke Rasulullah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne ek Yahudi mard aur ek Yahudi aurat ko sangsar farmaya, Ibn Umar ne kaha: Aur maine dekha ke Aap apne hath se us aurat ko aar de rahe the."
"714","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ayyub ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Maine Nafi ko kehte hue suna: Maine Ibn Umar ko kehte hue suna: Rasulullah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya: Koi Musalman shakhs jiske paas maal ho jis mein wasiyyat wajib hoti ho, use do raatein na guzarni chahiyen magar uski wasiyyat uske paas likhi hui ho."
"715","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya: Ayyub ne hum se bayan kiya, Nafi se, Ibn Umar se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya: Jab koi shakhs apne bhai ko kafir qarar de to un dono mein se ek par yaqeenan ye baat waqe ho gayi hai."
"716","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ayyub ne hum se bayan kiya, Nafi se, Ibn Umar se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya: Quran ko dushman ki sarzameen ki taraf safar mein na le jaya jaye, kahin dushman use haasil na kar le."
"717","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ayyub ne hum se bayan kiya, Nafi se: ke Ibn Umar ne Dajnan mein barish wali raat mein namaz ke liye iqamat kahi, phir kaha: Apne gharon mein namaz parho, Aap Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam barish wali raat ya sard hawa wali raat mein apne muazzin ko hukm farmate the ke woh elaan kare: Beshak apne gharon mein namaz parho."
"718","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ayyub ne hum se bayan kiya, Nafi se, Ibn Umar se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya: Fitr ka sadqa ek sa jau ya ek sa khajoor hai, Ibn Umar ne kaha: Phir jab Muawiyah aaye to logon ne aadha sa gehon ko ek sa jau ke barabar qarar diya, Nafi ne kaha: Aur Ibn Umar apne ghar walon mein se chhote aur bade, aazad aur ghulam ki taraf se fitr ka sadqa ada karte the."
"719","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ali ibn Zayd ibn Judan ne hum se bayan kiya ke unhon ne al-Qasim ibn Rabiah se suna, Ibn Umar se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne Makkah ki fatah ke din Kaba ki seedhiyon par farmaya: Tamam tareef Allah ke liye hai jis ne apna wada poora kiya, apne bande ki madad farmayi, aur akele hi ahzab ko shikast di, beshak amdan qatl jo khata se mushabeh ho, kode ya laathi ke sath, us mein sau oont hain, mushaddad, un mein se chalis haamla oontniyan jo apne peton mein apne bachche uthaye hue hon, beshak daur-e-jahiliyyat ka har imtiyaz, chahe khoon ho ya maal, mere in dono qadmon ke neeche hai, siwaye Baitullah ki darbaani ya hajiyon ko paani pilane ke, kyunke maine unhein unke ahl ke liye usi tarah barqarar rakha hai jaise woh thein."
"720","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Suayr ibn al-Khums al-Tamimi ne hum se bayan kiya, Habib ibn Abi Thabit se, Ibn Umar se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya: Islam paanch cheezon par qayem kiya gaya hai: gawahi ke Allah ke siwa koi mabood nahin aur Muhammad Allah ke Rasul hain, namaz qayem karna, zakat dena, Ramazan ke mahine ka roza rakhna, aur Baitullah ka Hajj karna, Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se ek dafa Suayr aur Misar se bayan kiya, phir maine uske baad Sufyan ko Misar ka zikr karte hue kabhi nahin suna."
"721","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Amr ibn Dinar ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ibn Umar ne Nawwas ke shareek se laghar oont khareede, phir jab Nawwas aaya to us ne apne shareek se kaha: Tum ne inhen kise becha? To us ne us ke samne Ibn Umar ka huliya bayan kiya, to us ne kaha: Tera bura ho, ye to Ibn Umar hain, pas Nawwas Ibn Umar ke paas aaya aur kaha: Mere shareek ne aap ko laghar oont bech diye hain aur wo aap ko pehchanta na tha, unhon ne kaha: Phir inhen le lo, phir jab wo inhen lene laga to unhon ne kaha: Inhen chhor do, hum Rasool Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ke faisle par raazi hain: Koi adwa nahin, Sufyan ne kaha: Amr ne kaha: Nawwas Ibn Umar ke paas baitha karta tha aur unhen hansata tha, ek din us ne kaha: Kaash Abu Qubays mere liye sona hota, Ibn Umar ne us se kaha: Tum is ka kya karoge? Us ne kaha: Main is par mar jaunga, to Ibn Umar hans pare."
"722","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Amr ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Abu al-Abbas nabina se suna, wo kehte the: Main ne Abdullah ibn Umar ibn al-Khattab ko kehte suna: Jab Rasool Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne Ahl-e-Taif ka muhasira kiya to Aap ne farmaya: Hum In Sha Allah kal subah wapas laut jayenge, unhon ne kaha: Ae Allah ke Rasool, kya aap ise fatah kiye baghair wapas chale jayenge? To Rasool Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya: Phir kal subah In Sha Allah Taala ladai ke liye niklo, unhon ne kaha: Pas wo subah ladai ke liye nikle aur unhen sakht zakham lage, to Rasool Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya: Hum In Sha Allah kal subah wapas laut jayenge, goya unhon ne isi ko pasand kiya aur isi ki taraf mail hue, unhon ne kaha: Pas Rasool Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam hans pare."
"723","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ibrahim ibn Maysarah ne hum se bayan kiya, Tawus se, unhon ne kaha: Main Abdullah ibn Umar ke paas baitha tha, aur ek aadmi aaya aur kaha: Kya Rasool Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne ghade aur tumbe ki nabeedh se mana farmaya tha? Unhon ne kaha: Ji haan."
"724","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Yahya ibn Said ne hum se bayan kiya, Nafi se, Ibn Umar se, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Rasool Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ko mimbar par dekha to main Aap ki baat sunne ke liye Aap ki taraf jaldi gaya, lekin main Aap tak na pahunch saka yahan tak ke Aap neeche tashreef le aaye, main ne logon se poocha: Aap ne kya farmaya? Unhon ne kaha: Aap ne tumbe aur roghan lage bartan se mana farmaya."
"725","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ayyub al-Sakhtiyani ne hum se bayan kiya, Mujahid se, Abd al-Rahman ibn Abi Layla se, Kab ibn Ujrah se, unhon ne kaha: Rasool Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam Al-Hudaybiyah me mere paas se guzre jabke main ek haandi ya degchi ke neeche aag jala raha tha aur juen mere sar se gir rahi thin, Aap ne farmaya: Ae Kab, kya tumhare hawamm tumhen takleef de rahe hain? Main ne kaha: Ji haan, Aap ne farmaya: Phir apna sar mundwao aur qurbani do, ya teen din roze rakho, ya chhe miskeenon me ek faraq khana khilao."
"726","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ibn Abi Najih ne hum se bayan kiya, Mujahid se, Abd al-Rahman ibn Abi Layla se, Kab ibn Ujrah se, Nabi Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam se isi ki manind, siwa is ke ke unhon ne kaha: Haandi ke neeche aag jalate hue, aur kaha: Aur ek bakri zibah karo."
"727","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Yazid ibn Abi Ziyad ne hum se bayan kiya, Abd al-Rahman ibn Abi Layla se, Kab ibn Ujrah se, unhon ne kaha: Rasool Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne hamen Aap par durood padhna sikhaya, farmaya: Kaho: Ae Allah, Muhammad aur Aal-e-Muhammad par rehmat nazil farma jaisi Tune Ibrahim aur Aal-e-Ibrahim par rehmat nazil farmai, beshak Tu Qabil-e-Tareef, Buzurg hai, Ae Allah, Muhammad aur Aal-e-Muhammad par barkat nazil farma jaisi Tune Ibrahim aur Aal-e-Ibrahim par barkat nazil farmai, beshak Tu Qabil-e-Tareef, Buzurg hai."
"728","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Aur Abd al-Karim Abu Umayyah ne mujh se bayan kiya, Mujahid se, Abd al-Rahman ibn Abi Layla se, Kab ibn Ujrah se, Nabi Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam se isi ki manind."
"729","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Yafur al-Abdi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Main Abdullah ibn Abi Awfa ke paas gaya aur un se tidiyon ke khane ke bare me poocha, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Rasool Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ke hamrah chhe ya saat ghazwat me shirkat ki aur hum tidiyan khaya karte the."
"730","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Ishaq al-Shaybani ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Abdullah ibn Abi Awfa ko kehte suna: Main Nabi Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ke hamrah ek safar me tha aur Aap ne ek aadmi se farmaya: Utro aur mere liye sattu gholao, us ne kaha: Ae Allah ke Rasool, abhi din baqi hai, Aap ne farmaya: Utro aur mere liye gholao, us ne kaha: Ae Allah ke Rasool, abhi din baqi hai, Aap ne farmaya: Utro aur gholao, pas wo utra aur us ne Aap ke liye gholaya aur Nabi Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne piya, phir Aap ne apne haath se mashriq ki taraf ishara kiya aur farmaya: Jab tum raat ko idhar se aate dekho to rozedar ne iftar kar liya."
"731","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Abu Ishaq al-Shaybani ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Maine Abdullah ibn Abi Awfa ko farmate hue suna: Rasool Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne sabz martaban aur safed martaban se peene se mana farmaya. Sufyan ne farmaya: Aur teesre se, jo main bhool gaya hoon."
"732","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya: Abu Ishaq al-Shaybani ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Maine Abdullah ibn Abi Awfa ko farmate hue suna: Hum ne Khaybar ke din basti se bahar gadhe pakre aur unhen zibah kiya, aur handiyan un se josh maar rahi thin, jab Nabi Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ke munadi ne pukara: Handiyon ko jo kuch un mein hai us samet ulta do. Pas hum ne unhen ulta diya jabke woh josh maar rahi thin. Abu Ishaq ne farmaya: Main Said ibn Jubayr se mila aur un se is ka zikr kiya, to unhon ne farmaya: Woh to gandagi khane wale gadhe the, is liye Nabi Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne un se mana farmaya."
"733","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Yazid Abu Khalid al-Dalani aur Misar ibn Kidam ne hum se bayan kiya, Ibrahim al-Saksaki se, woh Abdullah ibn Abi Awfa se: ke ek shakhs ne Nabi Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam se arz kiya: Mujhe sikhaiye, Ae Allah ke Rasool, koi cheez jo main kahoon jo mujhe Quran ke badle kaafi ho. Nabi Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya: Kaho: Subhan Allah, Alhamdulillah, La ilaha illallah, aur Allahu Akbar. Sufyan ne farmaya: Main sirf itna janta hoon ke unhon ne farmaya, unhon ne farmaya: Aur La hawla wa la quwwata illa billah."
"734","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Ibrahim ibn Muslim al-Hajari ne hum se bayan kiya: ke unhon ne Abdullah ibn Abi Awfa ko apni ek beti ke janaze par dekha, ek khacchar par sawar jise un ke sath khincha ja raha tha, apne rehnuma se farmate hue: Main us ki nisbat kahan hoon? Jab un se kaha gaya: Us ke aage, to unhon ne farmaya: Thehro. Unhon ne farmaya: Aur maine unhen dekha, jab unhon ne us par namaz parhi, chaar takbeeren kahin, phir thodi der khare rahe, aur logon ne unhen tasbeeh se mutawajjeh kiya, phir unhon ne salam phera. Phir unhon ne farmaya: Kya tum ne samjha ke main chaar par izafa karunga, jabke maine Rasool Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ko chaar takbeeren kehte dekha hai? Aur unhon ne aurton ko noha karte suna aur unhen mana farmaya, farmaya: Maine Rasool Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ko noha se mana farmate hue suna hai."
"735","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Ismail ibn Abi Khalid ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Maine Abdullah ibn Abi Awfa ko farmate hue suna: Maine Rasool Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ko Ahzab ke din farmate hue suna: Ae Allah, Kitab nazil farmane wale, hisab mein tez, badalon ko harkat dene wale, ahzab ko shikast de; Ae Allah, unhen shikast de aur unhen hila de."
"736","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Ibn Abi Khalid ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Maine Abdullah ibn Abi Awfa se poocha: Kya Rasool Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne Khadijah ko Jannat mein khokhle moti ke ghar ki khushkhabri di thi, jis mein na shor hoga na mashaqqat? Unhon ne farmaya: Ji haan."
"737","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Ismail ibn Abi Khalid ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Maine Abdullah ibn Abi Awfa ko farmate hue suna: Hum ne Rasool Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ke sath umrah kiya, aur hum Aap ko ghera banaye hue the jab Aap tawaf farma rahe the, Makkah walon ke bachchon se, taake woh Aap ko takleef na pahunchayen. Sufyan ne farmaya: Mera khayal hai ke woh umrah al-qaza tha. Ismail ne farmaya: Aur Ibn Abi Awfa ne humein ek zakhm dikhaya jo unhen Nabi Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ke sath Hunayn ke din laga tha."
"738","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Malik ibn Mighwal ne hum se bayan kiya, Talhah ibn Musarrif se, unhon ne farmaya: Maine Abdullah ibn Abi Awfa se poocha: Kya Rasool Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne waseeyat farmayi thi? Unhon ne farmaya: Rasool Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne koi aisi cheez nahin chhori jis ke bare mein waseeyat ki jaye. Maine arz kiya: Logon ko waseeyat ka hukm dene ke bawajood Aap ne khud waseeyat kyun nahin farmayi? Unhon ne farmaya: Unhon ne Kitab Allah ki waseeyat farmayi. Talhah ne farmaya: Al-Huzayl ibn Shurahbil ne farmaya: Kya Abu Bakr Rasool Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ke wasee par muqaddam kiye jayenge? Abu Bakr chahte ke unhen Rasool Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ki taraf se koi ahad mil jata jis se woh un ki naak mein nakel dalte."
"739","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Abu Ishaq al-Hamdani ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Maine al-Bara ibn Azib ko farmate hue suna: Rasool Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam apne sone ki jagah par farmaya karte the, ya unhon ne hukm farmaya ke sone ki jagah par kaha jaye, ya unhon ne mujhe hukm farmaya ke main apne sone ki jagah par kahoon - Sufyan ne is mein shak kiya, woh nahin jante ke unhon ne in mein se kaun sa farmaya: Ae Allah, maine apna chehra Teri taraf pher diya, maine apne aap ko Tere supurd kar diya, maine apna mamla Tere hawale kar diya, aur maine apni peeth Teri taraf laga di, Teri umeed aur Tere khauf ke sath; Tere siwa na koi panah hai na nijaat magar Teri taraf; main iman laya Teri Kitab par jo Tune nazil farmayi aur Tere Nabi par jise Tune bheja. Logon ne un se arz kiya: Aur Tere Rasool par jise Tune bheja, to unhon ne inkar kiya magar: Aur Tere Nabi par."
"740","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Yazid ibn Abi Ziyad ne Makkah mein hum se bayan kiya, Abd al-Rahman ibn Abi Layla se, woh al-Bara ibn Azib se, unhon ne farmaya: Maine Rasool Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ko dekha ke Aap ne apne donon hath uthaye jab Aap ne namaz shuru ki. Sufyan ne farmaya: Phir woh Kufah aaye, aur maine unhen is riwayat ko is izafe ke sath bayan karte suna: Phir woh is ka iada nahin karte. Maine samjha ke logon ne unhen ye talkin kiya tha; kyunke Makkah mein us din un ka hafiza us din se behtar tha jis din maine unhen Kufah mein dekha tha, aur mujhe bataya gaya ke un ka hafiza badal gaya tha, ya un ka hafiza kharab ho gaya tha."
"741","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Aban ibn Taghlib ne hum se bayan kiya - aur woh fasih-ul-lisan thay - al-Hakam ibn Utaybah se, Abd al-Rahman ibn Abi Layla se, al-Bara ibn Azib se, unhon ne kaha: Hum me se koi na jhukta tha yahan tak ke woh Rasool Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ko sajde me girta hua dekh leta."
"742","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Yahya ibn Said aur Misar ibn Kidam ne hum se bayan kiya ke un dono ne Adi ibn Thabit ko al-Bara se riwayat karte hue suna, unhon ne kaha: Maine Rasool Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ko Maghrib me Wat-Teen waz-Zaitoon ki tilawat karte hue suna. Sufyan ne kaha: Misar ne izafa kiya: Maine un se zyada khush awaz qiraat karne wala koi shakhs kabhi nahi suna."
"743","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Amr ibn Dinar ne hum se bayan kiya ke unhon ne Abu al-Minhal se suna, unhon ne kaha: Mere ek shareek ne Kufa me dirham ke badle dirham zyadati ke sath farokht kiye. Maine kaha: Main isay halal nahi samajhta. Us ne kaha: Maine inhen bazaar me farokht kiya aur is par mujh par kisi ne aitraz nahi kiya. Pas main al-Bara ibn Azib ke paas gaya aur un se sawal kiya. Unhon ne kaha: Nabi Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam Madina tashreef laye jabke hamari tijarat isi tarah thi, to Aap ne farmaya: Jo dast-ba-dast ho us me koi harj nahi, aur jo udhar ho us me koi bhalai nahi. Aur Zayd ibn Arqam ke paas jao kyunke woh mujh se tijarat me zyada tajurbakar thay. Pas main un ke paas gaya aur un se is ka zikr kiya to unhon ne kaha: Al-Bara ne sach kaha. Al-Humaydi ne kaha: Yeh mansookh hai aur is par amal nahi kiya jata."
"744","Allah ke naam se jo Nihayat Meherban Nihayat Rehem Wala hai. Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Al-Zuhri ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Mujhe Humayd ibn Abd al-Rahman ne Abu Said al-Khudri se khabar di: ke Rasool Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne masjid ke qible me balgham dekha to ek kankari li aur use kMall diya, aur kisi aadmi ko apne samne ya apni dayen taraf thookne se mana farmaya, farmaya: Woh apne bayen taraf ya apne bayen paon ke neeche thooke."
"745","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Muhammad ibn Ajlan ne hum se bayan kiya ke unhon ne Iyad ibn Abdullah ibn Sad ibn Abi Sarh se suna: ke unhon ne Abu Said al-Khudri ko kehte hue suna: Rasool Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam in khajoor ki chhariyon ko pasand farmate thay, inhen apne hath me liye rehte aur inhen hath me liye masjid me dakhil hote. Aap ne masjid ke qible me balgham dekha to use kMall diya, phir ghusse me logon ki taraf mutawajjeh hue aur farmaya: Kya tum me se koi ye pasand karega ke us ke chehre par thooka jaye. Phir farmaya: Jab banda namaz ke liye khada hota hai to woh sirf apne Rab ki taraf mutawajjeh hota hai, pas woh apne samne na thooke aur na apni dayen taraf, woh apne bayen taraf ya apne bayen paon ke neeche thooke. Agar namaz me use thook ki shadid hajat pesh aaye to apne kapde me thook le aur yun kare. Aur Sufyan ne apni aasteen se mal kar dikhaya."
"746","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Al-Zuhri ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Mujhe Ata ibn Yazid al-Laythi ne Abu Said se khabar di, unhon ne kaha: Rasool Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne do khareed-o-farokht aur libas ke do tareeqon se mana farmaya. Rahi do khareed-o-farokht to chhukar bechna aur uchhal kar bechna hai, aur rahe libas ke do tareeqe to ek kapde me is tarah simat kar liptna ke us me koi shigaf na ho, aur ek aadmi ka ek hi kapde me ghutne khade karke baithna jabke us me se kuch us ki sharmgah par na ho."
"747","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Damrah ibn Said al-Mazini ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Maine Abu Said al-Khudri ko kehte hue suna: Rasool Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne Asr ki namaz ke baad namaz se mana farmaya yahan tak ke suraj ghuroob ho jaye, aur subah ki namaz ke baad namaz se yahan tak ke suraj tulu ho jaye."
"748","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abdullah ibn Abd al-Rahman ibn Abi Sasah ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Maine apne walid se suna - aur woh Abu Said ki kafalat me yateem thay - unhon ne kaha: Mujh se Abu Said ne kaha: Aye mere bete, jab tum in sehraon me ho to azan buland awaz se kaho, kyunke maine Rasool Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ko farmate hue suna: Use jo bhi sunta hai, na koi insan na koi jinn, na pathar na darakht na koi aur cheez, magar woh Qayamat ke Din us ke haq me gawahi dega."
"749","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya: Abdullah ibn Abd al-Rahman ibn Abi Sasah ne bayan kiya ke unhon ne apne walid se suna, unhon ne kaha: Maine Abu Said al-Khudri ko kehte hue suna: Rasool Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya: Qareeb hai ke Musalman aadmi ka behtareen maal bakriyan hon jin ke sath woh pahadon ki chotiyon aur barish ki jaghon ke peeche chale, fitnon se apne deen ko bachakar bhagta hua."
"750","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Yazid ibn Khusayfah ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Maine Busr ibn Said se suna, unhon ne kaha: Mujh se Abu Said al-Khudri ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Main ek majlis me tha jis me Ubayy ibn Kab baithe hue thay jab Abu Musa al-Ashari hamare paas ghabraye hue aaye, ya unhon ne kaha khaufzada. Hum ne kaha: Tumhen kya hua hai. Unhon ne kaha: Umar ne mujhe kisi zaroorat ke liye bulwaya to main un ke paas gaya aur teen martaba ijazat mangi magar mujhe ijazat na mili to main wapas aa gaya. Maine un se kaha ke maine Rasool Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ko farmate hue suna: Jab tum me se koi teen martaba ijazat mange aur use ijazat na mile to woh wapas laut jaye. Umar ne kaha: Tum apne is qaul par zaroor daleel laoge warna main tumhare sath aisa-waisa karunga. Ubayy ibn Kab ne mujh se kaha: Tumhare sath logon me se sab se chhota hi khada hoga. Abu Said ne kaha: Pas main logon me sab se chhota tha, aur main Umar ke paas gaya aur unhen bataya ke Rasool Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya: Jab tum me se koi teen martaba ijazat mange aur use ijazat na mile to woh wapas laut jaye."
"751","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Amr ibn Yahya ibn Umarah ibn Abi al-Hasan al-Mazini ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Mujhe mere walid ne khabar di ke unhon ne Abu Said al-Khudri ko kehte hue suna: Rasulullah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya: Paanch dhawd oonton se kam mein koi sadaqah nahin, paanch awsuq anaaj se kam mein koi sadaqah nahin, aur paanch uqiyah chandi se kam mein koi sadaqah nahin. Sufyan ne kaha: Amr ibn Dinar aur Yahya ibn Said is hadith ko Amr ibn Yahya se riwayat kiya karte the."
"752","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Safwan ibn Sulaym ne hum se bayan kiya, Ata ibn Yasar se, Abu Said al-Khudri se, ke Rasulullah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya: Jumuah ke din ghusl karna har baligh par wajib hai."
"753","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Mujhe Al-Ala ibn Abd al-Rahman ibn Yaqub, al-Huraqah ke azaad kardah ghulam, ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Maine apne walid ko kehte hue suna: Main Abu Said al-Khudri ke paas gaya aur un se poocha: Kya aap ne tehband ke baare mein Rasulullah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam se kuch suna hai? Unhon ne kaha: Haan; Maine Rasulullah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ko farmate hue suna: Momin ka tehband us ki aadhi pindli tak hai; jo is ke aur takhnon ke darmiyan ho us mein us par koi gunah nahin; jo takhnon se neeche ho woh Aag mein hai; Allah Azza wa Jall takabbur se apna kapda ghaseetne wale ki taraf nazar nahin farmata."
"754","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Suhayl ibn Abi Salih ne hum se bayan kiya, Ayyub ibn Bashir se, Said al-Asha se, Abu Said al-Khudri se, jinhon ne kaha: Rasulullah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya: Jis ke paas teen betiyan hon, ya teen behnen hon, ya do betiyan hon, ya do behnen hon, aur woh un se achhi sohbat rakhe, un par sabr kare, aur un ke maamle mein Allah se dare, to woh Jannat mein dakhil hoga."
"755","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Yahya ibn Said aur Abu Umayr al-Harith ibn Umayr ne hum se bayan kiya ke un donon ne Abu Tuwalah se suna jo Nahar al-Abdi se, jo Abu Said al-Khudri se riwayat karte hain, jinhon ne kaha: Maine Rasulullah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ko farmate hue suna: Allah Qiyamat ke Din bande se sawal karega yahan tak ke farmayega: Jab tune duniya mein burai dekhi to tujhe us par nakir karne se kis cheez ne roka? Aur jab Allah apne bande ko us ki hujjat ilqa karega to woh kahega: Ai mere Rabb, mujhe Tujh se ummeed thi aur logon se darta tha."
"756","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Muhammad ibn Ajlan ne hum se bayan kiya ke unhon ne Iyad ibn Abdullah ibn Sad ibn Abi Sarh al-Amiri ko kehte hue suna: Maine Abu Said al-Khudri ko kehte hue suna: Rasulullah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne minbar par farmaya: Mujhe tumhare baare mein sab se zyada jis cheez ka darr hai woh hai jo Allah Azza wa Jall zameen ki nabatat aur duniya ki zeenat mein se tumhare liye nikalega. Unhon ne kaha: Ek shakhs khada hua aur kaha: Ai Allah ke Rasul, kya khair sharr la sakti hai? Teen martaba. Unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam khamosh ho gaye yahan tak ke hum ne gumaan kiya ke aap par wahi nazil ho rahi hai - aur jab aap par wahi nazil hoti to saans ka bojh aur paseena aap ko gher leta - aur jab woh aap se hatayi gayi to aap ne farmaya: Sawal karne wala kahan hai? Unhon ne kaha: Main hazir hun, Ai Allah ke Rasul Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam, aur maine khair ke siwa kuch irada nahin kiya tha. Rasulullah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya: Khair khair ke siwa kuch nahin lati; khair khair ke siwa kuch nahin lati; khair khair ke siwa kuch nahin lati. Lekin duniya sabz aur meethi hai, aur bahar jo kuch ugati hai woh zyada khane se marta hai ya qareeb hota hai ke maar dale, siwaye hare chare khane wale janwar ke: woh khata hai yahan tak ke jab us ke pehlu phool jate hain to suraj ki taraf munh karta hai, phir gobar girata hai ya peshab karta hai, phir laut kar khata hai, phir khali karke jugali karta hai. Jo maal ko haqq ke sath le us ke liye us mein barkat di jati hai; jo maal ko na-haqq le us ke liye us mein barkat nahin di jati, aur woh us ki tarah hai jo khata hai magar sair nahin hota. Upar wala haath neeche wale haath se behtar hai. Sufyan ne kaha: Jab bhi main un ke paas aata to Al-Amash mujh se is hadith ko baar baar dohrwate the."
"757","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Muhammad ibn Ajlan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Iyad ibn Abdullah ibn Sad ibn Abi Sarh ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Maine Abu Said al-Khudri ko dekha ke woh aaye jabke Marwan ibn al-Hakam Jumuah ke din khutba de raha tha. Woh do rakat namaz parhne ke liye khade hue, aur pehredar un ke paas aaye taake unhen bitha den, magar unhon ne baithne se inkar kar diya yahan tak ke unhon ne do rakat parh lin. Jab woh namaz se farigh hue to hum un ke paas gaye aur un se kaha: Ai Abu Said, qareeb tha ke woh aap ke sath kuch kar guzarte. Abu Said ne kaha: Maine Rasulullah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam se jo dekha us ke baad main un ki khatir usay kisi cheez ke badle nahin chhodunga. Maine Rasulullah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ko dekha jabke ek shakhs aaya jab aap Jumuah ke din khutba de rahe the; woh masjid mein khasta haal libas mein dakhil hua, to Nabi Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne us se farmaya: Kya tune namaz parhi hai? Us ne kaha: Nahin. Aap ne farmaya: To do rakat parh. Phir Rasulullah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne logon ko sadaqah dene ki targheeb di, to logon ne kapde phenke, aur Rasulullah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne us shakhs ko un mein se do kapde de diye. Phir jab agla Jumuah aaya to woh shakhs aaya jabke Nabi Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam khutba de rahe the, to Nabi Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya: Kya tune do rakat parhi hain? Us ne kaha: Nahin. Aap ne farmaya: To do rakat parh. Phir aap ne logon ko sadaqah dene ki targheeb di, to unhon ne kapde phenke, aur Rasulullah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne us shakhs ko un mein se do kapde de diye. Phir jab agla Jumuah aaya to woh shakhs aaya jabke Nabi Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam khutba de rahe the, to Nabi Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya: Kya tune do rakat parhi hain? Us ne kaha: Nahin. Aap ne farmaya: To do rakat parh. Phir aap ne logon ko sadaqah dene ki targheeb di, to unhon ne kapde phenke, aur us shakhs ne apne do kapdon mein se ek phenk diya. Rasulullah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne usay daanta aur farmaya: Usay le le. To us ne usay le liya. Phir aap ne farmaya: Is shakhs ko dekho: woh us Jumuah khasta haal aaya tha, to maine logon ko sadaqah dene ka hukm diya, unhon ne kapde phenke, aur maine usay un mein se do kapde diye. Phir jab yeh Jumuah aaya to maine logon ko sadaqah dene ka hukm diya, to us ne apne do kapdon mein se ek phenk diya. Sufyan ne kaha, woh kehte hain: Sadaqah sirf beniyazi mein se hai, aur usay apne kapde se beniyaz hone ki gunjaish nahin."
"758","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ibn Ajlan ne hum se bayan kiya ke unhon ne Iyad ibn Abdullah ko kehte hue suna: Maine Abu Said al-Khudri ko kehte hue suna: Hum Rasulullah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ke dino mein fitr ke sadaqah ke liye khajoor ke ek sa, jau ke ek sa, ya aqit ke ek sa ke siwa kuch na dete the."
"759","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Amr ibn Dinar ne hum se bayan kiya ke unhon ne Jabir ibn Abdullah ko kehte hue suna: Mujhe Abu Said al-Khudri ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya: Logon par ek zamana aayega jab logon ki ek jamaat jihad ke liye niklegi, to kaha jayega: Kya tum mein koi hai jis ne Rasulullah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ki sohbat pai ho? Kaha jayega: Haan, to unhen fatah di jayegi. Phir logon par ek zamana aayega jab logon ki ek jamaat jihad ke liye niklegi, to un se kaha jayega: Kya tum mein koi hai jis ne Rasulullah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ke sahaba ki sohbat pai ho? Un se kaha jayega: Haan, to unhen fatah di jayegi. Phir logon par ek zamana aayega jab logon ki ek jamaat jihad ke liye niklegi, to un se kaha jayega: Kya tum mein koi hai jis ne us ki sohbat pai ho jis ne Rasulullah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ke sahaba ki sohbat pai ho? Kaha jayega: Haan, to unhen fatah di jayegi."
"760","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Amr ibn Dinar ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Mujhe Abu Salih al-Samman ne khabar di, unhon ne kaha: Maine Abu Said al-Khudri ko bayan karte hue suna ke Rasulullah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya: Dirham ke badle dirham aur dinar ke badle dinar, misl ke badle misl, un ke darmiyan koi zyadati nahin. Maine Abu Said al-Khudri se kaha: Lekin Ibn Abbas is mein koi harj nahin samajhte. Abu Said ne kaha: Main Ibn Abbas se mila aur un se kaha: Mujhe is ke baare mein batao jo tum kehte ho: kya yeh koi cheez hai jo tum ne Allah ki Kitab mein pai hai, ya koi cheez hai jo tum ne Rasulullah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam se suni hai? Unhon ne kaha: Na maine usay Allah ki Kitab mein paya aur na usay Rasulullah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam se suna; aur tum Rasulullah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ko mujh se zyada jante ho. Lekin mujhe Usamah ibn Zayd ne khabar di ke Rasulullah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya: Sood udhaar mein hai."
"761","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Damrah ibn Said al-Mazini ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Main ne Abu Said al-Khudri ko Umar se Rasulullah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ki sarf wali hadith bayan karte hue suna. Aur Ibn Umar aaye aur is ke bare mein un se sawal kiya jabke main maujood tha. Sufyan ne farmaya: Mujhe is mein se kuch yaad nahi siwaye is ke ke ye us jaisa hai jo log Abu Said se, Nabi Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam se, sone ke badle sone, barabar barabar, aur chandi ke badle chandi, barabar barabar ke bare mein bayan karte hain."
"762","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya: Muhammad ibn Ishaq ne mujh se bayan kiya, Muhammad ibn Ibrahim al-Taymi se, Abu Salamah ibn Abd al-Rahman se, Abu Said al-Khudri se, unhon ne farmaya: Main ne apni ek londi ko Banu Qaynuqa ke bazaar mein bechne ke liye bithaya, to ek Yahudi aadmi mere paas aaya aur bola: Ae Abu Said, ye londi kya hai? Main ne kaha: Meri ek londi hai jise main bech raha hun. Us ne kaha: Shayad tum use is haal mein bechoge ke us ke pet mein tumhara bacha ho. Main ne kaha: Main us se azl kiya karta tha. Us ne kaha: Ye to chhota zinda dafn karna hai. Phir main Rasulullah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ke paas gaya aur ye baat un se zikr ki, to unhon ne farmaya: Yahud ne jhoot kaha; aur agar tum aisa na karo to tum par koi harj nahi."
"763","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Ibn Abi Najih ne hum se bayan kiya, Mujahid se, Qazah se, Abu Said al-Khudri se: ke Nabi Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ke samne azl ka zikr hua. Unhon ne farmaya: Tum mein se koi ye kyun karta hai? Aur unhon ne ye nahi farmaya: Tum mein se koi ye na kare. Koi jaan paida nahi hoti magar Allah hi us ka Khaliq hai."
"764","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Mujalid ne hum se bayan kiya, Abu al-Waddak Jabr ibn Nawf se, Abu Said al-Khudri se, Nabi se, is jaisa."
"765","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Ali ibn Zayd ibn Judan ne hum se bayan kiya, Abu Nadrah se, Abu Said al-Khudri se, unhon ne farmaya: Rasulullah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya: Qayamat qaim nahi hogi yahan tak ke Musalmanon ke do azeem giroh aapas mein ladenge, un ka daawa ek hoga; un mein se Haq se zyada qareeb woh hoga jo ghalib aayega. Jabke woh is haal mein honge, un mein se ek baaghi jamaat alag ho jayegi, deen se is tarah nikal jayegi jaise teer shikaar se paar ho jata hai."
"766","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Abd al-Malik ibn Umayr ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Qazah ne mujhe khabar di, Abu Said al-Khudri se, ke Rasulullah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya: Sawariyan sirf teen masjidon ki taraf kasi jati hain: Masjid al-Haram, meri ye masjid, aur Iliya ki masjid. Aur Rasulullah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya: Koi aurat teen din se zyada safar na kare magar mahram ke saath. Aur Rasulullah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne Asr ke baad namaz se mana farmaya yahan tak ke suraj ghuroob ho jaye, aur fajr ke baad namaz se yahan tak ke suraj tulu ho jaye; aur unhon ne do din roza rakhne se mana farmaya: qurbani ka din aur iftar ka din."
"767","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Amr ibn Dinar ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Attab ibn Hunayn ne mujhe khabar di, unhon ne farmaya: Main ne Abu Said al-Khudri ko kehte hue suna: Rasulullah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya: Agar Allah logon se saat saal barish rok le phir use bheje, to un mein se ek giroh subah is haal mein karega ke us ka inkar karne wala hoga, kehte hue: Humein falan sitare se barsaya gaya, ya: Humein al-Mijdah ke sitare se barsaya gaya."
"768","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Ali ibn Zayd ibn Judan ne hum se bayan kiya, Abu Nadrah se, Abu Said al-Khudri se, unhon ne farmaya: Rasulullah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne Asr ke baad humein khutba diya yahan tak ke ghuroob ke qareeb, aur koi cheez jo Qayamat ke qaim hone tak hone wali hai na rahi magar unhon ne humein us ki khabar di; jis ne use jana us ne jana, aur jo us se jahil raha woh jahil raha. Unhon ne farmaya: Duniya sabz aur meethi hai, aur Allah tumhe is mein khalifa bana raha hai, dekh raha hai ke tum kaise amal karte ho. Pas duniya se bacho aur auraton se bacho. Beshak har dagha baaz ke liye Qayamat ke din us ki dagha ke mutabiq ek jhanda hoga, aur us ki peeth par ek jhanda hoga. Beshak behtareen jihad kalima-e-haq hai - aur Sufyan kabhi farmate: Zalim hukmaran ke samne kalima-e-adl. Unhon ne farmaya: Phir Abu Said roye aur farmaya: Hum ne kitne zulm dekhe aur un par nakir nahi ki: Beshak Aulad-e-Adam darjon mein paida kiye gaye hain: un mein se koi momin paida hota hai, momin jeeta hai, aur momin marta hai; un mein se koi kafir paida hota hai, kafir jeeta hai, aur kafir marta hai; un mein se koi momin paida hota hai, momin jeeta hai, aur kafir marta hai; un mein se koi kafir paida hota hai, kafir jeeta hai, aur momin marta hai; un mein se koi jaldi ghussa hone wala aur jaldi laut aane wala hai, to ye us ka badla ho jata hai; un mein se koi der se ghussa hone wala aur der se lautne wala hai, to ye us ka badla ho jata hai. Beshak ghussa Aag ka angara hai; pas tum mein se jo ise mehsoos kare aur khada ho to baith jaye; aur agar baitha ho to lait jaye."
"769","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Asim al-Ahwal ne hum se bayan kiya, Abu al-Mutawakkil al-Naji se, Abu Said al-Khudri se, unhon ne farmaya: Rasulullah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya: Jab tum mein se koi apni biwi ke paas aaye, phir agar woh lautna chahe to wuzu kare jaise namaz ke liye wuzu hota hai."
"770","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Mutarrif ne hum se bayan kiya, Atiyyah al-Awfi se, Abu Said al-Khudri se, unhon ne farmaya: Rasulullah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya: Main kaise khushi karun jabke Sur wale ne Sur pakad liya hai, apni peshani jhuka li hai, aur apna kaan tedha kar liya hai, is intezar mein ke kab use hukm diya jayega? Unhon ne kaha: Ae Allah ke Rasul, aap humein kya hukm dete hain? Unhon ne farmaya: Kaho: Allah humein kafi hai, aur Woh behtareen Karsaz hai; Allah par hum tawakkul karte hain."
"771","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Malik ibn Mighwal ne hum se bayan kiya, Atiyyah se, Abu Said al-Khudri se, unhon ne kaha: Rasool Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya: Buland darjon wale log Illiyyun walon ko zaroor dekhenge jaisa tum ufaq par roshan sitare ko dekhte ho, aur Abu Bakr aur Umar unhi me se hain, aur kya hi khoob hain."
"772","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Muhammad ibn Amr ibn Alqamah ne hum se bayan kiya, Abu Salamah ibn Abd al-Rahman se, Abu Said al-Khudri se."
"773","Sufyan ne kaha: Aur Ibn Jurayj ne hum se bayan kiya, Sulayman ibn Abi Muslim al-Ahwal se, Abu Salamah se, Abu Said al-Khudri se, unhon ne kaha: Rasool Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne Ramazan ke mahine ke darmiyani ashre me etikaf farmaya aur hum ne un ke sath etikaf kiya, phir jab beeswin ki subah aayi to hum ne apna saman uthaya, to Rasool Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne humein dekha aur farmaya: Tum me se jo etikaf kar raha tha wo apni etikafgah ki taraf laut aaye, kyunke mujhe wo aakhri ashre me dikhayi gayi hai aur maine dekha hai ke main us ki subah me pani aur kichad me sajda kar raha hun, phir us din ke aakhir me aasman abr aalud hua aur barish barsai aur masjid khajoor ki tehniyon ki thi to Rasool Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ki namaz ki jagah me pani tapka, phir maine Rasool Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ko fajr ki namaz se farigh hote dekha jabke un ki peshani aur naak par pani aur kichad ka nishan tha."
"774","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ismail ibn Muhammad ibn Sad ibn Abi Waqqas bayan karte hain, kehte hain: Mujhe Hamzah ibn al-Mughirah ibn Shubah ne khabar di, unhon ne kaha: Maine apne walid ko kehte suna: Main Nabi Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ke sath ek safar me tha to unhon ne mujh se farmaya: Peeche reh jao aye Mughirah, aur aye logon aage badho, unhon ne kaha: Log aage badh gaye aur main peeche reh gaya, phir Rasool Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam qaza-e-hajat ke liye tashreef le gaye phir aaye to maine ek mashkize se un par pani dala jabke unhon ne Rumi jubba pehna hua tha, phir unhon ne apna hath nikalna chaha to jubba un par tang tha to unhon ne use us ke neeche se nikala, phir unhon ne apna chehra aur apne hath dhoye aur apne sar ka masah kiya phir apne chamde ke mozon par masah kiya, Sufyan ne kaha: Mujh se Ismail ne kaha: Maine ye al-Zuhri ko sunayi aur ek din unhon ne mozon par masah ki hadisen bayan kin, jab wo apne pas maujud hadis se farigh hue to meri taraf mutawajjeh hue aur kaha: Aur mujhe Hamzah ibn al-Mughirah se bayan kiya gaya, phir meri hadis me aage badhte rahe yahan tak ke use mukammal kiya."
"775","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Zakariyya ibn Abi Zaidah aur Husayn ibn Abd al-Rahman al-Sulami aur Yunus ibn Abi Ishaq ne hum se bayan kiya, al-Shabi se, Urwah ibn al-Mughirah ibn Shubah se, un ke walid se, unhon ne kaha: Maine kaha: Aye Allah ke Rasool, kya hum me se koi mozon par masah kar sakta hai, unhon ne farmaya: Haan, jab us ne unhein taharat ki halat me pehna ho."
"776","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne mujh se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Mujh se Ziyad ibn Ilaqah ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Maine al-Mughirah ibn Shubah ko kehte suna: Rasool Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam qiyam farmate rahe yahan tak ke un ke qadam mutawarram ho gaye, kaha gaya: Aye Allah ke Rasool, kya Allah ne aap ke agle aur pichhle gunah bakhsh nahi diye, Rasool Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya: Kya main shukr guzar banda na banun."
"777","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Waki ibn al-Jarrah ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Tumah ibn Amr al-Jafari ne hum se bayan kiya, Umar ibn Bayan al-Taghlibi se, Urwah ibn al-Mughirah ibn Shubah se, un ke walid se, unhon ne kaha: Rasool Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya: Jo sharab beche to use chahiye ke wo khinziron ko tukde tukde kare."
"778","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hum se Mutarrif ibn Tarif aur Abd al-Malik ibn Said ibn Abjar dono ne bayan kiya, dono ne al-Shabi ko kehte suna: Maine al-Mughirah ibn Shubah ko mimbar par Nabi Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam se marfuan bayan karte hue suna, unhon ne kaha: Musa ne apne Rabb Azza wa Jalla se sawal kiya aur kaha: Mere Rabb, Jannat walon me sab se kam darje wala kaun hai, unhon ne farmaya: Ek aadmi jo Jannat walon ke Jannat me dakhil ho jane ke baad aayega aur use kaha jayega: Jannat me dakhil ho ja, halanke unhon ne apne makanaat sambhal liye honge aur apne hisse le liye honge, to use kaha jayega: Kya tum is par razi ho ke tumhare liye duniya ke badshahon me se kisi ek badshah ke misl ho, wo kahega: Haan mere Rabb main razi hun, wo farmayega: Use kaha jayega: Phir tumhare liye ye hai aur us jaisa aur us jaisa aur us jaisa aur us jaisa, wo kahega: Mere Rabb main razi hun, wo farmayega: Use kaha jayega: Phir tumhare liye ye hai aur is ke sath das guna aur, wo kahega: Mere Rabb main razi hun, wo farmayega: Use kaha jayega: Phir tumhare liye is ke sath wo kuch hai jo tumhara nafs chahe aur tumhari aankh se lutf uthaye, Musa ne kaha: Mere Rabb phir Jannat walon me sab se buland darje wala kaun hai, unhon ne farmaya: Yehi hai jo Maine chaha aur Main tumhein un ke bare me bataunga: Maine un ki izzat ko Apne Hath se lagaya aur us par muhr laga di, to na kisi aankh ne dekha aur na kisi kaan ne suna aur na kisi insan ke dil me us ka khayal guzra, unhon ne kaha: Aur is ki tasdiq Allah Azza wa Jalla ki Kitab me hai: Koi nafs nahi janta jo un ke liye aankhon ki thandak me se chhupa kar rakha gaya hai."
"779","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hum se Abdah ibn Abi Lubaba aur Abd al-Malik ibn Umayr ne bayan kiya, dono ne Warrad jo al-Mughirah ibn Shubah ke katib the se suna, unhon ne kaha: Muawiyah ibn Abi Sufyan ne al-Mughirah ko likha: Mujhe wo kuch likh bhejo jo tum ne Rasool Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam se suna hai, to al-Mughirah ne unhein likha: Maine Rasool Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ko apni namaz se farigh hote waqt ye kehte suna: Allah ke siwa koi mabud nahi wo akela hai us ka koi sharik nahi usi ke liye badshahat hai aur usi ke liye hamd hai aur wo har cheez par qadir hai, Aye Allah jo Tu de use koi rokne wala nahi aur jo Tu rok le use koi dene wala nahi aur kisi daulatmand ki daulat Tere muqable me use koi faida nahi deti."
"780","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hum se Ibn Abi Najih ne bayan kiya, Mujahid se, al-Aqqar ibn al-Mughirah ibn Shubah se, un ke walid se ke Rasool Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya: Jo dam karwaye ya dagh lagwaye us ne Allah par tawakkul nahi kiya."
"781","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ibn Abi Khalid ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Maine Qays ibn Abi Hazim ko kehte hue suna: Maine al-Mughira ibn Shu'ba ko kehte hue suna: Rasulullah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam se Dajjal ke baare mein kisi ne is tarah sawal nahi kiya jaisa maine Aap se sawal kiya. Aap ne farmaya: Aur tumhara us ke baare mein sawal karna kya hai? Tum usay hargiz nahi paoge."
"782","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ayyub al-Sakhtiyani ne hum se bayan kiya, Abu Qilaba se, Zahdam al-Jarmi se, unhon ne kaha: Hum Abu Musa al-Ash'ari ke paas thay jab murghi ka gosht laya gaya, aur ek aadmi alag ho gaya aur us ne nahi khaya. Abu Musa ne usay bulaya to us ne kaha: Maine usay galeez cheez khate hue dekha hai. Abu Musa ne kaha: Maine Rasulullah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ko usay khate hue dekha hai."
"783","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ayyub ne hum se bayan kiya, Abu Qilaba se, Zahdam se, Abu Musa al-Ash'ari se, unhon ne kaha: Hum Rasulullah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ki khidmat mein sawariyan maangne ke liye hazir hue, aur safed kohan wale oonton ka ek rewad laya gaya. Hum ne kaha: Ai Allah ke Rasul, hamein sawariyan ata farmaiye. Aap ne qasam khai ke Aap hamein sawariyan nahi denge, phir ek aur rewad laya gaya. Hum ne kaha: Ai Allah ke Rasul, hamein sawariyan ata farmaiye, to Aap ne hamein sawariyan ata farma din. Jab hum wapas mude to hum ne kaha: Hum ne ye kya kiya? Hum ne Rasulullah ko Un ki qasam mein ghaflat mein pa liya. To hum Rasulullah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ki khidmat mein aaye aur Aap se us ka zikr kiya, to Rasulullah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya: Main kabhi koi qasam nahi khata phir us se behtar cheez dekhta hoon magar wahi karta hoon jo behtar ho aur apni qasam ka kaffara ada karta hoon."
"784","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Kufa walon mein se Shu'ba naam ke ek shaikh ne hum se bayan kiya, aur wo siqa thay, unhon ne kaha: Main Abu Burda ibn Abi Musa ke paas un ke ghar mein us ki chhat par tha, aur unhon ne apne beton ko bulaya aur kaha: Ai mere beto, aao taake main tumhein ek hadith bayan karoon jo maine apne walid se suni, unhon ne use Rasulullah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam se bayan kiya. Maine apne walid ko kehte hue suna: Maine Rasulullah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ko farmate hue suna: Jo shakhs kisi ghulam ko azad kare, Allah Azza wa Jalla us ghulam ke har uzw ke badle us ka har uzw Aag se azad farmata hai."
"785","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ibn Salih ibn Hayy ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ek aadmi al-Sha'bi ke paas aaya jabke main un ke paas tha aur us ne kaha: Ai Abu Amr, Khurasan mein hamare paas kuch log hain jo kehte hain: Jab aadmi apni laundi ko azad karke us se nikah kare to wo us shakhs ki tarah hai jo apni qurbani ke oont par sawar ho. Al-Sha'bi ne kaha: Abu Burda ibn Abi Musa ne hum se bayan kiya, apne walid se, ke Rasulullah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya: Teen ko un ka ajr do martaba diya jayega: Ahl-e-Kitab ka ek aadmi jo Nabi Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ke bheje jane se pehle momin tha, phir Nabi par iman laya, to us ke liye do ajr hain; ek aadmi jis ki ek laundi thi jise us ne taleem di aur achhi taleem di, adab sikhaya aur achha adab sikhaya, phir use azad kiya aur us se nikah kiya, to us ke liye do ajr hain; aur ek ghulam jo Allah ki itaat kare aur apne aaqa ka haq ada kare, to us ke liye do ajr hain. Ise muft le lo; ek aadmi is se kam ke liye bhi Madina tak safar karta tha."
"786","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Burayd ibn Abd Allah ibn Abi Burda ne hum se bayan kiya, apne dada Abu Burda se, Abu Musa se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya: Amanatdar khazanchi jo hukm di gayi cheez sawab ki niyyat se de, wo sadqa dene walon mein se ek hai."
"787","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Burayd ibn Abd Allah ibn Abi Burda ne hum se bayan kiya, apne dada Abu Burda se, Abu Musa se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya: Nek saathi ki misal itr farosh ki tarah hai; agar us ka itr tum tak na pahunche to us ki khushbu me se kuch tumhein lag jayegi. Aur bure saathi ki misal lohar ki tarah hai; agar us ki chingariyan tumhein na jalayen to us ki badbu me se kuch tumhein lag jayegi."
"788","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Burayd ibn Abd Allah ibn Abi Burda ne hum se bayan kiya, apne dada Abu Burda se, Abu Musa al-Ash'ari se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya: Meri khidmat mein sifarish karo tumhein ajr diya jayega, aur Allah Apne Nabi ki zuban par jo chahega faisla farmayega."
"789","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, Burayd ibn Abd Allah ibn Abi Burda ne hum se bayan kiya, Abu Musa se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya: Momin momin ke liye imarat ki tarah hai, us ka ek hissa dusre hisse ko mazboot karta hai."
"790","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Yazid ibn Khusayfa ne hum se bayan kiya, Busr ibn Sa'id se, Abu Sa'id al-Khudri se, Abu Musa al-Ash'ari se, unhon ne kaha: Maine Rasulullah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ko farmate hue suna: Jab tum mein se koi teen martaba ijazat maange aur use ijazat na di jaye to use wapas laut jana chahiye."
"791","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, Amr ibn Sa'id al-Thawri ne hum se bayan kiya, al-A'mash se, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Sa'id ibn Jubayr ko kehte hue suna: Allah Azza wa Jall se barh kar suni hui takleef par sabar karne wala koi nahi; woh Us ka sharik thehrate hain, phir bhi Woh unhein rizq deta hai aur unhein sehat ata karta hai. al-A'mash ne kaha: Un se kaha gaya: Ae Abu Abd Allah, ye aap ne kis se suna? Unhon ne kaha: Lekin main ne jhoot nahi bola; Abu Abd al-Rahman al-Sulami ne hum se bayan kiya, Abu Musa al-Ash'ari se, Nabi Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam se."
"792","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: al-Aswad ibn Qays ne hum se bayan kiya, jabke woh sardiyon mein dhoop mein juen nikal rahe the, kehte hue: Main ne Jundub al-Bajali ko kehte hue suna: Main Nabi Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ke saath Eid mein hazir hua, aur Aap ko maloom hua ke kuch logon ne namaz se pehle zibah kar diya hai, to Aap ne farmaya: Tum mein se jis ne namaz se pehle zibah kiya hai woh apni qurbani dobara kare, aur jis ne zibah nahi kiya woh Allah ke naam par zibah kare."
"793","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: al-Aswad ibn Qays ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Jundub ibn Abd Allah al-Bajali ko kehte hue suna: Main Nabi Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ke saath ek ghaar mein tha jab Aap ki ungli zakhmi ho gayi, to Aap ne farmaya: Tu sirf ek ungli hai jo khoon alood hui hai, aur jo kuch tujhe pesh aaya hai woh Allah ke raaste mein hai."
"794","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: al-Aswad ibn Qays ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Jundub ibn Abd Allah al-Bajali ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Jibril Alaihissalam ne Nabi Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ke paas wahi lane mein der ki, to mushrikon ne kaha: Muhammad ko chhor diya gaya hai. Phir Allah Azza wa Jall ne nazil farmaya: Subah ki roshni ki qasam, aur raat ki jab woh chha jaye, aap ke Rabb ne aap ko na chhora hai aur na woh bezar hua hai."
"795","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: al-Walid ibn Harb sachche aur ameen ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Salama ibn Kuhayl ko kehte hue suna: Main ne Jundub al-Bajali ke siwa kisi aise shakhs se nahi suna jis ne Nabi Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam se suna ho. Main ne Jundub ko kehte hue suna: Main ne Rasool Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ko farmate hue suna: Jo shohrat talab kare Allah us ki buri shohrat mashhoor kar dega, aur jo dikhawa kare Allah us ke dikhawe ko mashhoor kar dega."
"796","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abd al-Malik ibn Umayr ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Jundub al-Bajali ko kehte hue suna: Rasool Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya: Beshak main Hauz par tum se aage pahunchne wala hun. Sufyan ne kaha: Aur is mein kuch aur baat bhi zikr ki gayi thi."
"797","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ibn Abi Khalid ne hum se bayan kiya, Qays ibn Abi Hazim se, unhon ne kaha: Main ne al-Sunabihi al-Ahmasi ko kehte hue suna: Main ne Rasool Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ko farmate hue suna: Beshak main Hauz par tum se aage pahunchne wala hun, aur main tumhare zariye ummaton par kasrat se fakhr karunga, pas mere baad aapas mein qital na karna. Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya: al-Sunabihi Abu al-A'sar hain, aur Sufyan ne humein ye nahi bataya tha; hum ne ye kisi aur zariye se maloom kiya."
"798","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: al-Zuhri ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ubayd Allah ibn Abd Allah ibn Utba ne mujhe khabar di ke unhon ne Ibn Abbas ko kehte hue suna: al-Sa'b ibn Jaththama ne mujhe khabar di, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Rasool Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ko farmate hue suna, jab Aap se mushrikon ke un gharon ke baare mein poocha gaya jin par raat ko hamla kiya jata hai jis se un ki aurtein aur bachche maar kha jate hain: Woh unhi mein se hain. Sufyan ne kaha: Pehle Amr ne hum se ye al-Zuhri se in alfaaz ke saath bayan ki thi: Woh apne baapon mein se hain. Jab al-Zuhri hamare paas aaye to main ne is ki tehqeeq ki, aur unhon ne Woh unhi mein se hain ke siwa kuch nahi kaha."
"799","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: al-Zuhri ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ubayd Allah ibn Abd Allah ne mujhe khabar di ke unhon ne Ibn Abbas ko kehte hue suna: al-Sa'b ibn Jaththama ne mujhe khabar di, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Rasool Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ko farmate hue suna: Allah aur Us ke Rasool ke siwa koi hima nahi."
"800","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: al-Zuhri ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ubayd Allah ibn Abd Allah ne mujhe khabar di ke unhon ne Ibn Abbas ko kehte hue suna: al-Sa'b ibn Jaththama ne mujhe khabar di, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Rasool Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ki khidmat mein jangli gadhe ka gosht pesh kiya jab Aap al-Abwa ya Waddan mein the, to Aap ne use mujhe wapas kar diya. Jab Aap ne mere chehre mein nagawari dekhi to Aap ne farmaya: Baat ye nahi ke hum use nafrat ki wajah se tumhein wapas kar rahe hain, balke hum ihram mein hain. Al-Humaydi ne kaha: Sufyan kabhi dono ko ek hi hadith mein jama karke bayan karte the aur kabhi unhein juda juda karte the, aur Sufyan jangli gadha kehte the, phir baad mein jangli gadhe ka gosht ke alfaaz ikhtiyar kar liye."
"801","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Ibn Jurayj ne hum se bayan kiya, al-Hasan ibn Muslim ibn Yannaq se, Tawus se, unhon ne farmaya: Maine Ibn Abbas ko dekha ke woh Zayd ibn Arqam se mile aur un se hadith yaad dilane ka mutalba karne lage: Aap ne mujhe Rasool Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam se shikar ke gosht ke bare mein kya bayan kiya tha? Phir Zayd ibn Arqam ne Rasool Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam se al-Sa'b ibn Jaththama ki hadith ki manind kuch zikr kiya."
"802","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: al-Ajlah ibn Abd Allah ibn Hujayya al-Kindi ne hum se bayan kiya, al-Sha'bi se, Abd Allah ibn Abi al-Khalil se, Zayd ibn Arqam se, unhon ne farmaya: Ali ibn Abi Talib ke paas, jab woh Yemen mein thay, teen admiyon ka muqadma laya gaya jinhon ne ek hi tuhr mein apni ek laundi se hambistari ki thi aur us ne ek bachche ko janam diya, to Ali ne un mein se do se farmaya: Kya tum razamandi se use apne sathi ke supurd karte ho? Unhon ne kaha: Nahin, phir unhon ne doosre do se farmaya: Kya tum razamandi se use apne sathi ke supurd karte ho? Unhon ne kaha: Nahin, phir unhon ne doosre do se farmaya: Kya tum razamandi se use apne sathi ke supurd karte ho? Unhon ne kaha: Nahin, phir Ali ne farmaya: Tum jhagadne wale shareek ho, main tumhare darmiyan qura-andazi karunga, phir tum mein se jis par qura nikla main bachche ko us se mulhaq kar dunga aur us par laundi ki qeemat ka do tihai hissa us ke dono sathiyon ko ada karna lazam karunga, phir jab hum Rasool Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ke paas aaye to hum ne is ka zikr un se kiya to unhon ne farmaya: Main is ke bare mein Ali ne jo kaha us ke siwa kuch nahin janta."
"803","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Abu Sahl ne hum se bayan kiya, al-Sha'bi se, Ali ibn Dhuray se, Zayd ibn Arqam se, Nabi Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam se, is ki manind."
"804","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Amr ibn Dinar ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Ata ibn Abi Rabah ne mujhe khabar di, Safwan ibn Ya'la se, un ke walid se, unhon ne farmaya: Maine Nabi Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ko mimbar par tilawat karte hue suna: Aur woh pukareinge: Ae Malik."
"805","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Ibn Jurayj ne hum se bayan kiya, Ata se, Safwan ibn Ya'la se, un ke walid se, unhon ne farmaya: Maine Rasool Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ke hamrah Tabuk ke ghazwe mein jang ki, wahan maine ek nau-umar oont par kisi doosre ko sawari di aur woh meri nazar mein mera sab se mazboot amal tha, maine ek mazdoor ujrat par rakha jo ek admi se lada to us admi ne us ke hath ko kaat liya to us ne use apne munh se kheencha jis se us ka agla daant gir gaya, phir woh Nabi Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ke paas aaya to unhon ne farmaya: Kya woh use tumhare munh mein chhode rakhta taake tum use choosho jaise sannd chooshta hai? Aur unhon ne use kaladam qarar diya."
"806","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Amr ne hum se bayan kiya, Ata se, ke Ya'la ke ek mazdoor ne, aur unhon ne use musnad bayan nahin kiya, aur Sufyan kabhi un dono ko jama kar dete aur is mein sanad dakhil kar dete thay lekin jab woh un dono ko alag alag karte to Ibn Jurayj ki hadith ko musnad qarar dete aur Amr ki hadith ko munqata qarar dete."
"807","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Amr ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Ata ne mujhe khabar di, unhon ne farmaya: Safwan ibn Ya'la ne mujhe khabar di, un ke walid se, unhon ne farmaya: Hum Nabi Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ke saath al-Ji'rana mein thay ke ek admi un ke paas aaya jo kata hua libas yani jubba pehne hue tha aur khaluq khushbu mein basa hua tha, us ne arz kiya: Ae Allah ke Rasool, maine umre ka ehram bandha hai jabke ye mujh par hai, Nabi Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne us se farmaya: Tum apne hajj mein kya karoge? Us ne kaha: Main is khaluq ko dho dunga aur ye kata hua libas utar dunga, to Rasool Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya: Jo kuch tum apne hajj mein karoge wohi apne umre mein karo."
"808","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Ibn Jurayj ne hum se bayan kiya, Ata se, Safwan ibn Ya'la se, un ke walid se, unhon ne farmaya: Maine Umar ibn al-Khattab se kaha: Mujhe Rasool Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ko us waqt dekhne ki khwahish hai jab un par wahi nazil hoti hai, unhon ne farmaya: Jab main al-Ji'rana mein tha to Umar ne mujhe bulaya to main aaya aur Rasool Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ek kapde se dhaanpe hue thay, Umar ne mere liye un ka chehra khola to un ka chehra surkh tha, phir jab Rasool Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam se ye kaifiyat door ho gayi to unhon ne farmaya: Sawal karne wala kahan hai? Is se pehle un ke paas ek admi aaya tha jo khaluq mein basa hua tha aur kata hua libas pehne hue tha aur keh raha tha: Maine ehram bandha hai jabke ye mujh par hai, to sawal karne wale ne kaha: Main hazir hun, Nabi Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya: Tum apne hajj mein kya karoge? Us ne kaha: Main is khaluq ko dho dunga aur ye kata hua libas utar dunga, Nabi Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya: Jo kuch tum apne hajj mein karoge wohi apne umre mein karo."
"809","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Abd al-Malik ibn Umayr ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Abd al-Rahman ibn Abi Bakra ne mujhe khabar di, unhon ne farmaya: Mere walid ne mere ek bhai jo hakim tha us ki taraf ek khat likhwaya ke woh gusse ki halat mein do jhagadne walon ke darmiyan faisla na kare, kyunke maine Rasool Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ko farmate hue suna: Kisi hakim ke liye durust nahin ke woh gusse ki halat mein do ke darmiyan faisla kare."
"810","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Isra'il Abu Musa ne hum se bayan kiya, al-Hasan se, unhon ne farmaya: Maine Abu Bakra ko kehte hue suna: Maine Rasool Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ko mimbar par dekha aur al-Hasan ibn Ali un ke pehlu mein thay, woh kabhi logon ki taraf mutawajjeh hote aur kabhi un ki taraf, farmate hue: Ye mera beta sardar hai aur shayad Allah is ke zariye Musalmanon ke do grohon ke darmiyan sulah karade."
"811","Hum se Al-Humaydi ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: hum se Sufyan ne bayan kiya, hum se Ziyad ibn Ilaqa ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: main ne Jarir ibn Abd Allah Al-Bajali ko kehte hue suna: main ne Rasool Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam se har Musalman ki khair-khwahi par baiat ki. Sufyan ne kaha: Aur unhon ne us mein Ziyad ibn Ilaqa se, Jarir se ye izafa kiya ke unhon ne kaha: Aur main yaqeenan tumhare liye mukhlis hun."
"812","Hum se Al-Humaydi ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: hum se Sufyan ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: hum se Ismail ibn Abi Khalid ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: main ne Qays ko Jarir ibn Abd Allah se riwayat karte hue suna, unhon ne kaha: main ne Rasool Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam se namaz qaim karne, zakat dene aur har Musalman ki khair-khwahi par baiat ki."
"813","Hum se Al-Humaydi ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: hum se Sufyan ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: hum se Dawud ibn Abi Hind aur Mujalid ne Al-Shabi se, unhon ne Jarir se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Rasool Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya: Jab tumhare paas zakat wasool karne wala aaye to woh tumhare paas se tumhari razamandi ke baghair na jaye."
"814","Hum se Al-Humaydi ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: hum se Sufyan ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: hum se Al-Amash ne Ibrahim Al-Nakhai se, unhon ne Hammam ibn Al-Harith se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: main ne Jarir ibn Abd Allah ko masjid ke wuzu ke us bartan se wuzu karte hue dekha jis se aam log wuzu karte hain, phir unhon ne apne mozon par masah kiya. Un se kaha gaya: Kya tum aisa karte ho? Unhon ne kaha: Mujhe kya cheez rokti hai jab ke main ne Rasool Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ko apne mozon par masah karte hue dekha hai? Ibrahim ne kaha: Ye hadees Abd Allah ke ashaab ko khush kiya karti thi, kyun ke Jarir ka Islam Al-Maida ke nuzool ke baad aaya tha."
"815","Hum se Al-Humaydi ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: hum se Sufyan ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: hum se Mujalid ne Al-Shabi se, unhon ne Jarir se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: main ne Rasool Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam se sunne aur itaat karne, namaz qaim karne, zakat dene aur har Musalman ki khair-khwahi par baiat ki."
"816","Hum se Al-Humaydi ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: hum se Sufyan ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: hum se Ismail ibn Abi Khalid ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: main ne Qays ko kehte hue suna: main ne Jarir ibn Abd Allah ko kehte hue suna: hum maheene ki chaudhwin raat ko Rasool Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ke sath thay, to Aap ne farmaya: Kya tum is chaand ko dekh rahe ho? Tum apne Rabb ko isi tarah dekhoge jaise tum is chaand ko dekh rahe ho, Us ke dekhne mein tum par zulm nahi kiya jayega. Pas tum mein se jo shakhs tulu-e-aftab se pehle aur ghurub-e-aftab se pehle ki namaz par maghloob na hone ki taqat rakhe to aisa kare."
"817","Hum se Al-Humaydi ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: hum se Sufyan ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: hum se Ismail ibn Abi Khalid ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: main ne Qays ko kehte hue suna: main ne Jarir ibn Abd Allah Al-Bajali ko kehte hue suna: Rasool Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne mujhe jab bhi dekha to mere chehre par muskuraye."
"818","Unhon ne kaha: Aur Rasool Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya: Anqareeb is darwaze se tumhare paas Dhi Yaman ke behtareen logon mein se ek mard aayega jis ke chehre par farishte ka nishan hoga. Phir Jarir ibn Abd Allah dakhil hue."
"819","Hum se Al-Humaydi ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: hum se Sufyan ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: hum se Ismail ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: main ne Qays ko kehte hue suna: main ne Jarir ibn Abd Allah ko kehte hue suna: Rasool Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya: Kya tum mujhe Yaman ke is Khalasa se rahat nahi pahunchawoge? Main ne kaha: Ae Allah ke Rasool, main ek aisa aadmi hun jo ghoron par jam kar nahi baith sakta. Unhon ne kaha: To Aap ne mere seene par haath mara aur farmaya: Ae Allah, ise sabit qadam bana aur ise hidayat dene wala, hidayat yafta bana. Unhon ne kaha: Main nikla, Sufyan ne kaha, apni qaum ke chalees, ya unhon ne kaha pachaas, sawaaron ke sath, aur main ne use jala diya. Phir main Nabi Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ke paas aaya aur kaha: Main Aap ke paas us waqt tak na aaya jab tak main ne use khujli-zada oont ki tarah, ya unhon ne kaha ganje ki tarah, na chor diya. Unhon ne kaha: Phir Rasool Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne Ahmas ke ghoron aur mardon ke liye teen martaba dua farmayi."
"820","Hum se Al-Humaydi ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: hum se Sufyan aur Marwan ibn Muawiya ne bayan kiya, dono ne kaha: hum se Ismail ne Qays se, unhon ne Jarir se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Rasool Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya: Jo logon par rehem nahi karta Allah us par rehem nahi farmayega."
"821","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Amr ibn Dinar ne hum se bayan kiya, Nafi ibn Jubayr se, unhon ne kaha: Muawiya ibn Abi Sufyan ne Jarir ibn Abd Allah ko ek dastay par muqarrar kiya, to unhen sakht sardi lagi, to Jarir unhen wapas le aaye, to Muawiya ne un se kaha: Tum unhen kyun wapas laye, to Jarir ne kaha: Main ne Rasul Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ko farmate hue suna: Jo logon par rehem nahin karta Allah us par rehem nahin farmata, to Muawiya ne un se kaha: Kya tum ne ye Rasul Allah se suna hai, unhon ne kaha: Ji han."
"822","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Muawiya ne logon par zahir karna chaha ke unhon ne use sirf is liye chhora kyunke us ne Rasul Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam se riwayat ki thi, taake us ki ijazat ke baghair wapas aane ki koi aur jurrat na kare."
"823","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Asim ibn Bahdala ne hum se bayan kiya, Shaqiq se, Jarir se, unhon ne kaha: Paivand lage hue uni libas pehne hue kuch log Rasul Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ke paas aaye aur un se manga, to Aap ne logon ko sadqa dene ki targheeb di to unhon ne kam diya, yahan tak ke ye Rasul Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ke chehre me dekha gaya, phir Ansar me se ek shakhs sone ka tukra le kar aaya, ya unhon ne kaha kacha sona, aur use daal diya, aur log ek ke baad ek aane lage, yahan tak ke ye Rasul Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ke chehre me dekha gaya, phir Rasul Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya: Jo koi achchi sunnat jari kare phir us par amal kiya jaye to use us par amal karne walon ke sawab jaisa sawab milega, un ke sawabon me se kuch kam kiye baghair, aur jo koi buri sunnat jari kare phir us par amal kiya jaye to us par us par amal karne walon ke gunah jaisa bojh hoga, un ke gunahon me se kuch kam kiye baghair."
"824","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Amr ibn Dinar ne hum se bayan kiya, Habib ibn Abi Thabit se, Jarir se, unhon ne kaha: Rasul Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya: Jab ghulam dushman ke ilaqe ki taraf bhaag jaye to Allah Azza wa Jalla ka zimma us se bari ho jata hai."
"825","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Humare ek saathi ne hum se bayan kiya, Habib se, al-Mughira se, Jarir se, Nabi Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam se, isi ki manind."
"826","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, Thabit ibn Abi Safiyya Abu Hamza se, Zadham se, Jarir se, unhon ne kaha: Rasul Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne hum se farmaya: Lahd hamare liye hai aur shaqq ghairon ke liye hai."
"827","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ibrahim ibn Maysara ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Mujhe Amr ibn al-Sharid ne khabar di, apne walid se, unhon ne kaha: Main Rasul Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ke peeche sawar tha jab Aap ne mujh se farmaya: Kya tumhare paas Umayya ibn Abi al-Salt ke kalaam me se kuch hai, main ne kaha: Ji han, Aap ne farmaya: Sunao, to main ne Aap ko ek sher sunaya, phir Aap ne farmaya: Sunao, aur main ne Aap ko ek sher sunaya, aur Aap farmate rahe: Sunao, yahan tak ke main ne Aap ko sau sher suna diye."
"828","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ibrahim ibn Maysara ne hum se bayan kiya, Amr ibn al-Sharid se, ya Yaqub ibn Asim se, jaisa ke Sufyan is ke bare me shak karte the, al-Sharid se, unhon ne kaha: Nabi Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne ek shakhs ko dekha jo apna izar latkaye hue tha, to Nabi Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne us se farmaya: Apna izar upar uthao, to us shakhs ne kaha: Ae Allah ke Rasul, main tedhi tangon wala hun aur mere ghutne aapas me takrate hain, to Nabi Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya: Apna izar upar uthao, kyunke Allah ki tamam makhlooq achchi hai, to us shakhs ko us ke baad kabhi nahin dekha gaya magar us ka izar aadhi pindli tak tha."
"829","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Mujhe al-Zuhri ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Mujhe Ubayd Allah ibn Abd Allah ibn Utba ne khabar di, Zayd ibn Khalid al-Juhani, Abu Hurayra aur Shibl se, unhon ne kaha: Hum Nabi Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ke paas the jab ek shakhs Aap ke samne khara hua aur kaha: Ae Allah ke Rasul, main Aap ko Allah ki qasam deta hun, hamare darmiyan sirf Allah ki Kitab se faisla farmayen, to us ka hareef khara hua, aur wo us se zyada samajhdar tha, aur kaha: Ji han Ae Allah ke Rasul, hamare darmiyan Allah ki Kitab se faisla farmayen aur mujhe bolne ki ijazat den, Aap ne farmaya: Bolo, us ne kaha: Mera beta is shakhs ka mazdoor tha aur us ne us ki biwi se zina kiya, to mujhe bataya gaya ke mere bete par rajm hai, to main ne sau bakriyan aur ek khadim de kar use chhuraya, phir main ne ahl-e-ilm se pucha to unhon ne mujhe bataya ke mere bete par sau kode aur ek saal ki jilawatni hai, aur is shakhs ki biwi par rajm hai, to Nabi Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya: Qasam us Zaat ki jis ke hath me meri jaan hai, main tumhare darmiyan Allah ki Kitab se faisla farmaunga: Sau bakriyan aur khadim tumhen wapas lautaye jayenge, aur tumhare bete par sau kode aur ek saal ki jilawatni hai, aur ae Unays, is shakhs ki biwi ke paas jao, phir agar wo iqrar kare to use rajm karo, unhon ne kaha: Wo subah us ke paas gaya aur us ne iqrar kiya to us ne use rajm kiya, Sufyan ne kaha: Aur Unays Aslam ka ek shakhs hai."
"830","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Mujhe al-Zuhri ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Mujhe Ubayd Allah ibn Abd Allah ibn Utba ne bayan kiya, Zayd ibn Khalid, Abu Hurayra aur Shibl se, unhon ne kaha: Hum Nabi Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ke paas the jab Aap se us laundi ke bare me pucha gaya jo shadi se pehle zina kare, to Nabi Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya: Jab tum me se kisi ki laundi zina kare to use kode lagao, phir agar dobara kare to use kode lagao, phir agar dobara kare to use kode lagao, unhon ne teesri ya chauthi martaba ke bare me kaha: Phir use bech do chahe balon ki rassi ke badle ho, yaani balon se bani hui rassi."
"831","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Salih ibn Kaysan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: mujhe Ubayd Allah ibn Abd Allah ibn Utba ne khabar di, Zayd ibn Khalid al-Juhani se, unhon ne farmaya: Rasool Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ke zamane mein raat ko logon par barish hui, phir jab subah hui to Rasool Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya: Kya tum ne nahi suna ke tumhare Rab ne pichli raat kya farmaya? Unhon ne farmaya: Meri taraf se Mere bandon par koi nemat nazil nahi hoti magar un mein se ek giroh us ka inkar karte hue subah karta hai, kehte hue: hum par falan falan sitare se barish hui, pas jo Mujh par iman laya aur Mere pani pilane par Meri hamd ki to wohi Mujh par iman lane wala aur sitare ka inkar karne wala hai, aur jo kehta hai: hum par falan falan sitare se barish hui to woh sitare par iman lane wala aur Mera inkar karne wala hai, ya Meri nemat ka inkar karne wala hai, Sufyan ne farmaya: pehle humein Ma'mar ne ye Salih se bayan kiya tha, phir hum ne ise khud Salih se suna."
"832","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Salih ibn Kaysan ne hum se bayan kiya, Ubayd Allah ibn Abd Allah ibn Utba se, Sufyan ne farmaya: mujhe nahi malum ke woh Zayd ibn Khalid the ya nahi, unhon ne farmaya: ek shakhs ne Nabi Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ki maujudgi mein murghe ko bura bhala kaha, to Nabi Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya: murghe ko bura bhala na kaho, kyunke woh namaz ke liye pukarta hai."
"833","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Yahya ibn Sa'id ne hum se bayan kiya, Muhammad ibn Yahya ibn Habban se, Abu Amra se, Zayd ibn Khalid al-Juhani se, unhon ne farmaya: hum Rasool Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ke sath Khaybar mein the jab Ashja' ka ek shakhs faut ho gaya, aur Nabi Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne us par namaz na parhi, farmaya: apne sathi par namaz parho, unhon ne us ke saman mein dekha to us mein Yahudiyon ke mankon me se manke paye jo do dirham ke barabar bhi na the."
"834","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Yahya ibn Sa'id ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: maine Yazid, al-Munba'ith ke azaad karda ghulam ko kehte hue suna: ek shakhs Nabi Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ke paas aaya aur un se giri padi cheez ke bare mein pucha, to Nabi Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya: us ke bartan aur us ke bandhan ko pehchan lo, phir ek saal tak us ka elan karo, agar woh mangi jaye to use wapas kar do, warna use apne maal mein mila lo, unhon ne farmaya: aur us ne un se bhatki hui bakriyon ke bare mein pucha, to unhon ne farmaya: woh tumhare liye hai, ya tumhare bhai ke liye, ya bheriye ke liye, aur us ne un se bhatke hue oonton ke bare mein pucha, to woh ghussa hue hatta ke un ke rukhsar surkh ho gaye, aur farmaya: tumhe us se kya wasta? Us ke paas us ki mashkiza aur us ke jute hain, woh pani par aata hai aur darakhton se khata hai hatta ke us ka malik us tak aa jaye, Sufyan ne farmaya: mujhe pahuncha ke Rabi'a ibn Abi Abd al-Rahman ne ise Zayd ibn Khalid se sanad ke sath marfu bayan kiya, to main un ke paas aaya aur un se kaha: woh hadith jo aap Yazid, al-Munba'ith ke azaad karda ghulam se giri padi cheez aur bhatke hue oonton aur bakriyon ke bare mein bayan karte hain, kya woh Zayd ibn Khalid se, Nabi Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam se hai? Unhon ne farmaya: haan, aur main ise mahaz rae samajh kar napasand karta tha, isi wajah se maine un se us ke bare mein nahi pucha tha, aur agar unhon ne ise sanad ke sath marfu bayan na kiya hota to main un se us ki sanad ke bare mein na puchta."
"835","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Salim Abu al-Nadr ne hum se bayan kiya, Busr ibn Sa'id se, unhon ne farmaya: mujhe Abu al-Juhaym ne Zayd ibn Khalid al-Juhani se puchne ke liye bheja: namazi ke samne se guzarne wale ke bare mein tum ne kya suna? Unhon ne farmaya: maine Rasool Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ko farmate hue suna: tum mein se kisi ka chalis tak intezar karna us ke liye namazi ke samne se guzarne se behtar hai, woh nahi janta ke unhon ne farmaya chalis saal, chalis mahine, chalis din, ya chalis ghante."
"836","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Ibn Abi Layla ne hum se bayan kiya, Ata ibn Abi Rabah se, Zayd ibn Khalid al-Juhani se, unhon ne farmaya: Rasool Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya: jis ne kisi ghazi ko saman diya ya us ke ghar walon mein us ki jagah li to us ne khud jihad kiya."
"837","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Harun ibn Ri'ab, jo zuhd chupaya karte the, ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: maine Kinana ibn Nu'aym ko Qabisa ibn al-Mukhariq se bayan karte hue suna, unhon ne farmaya: maine apne upar khun-baha ka bojh liya, to main Rasool Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ke paas aaya aur un se manga, Unhon ne farmaya: jab sadaqe ke oont aayenge to hum ise tumhari taraf se ada karenge ya utar denge, phir unhon ne farmaya: mangna haram hai siwa teen suraton ke: ek shakhs jo apne upar khun-baha ka bojh le, us ke liye mangna halal hai hatta ke woh ise ada kar de, phir woh ruk jaye, aur ek shakhs jise faqr aur hajat pahunche, hatta ke us ki qaum ke aqalmand teen afrad gawahi dein ya kahen ke woh faqr aur hajat mein hai, us ke liye mangna halal hai hatta ke woh guzare ke liye kafayat ya guzare ke sahare ko pa le, phir woh ruk jaye, aur ek shakhs jise aisi afat pahunche jo us ka maal tabah kar de, us ke liye mangna halal hai hatta ke woh guzare ke liye kafayat ya guzare ke sahare ko pa le, phir woh ruk jaye, aur us ke siwa jo kuch hai woh haram kamai hai."
"838","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Abd al-Malik ibn Nawfal ibn Musahiq ne hum se bayan kiya, ke unhon ne Muzayna ke ek shakhs jise Ibn Isam kaha jata hai ko apne walid se bayan karte hue suna, unhon ne farmaya: jab Rasool Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam koi dastah rawana karte to farmate: jab tum koi masjid dekho ya azan dene wale ko suno to kisi ko qatal na karo, unhon ne farmaya: Rasool Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne humein ek dastah mein bheja aur humein isi ka hukm diya, hum Tihama ki taraf nikle aur ek shakhs ko pa liya jo haudajon mein auraton ko hank raha tha, hum ne us se kaha: Islam lao, us ne kaha: Islam kya hai? Hum ne use us ke bare mein bataya, aur woh ise nahi janta tha, us ne kaha: agar main aisa na karun to tum kya karoge? Unhon ne farmaya: hum ne kaha: hum tumhe qatal kar denge, us ne kaha: kya tum mujhe mohlat doge hatta ke main haudajon tak pahunch jaun? Hum ne kaha: haan, aur hum tum tak pahunch jayenge, unhon ne farmaya: woh haudajon tak pahuncha aur kaha: zindagi khatm hone se pehle Islam lao, Hunaysh, dusri aurat ne kaha: main das aur saat, taq Islam lati hun, phir us ne kaha: raat ko safar karo, unhon ne farmaya: phir woh humare paas wapas aaya aur kaha: jo chaho karo, pas hum use aage laye aur us ki gardan mari, aur dusri aurat, ek siyah khalis nasl wali aurat, apne haudaj se utri aur us par gir kar padi rahi hatta ke woh mar gayi."
"839","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Ibn Jurayj ne hum se bayan kiya, Ibn Abi Mulayka se, Abd Allah ibn al-Sa'ib se: ke Rasool Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne Fath wale din fajar ki namaz mein logon ki imamat ki, Surat al-Mu'minin ki tilawat karte hue, jab woh Isa aur un ki walida ke zikr tak pahunche to unhe khansi ya gala ghutne ne pakad liya, to unhon ne ruku kar liya."
"840","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Ata ibn al-Sa'ib ne hum se bayan kiya, Abd Allah ibn Hafs se, Ya'la ibn Murra se, unhon ne farmaya: Rasool Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne mujhe dekha jabke main khushbu se luta hua tha, aur mujh se farmaya: Ae Ya'la, kya tumhari biwi hai? Maine kaha: nahi, Unhon ne farmaya: ise dho dalo aur dobara na karna, phir ise dho dalo aur dobara na karna, Ya'la ne farmaya: maine ise dho dala aur dobara nahi karunga, phir ise dho dala aur dobara nahi karunga, phir ise dho dala aur dobara nahi karunga."
"841","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Asim al-Ahwal ne hum se bayan kiya, Hafsa bint Sirin se, Al-Rabab se, un ke chacha Salman ibn Amir al-Dabbi se, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Allah ke Rasool Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ko farmate hue suna: Ladke ke saath us ka aqiqa hai, pas us ki taraf se khoon bahao aur us se takleef door karo."
"842","Unhon ne kaha: Aur main ne Allah ke Rasool Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ko farmate hue suna: Jab tum mein se koi roza iftar kare to khajoor se iftar kare, kyunki us mein barkat hai, pas agar woh na hon to pani se, kyunki woh pak karne wala hai."
"843","Aur main ne Allah ke Rasool Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ko farmate hue suna: Miskeen par sadqa sadqa hai, aur hajatmand rishtedar par do cheezen hain: sadqa aur silah rahmi."
"844","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ziyad ibn Ilaqa ne mujh se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Usama ibn Sharik al-Amiri ko kehte hue suna: Main dehatiyon ke paas hazir tha jab woh Allah ke Rasool Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam se sawal kar rahe the: Kya hum par falan falan mein, falan falan mein koi gunah hai? Aap ne farmaya: Ae Allah ke bando, Allah ne haraj door kar diya hai, siwa us ke jo apne bhai ki izzat me se kisi cheez ki gheebat kare, pas wahi hai jo tangi aur halakat mein hai, unhon ne kaha: Ae Allah ke Rasool, kya hum ilaj karwayen? Aap ne farmaya: Ilaj karwao ae Allah ke bando, kyunki Allah ne koi bimari nazil nahin ki magar us ke liye shifa nazil ki hai, siwa burhape ke, unhon ne kaha: Ae Allah ke Rasool, Musalman bande ko di gayi sab se behtareen cheez kya hai? Aap ne farmaya: Husn e akhlaq."
"845","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ziyad ibn Ilaqa ne mujh se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Main ne apne chacha Qutba ibn Malik ko kehte hue suna: Main ne Allah ke Rasool Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ko fajr ki namaz mein tilawat farmate hue suna: Aur buland khajoor ke darakht."
"846","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Amr ibn Dinar ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Abu al-Tufayl, Amir ibn Wathila ko kehte hue suna: Main ne Abu Sariha, Hudhayfa ibn Asid al-Ghifari ko kehte hue suna: Allah ke Rasool Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya: Farishta nutfe par dakhil hota hai jab woh rehem mein thehar jaye, chalees ke baad, ya unhon ne kaha paintalis, raaton ke baad, aur kehta hai: Mere Rab, badbakht ya khushbakht? Mard ya aurat? Pas Allah farmata hai, aur dono likh diye jate hain, phir us ka amal aur us ka rizq aur us ki muddat aur us ka nishan aur us ki museebat likh di jati hai, phir saheefa lapet diya jata hai, pas na us mein kuch barhaya jata hai aur na kam kiya jata hai, aur Sufyan kabhi kehte the: Qayamat ke din tak, aur kabhi ise nahin kehte the."
"847","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Furat al-Qazzaz ne hum se bayan kiya, ke unhon ne Abu al-Tufayl se suna ke woh Abu Sariha al-Ghifari se bayan kar rahe the ke unhon ne kaha: Allah ke Rasool Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne apne ek bala khane se hum par jhanka jab hum Qayamat ka zikr kar rahe the, aur farmaya: Tum kya zikr kar rahe the? Hum ne kaha: Qayamat ka, Allah ke Rasool Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya: Woh nahin aayegi yahan tak ke us mein das hon: Dajjal, aur Dhuan, aur Dabba, aur suraj ka apne maghrib se tulu hona, aur Isa ibn Maryam ka nazil hona, aur Yajuj aur Majuj, aur teen khusuf: mashriq mein khusuf, aur maghrib mein khusuf, aur Jazeera e Arab mein khusuf, aur us ka aakhir Aden se nikalne wali aag hai, ya unhon ne kaha Aden ke gehrai se, jo logon ko un ki jama hone ki jagah ki taraf hankegi."
"848","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Al-Zuhri ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ubayd Allah ibn Abd Allah ibn Thalaba ne mujhe khabar di ke unhon ne Abd al-Rahman ibn Yazid ibn Jariya ko kehte hue suna: Main ne apne chacha Mujammi ibn Jariya ko kehte hue suna: Main ne Allah ke Rasool Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ko suna, aur unhon ne Dajjal ka zikr kiya, farmate hue: Us Zat ki qasam jis ke hath mein meri jaan hai, Ibn Maryam use zaroor Bab e Ludd par qatl karenge."
"849","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ayyub al-Sakhtiyani ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Abu Qilaba ko apne chacha se, Imran ibn Husayn se bayan karte hue suna, unhon ne kaha: Banu Uqayl zamana e jahiliyat mein Thaqif ke haleef the, aur Thaqif ne Musalmanon ke do admiyon ko qaid kar liya tha, phir Musalmanon ne Uqayl ke ek aadmi ko us ki untni samet qaid kar liya, aur us ke paas ek untni thi jo zamana e jahiliyat mein hajiyon se itni martaba aage nikal chuki thi, aur jab koi untni zamana e jahiliyat mein hajiyon se aage nikal jati to use na charne ki jagah se roka jata jahan woh charti aur na hawz se jahan se woh peeti, unhon ne kaha: Use Nabi Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ke paas laya gaya aur us ne kaha: Ae Muhammad, tum ne mujhe kyun pakda aur hajiyon ki peshrow ko kyun pakda? Aap ne farmaya: Tumhare haleefon, Thaqif ke jurm ki wajah se, unhon ne kaha: Aur use wahan rok kar rakha gaya jahan se Allah ke Rasool Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam guzarte the, unhon ne kaha: Allah ke Rasool Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam us ke paas se guzre to us ne kaha: Ae Muhammad, main Musalman hun, Nabi Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya: Agar tum ise us waqt kehte jab tum apne mamle ke malik the to tum mukammal kamyabi pa lete, unhon ne kaha: Phir doosri martaba us ke paas se guzre to us ne kaha: Ae Muhammad, main bhooka hun, mujhe khilao, aur pyasa hun, mujhe pilao, Aap ne farmaya: Yehi tumhari hajat hai, phir Allah ke Rasool Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne faisla farmaya, aur us ke badle un do admiyon ka fidya diya jinhen Thaqif ne qaid kiya tha, aur untni ko apne liye rakh liya, phir ek dushman ne Madina par chhapa mara aur Allah ke Rasool Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ke charne wale maweshiyon ko le gaya, un mein untni ko bhi pakad liya, unhon ne kaha: Aur un ke paas ek Musalman aurat thi jise unhon ne qaid kiya tha, aur woh maweshiyon ko shaam ko ghar late the, ek raat aurat maweshiyon ke paas aayi aur kisi oont ke paas na aati magar woh bilbilata, yahan tak ke woh us untni tak pahunchi, aur us ne bilbilahat nahin ki, pas woh us par sawar hui aur bhaag nikli, Madina pahunch gayi, logon ne kaha: Al-Adba, Al-Adba, unhon ne kaha: Aurat ne kaha: Main ne nazr mani thi ke agar Allah ne mujhe is par nijaat di to main ise zibah karungi, Allah ke Rasool Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya: Tum ne use bura badla diya hai, Allah ki nafarmani mein nazr poori karna nahin hai, aur na us cheez mein jiska Ibn Adam malik nahin hai."
"850","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Char ya panch ne hum se bayan kiya, un mein Ali ibn Zayd ibn Judan the, Al-Hasan se, Imran ibn Husayn se: ke ek aadmi ne apni maut ke waqt apne chhe ghulamon ko azad kiya, un ke siwa us ke paas koi maal na tha, Nabi Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne un mein qura andazi ki, do ko azad kiya aur char ko ghulam rakha, aur farmaya: Agar main us tak pahunchta to us par namaz na parhta."
"851","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ibn Jud'an ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Main ne al-Hasan ko kehte hue suna: Imran ibn Husayn ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hum Nabi Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ke sath Aap ke ek safar mein thay jab Aap par ye nazil hua: Ae logo, apne Rab se daro, beshak Qayamat ka zalzala bahut bari cheez hai, to Rasulullah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya: Kya tum jante ho woh kaun sa din hai, unhon ne kaha: Allah aur Us ke Rasul zyada jante hain, Aap ne farmaya: Woh aisa din hai jab Allah Adam se kahega: Ae Adam, khare ho jao aur Aag ka wafd bhej do, woh kahenge: Mere Rab, Aag ka wafd kya hai, Woh kahega: Har hazaar mein se nau sau ninanwe Aag ki taraf aur ek Jannat ki taraf, unhon ne kaha: Log rone lage, to Rasulullah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya: Koi Islam aisa kabhi na tha magar us se pehle jahiliyat thi, tadad jahiliyat mein se li jayegi aur agar poori na hui to munafiqeen mein se poori ki jayegi, aur qaumon mein tumhari misaal sirf aisi hai jaise janwar ke agle paon ki safedi ho ya oont ke pehlu ka til ho, phir Aap ne farmaya: Mujhe ummeed hai ke tum Ahl-e-Jannat ka chauthai hoge, to unhon ne Allahu Akbar kaha, phir Aap ne farmaya: Mujhe ummeed hai ke tum Ahl-e-Jannat ka teesra hissa hoge, to unhon ne Allahu Akbar kaha, phir Aap ne farmaya: Mujhe ummeed hai ke tum Ahl-e-Jannat ka aadha hoge, to unhon ne Allahu Akbar kaha, Sufyan ne kaha: Mera hifz aadhe par khatam hota hai, aur main sirf itna janta hun ke Aap ne farmaya: Mujhe ummeed hai ke tum Ahl-e-Jannat ke do tihai hoge, ya kisi aur ne ye kaha."
"852","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ibn Jud'an ne hum se bayan kiya, al-Hasan se, Imran ibn Husayn se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya: Jahan tak mera talluq hai, main tek laga kar nahi khata, lekin woh khana khata tha aur bazaron mein chalta tha, yani Dajjal."
"853","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ibn Jud'an ne hum se bayan kiya, al-Hasan se, Imran ibn Husayn se: Ke Umar ibn al-Khattab ne logon ko qasam de kar kaha: Kis ne Nabi Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam se dada ke bare mein koi faisla suna hai, to ek shakhs khara hua aur kaha: Main gawahi deta hun ke Aap ne use teesra hissa diya, unhon ne kaha: Kis ke sath, us ne kaha: Main nahi janta, unhon ne kaha: Tum nahi jante."
"854","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha, aur ek aur ne kaha: al-Hasan se, Imran ibn Husayn se: Aur ek aur un ke samne khara hua aur kaha: Main gawahi deta hun ke Aap ne use chhata hissa diya, unhon ne kaha: Kis ke sath, us ne kaha: Main nahi janta, unhon ne kaha: Tum nahi jante."
"855","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Isma'il ibn Muslim ne hum se bayan kiya, Qatada se, Zurara ibn Awfa se, Imran ibn Husayn se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne zuhr ki namaz parhai, phir jab Aap farigh hue to farmaya: Kya tum mein se kisi ne Sabbih isma Rabbikal A'la parhi, to ek shakhs ne kaha: Ji haan, main ne parhi, to Nabi Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya: Mera khayal tha ke tum mein se koi mujh se us mein jhagad raha tha."
"856","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Husayn ne hum se bayan kiya, al-Sha'bi se, Imran ibn Husayn se, ke Rasulullah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya: Nazar-e-bad ya dank ke siwa koi dam nahi."
"857","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Suhayl ibn Abi Salih ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ata ibn Yazid al-Laythi ne mujhe khabar di, jo mere walid ke dost thay Sham walon mein se, Tamim al-Dari se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya: Deen khair-khwahi hai, deen khair-khwahi hai, deen khair-khwahi hai, unhon ne kaha: Kis ke liye, Ae Allah ke Rasul, Aap ne farmaya: Allah ke liye, Us ki Kitab ke liye, Us ke Nabi ke liye, Musalmanon ke imamon ke liye aur un ke aam logon ke liye, Sufyan ne kaha: Amr ibn Dinar ne humein pehle isay al-Qa'qa' ibn Hakim se, Abu Salih se bayan kiya tha, phir jab main Suhayl se mila to main ne kaha: Kash main us se poochhun, shayad woh mujhe apne walid se bayan kare taake main aur Amr is mein barabar ho jayen, to main ne us se poocha, to Suhayl ne kaha: Main ne usi se suna jis se mere walid ne suna tha, Ata ibn Yazid ne mujhe khabar di."
"858","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Safwan ibn Sulaym ne hum se bayan kiya, Unaysa nam ki ek aurat se, Umm Sa'id bint Murra al-Fihri se, apne walid se, ke Rasulullah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya: Main aur yateem ka kafil, apne liye ho ya ghair ke liye, Jannat mein in do ki tarah honge, aur Sufyan ne apni do unglion se ishara kiya."
"859","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Isma'il ibn Umayya ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Mere liye sabit hua ke Rasulullah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya: Main aur yateem ka kafil, apne liye ho ya ghair ke liye, Jannat mein in do ki tarah honge, jab woh Allah se darne wala ho, aur al-Humaydi ne apni ungli se ishara kiya."
"860","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: al-Zuhri aur Hisham ibn Urwa ne hum se bayan kiya, dono ne kaha: Urwa ne humein khabar di ke unhon ne Abu Humayd al-Sa'idi ko kehte hue suna: Rasulullah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne Azd ke ek shakhs jise Ibn al-Lutbiyya kaha jata tha sadqe par muqarrar kiya, phir jab woh aya to kaha: Ye tumhara maal hai, aur ye mujhe tohfe mein diya gaya tha, unhon ne kaha: To Nabi Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam mimbar par khare hue, Allah ki hamd ki aur Us ki sana bayan ki, phir farmaya: Us karkun ka kya haal hai jise hum apne kisi kaam par bhejte hain, phir woh kehta hai: Ye tumhara maal hai, aur ye mujhe tohfe mein diya gaya hai, woh apne baap ke ghar ya apni maan ke ghar kyun na baitha raha aur dekhta ke aya use tohfa milta hai ya nahi, phir Aap ne farmaya: Us Zaat ki qasam jis ke hath mein meri jaan hai, tum mein se koi us mein se kuch nahi leta magar woh Qayamat ke din use apni gardan par uthaye hue ayega, chahe oont ho apni aawaz ke sath, gaaye ho apni aawaz ke sath, ya bakri ho mimmiyati hui, phir Rasulullah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne apne dono hath buland kiye yahan tak ke hum ne Aap ki baghlon ki safedi dekhi, phir farmaya: Ae Allah, kya main ne pahuncha diya, Ae Allah, kya main ne pahuncha diya, Sufyan ne kaha: Aur Hisham ne is mein izafa kiya: Abu Humayd ne kaha: Meri aankh ne Rasulullah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam se dekha aur mere kaan ne suna, aur Zayd ibn Thabit se poochh lo, kyunke woh mere sath hazir thay."
"861","Abd al-Ghaffar ibn Zayd al-Mu'addib ne saal chaar sau sattais me hamein qiraat karke sunaya jabke main sun raha tha, aur unhon ne us ka iqrar kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Ali Muhammad ibn Ahmad ibn al-Hasan ibn al-Sawwaf ne hamein hadees bayan ki, unhen qiraat karke sunaya gaya jabke main sun raha tha, unhon ne kaha: Bishr ibn Musa ne hamein hadees bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: Al-Humaydi ne hamein hadees bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hamein hadees bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: Shabib ibn Gharqada ne hamein hadees bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: Maine Urwa ibn Abi al-Ja'd al-Bariqi ko kehte hue suna: Maine Rasul Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ko farmate hue suna: Ghoron ki peshaniyon me Qayamat ke din tak bhalai bandhi hui hai."
"862","Al-Humaydi ne hamein hadees bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hamein hadees bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: Mujalid ne hamein hadees bayan ki, al-Sha'bi se, Urwa se, Nabi Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam se, usi ki manind, us me ye izafa karte hue: Ajr aur ghanimat."
"863","Al-Humaydi ne hamein hadees bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hamein hadees bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: Shabib ibn Gharqada ne hamein hadees bayan ki ke unhon ne qabile ko Urwa ibn Abi al-Ja'd al-Bariqi se riwayat karte hue suna: ke Rasul Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne unhen apne liye qurbani ka janwar kharidne ke liye ek dinar diya, Urwa ne kaha: Maine us se un ke liye do bakriyan kharidin, phir un me se ek ko ek dinar me bech diya, aur un ke paas ek dinar aur ek bakri le aaya, unhon ne kaha: To unhon ne mere liye tijarat me barkat ki dua farmai, unhon ne kaha: Agar main mitti bhi kharidta to us me bhi nafa kamata, Sufyan ne kaha: Aur al-Hasan ibn Umara, jinhen maine ise bayan karte hue suna, unhon ne us me kaha: Maine Shabib ko kehte hue suna: Maine Urwa se suna, jab maine Shabib se us ke bare me pucha to unhon ne kaha: Maine ise Urwa se nahi suna, qabile ne mujhe ise Urwa se bayan kiya."
"864","Al-Humaydi ne hamein hadees bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hamein hadees bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: Abd al-Rahman ibn Humayd ibn Abd al-Rahman ibn Awf ne hamein hadees bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: Maine Umar ibn Abd al-Aziz ko al-Sa'ib ibn Yazid aur un ke sathiyon se puchte hue suna: Tum ne Makkah me theherne ke bare me kya suna hai, al-Sa'ib ibn Yazid ne kaha: Mujhe al-Ala ibn al-Hadrami ne khabar di ke Rasul Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya: Apne manasik mukammal karne ke baad Muhajir ka Makkah me theherna teen din hai."
"865","Al-Humaydi ne hamein hadees bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hamein hadees bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: Banu Ghifar ke ek shaykh jinhen al-Haytham ibn Abi al-As'ad kaha jata hai ne apne walid se hamein hadees bayan ki: ke Abu Dharr umre ke mauqe par un ke paas theherte the, teen din rehte phir rawana ho jate."
"866","Al-Humaydi ne hamein hadees bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hamein hadees bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: al-Zuhri ne hamein hadees bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: Mujhe al-Rabi' ibn Sabra ne apne walid se khabar di, unhon ne kaha: Rasul Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne Fath wale saal mut'a se mana farmaya."
"867","Al-Humaydi ne hamein hadees bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hamein hadees bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: Abd al-Aziz ibn Umar ibn Abd al-Aziz ne hamein hadees bayan ki, al-Rabi' ibn Sabra al-Juhani se, unhon ne apne walid se, unhon ne kaha: Rasul Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne hamein mut'a ki ijazat di thi, phir jab hum Makkah pahunche to main aur mera ek chachazad ek naujawan ladki ki taraf nikle, mere paas ek chadar thi aur mere chachazad ke paas mujh se behtar chadar thi, jabke main apne chachazad se chhota tha, woh musalsal dekhti rahi aur kaha: Chadar jaisi chadar, aur us ne mujhe pasand kiya, to maine use apni chadar de di, phir main us ke paas jitna Allah ne chaha thehra raha, phir main Rasul Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ke paas aaya aur unhen Darwaze aur Zamzam ke darmiyan khade paya, Rasul Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya: Hum ne tumhen is mut'a ki ijazat di thi, to jis ke paas in aurton me se koi ho woh use chhod de, kyunke Allah ne use Qayamat ke din tak haram kar diya hai, aur jo kuch tum ne unhen diya us me se kuch wapas na lo."
"868","Al-Humaydi ne hamein hadees bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hamein hadees bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: al-Zuhri ne hamein hadees bayan ki, Sinan ibn Abi Sinan se, Abu Waqid al-Laythi se: ke jab Rasul Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam Hunayn ki taraf nikle to Dhat Anwar nami ek darakht ke paas se guzre jis par mushrik apne hathiyar latkate the, unhon ne kaha: Ae Allah ke Rasul, hamare liye bhi ek Dhat Anwar bana dijiye jaisa un ka Dhat Anwar hai, Nabi Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya: Allah sab se bada hai, ye waisa hi hai jaisa Bani Israil ne kaha: Hamare liye ek mabud bana dijiye jaisa un ke mabud hain, tum zarur apne se pehlon ke tariqon ki pairwi karoge."
"869","Al-Humaydi ne hamein hadees bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hamein hadees bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: Damra ibn Sa'id al-Mazini ne hamein hadees bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: Maine Ubayd Allah ibn Utba ko kehte hue suna: Umar ibn al-Khattab Eid ke din nikle aur Abu Waqid al-Laythi se pucha: Nabi Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam is din me kya qiraat farmate the, Abu Waqid ne kaha: Qaf ke saath, aur: Iqtarabati al-Sa'ah ke saath."
"870","Al-Humaydi ne hamein hadees bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hamein hadees bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: Ayyub al-Sakhtiyani ne hamein hadees bayan ki, Abu Qilaba se, Thabit ibn al-Dahhak se, unhon ne kaha: Rasul Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya: Jo shakhs is duniya me kisi cheez se khud ko qatl karega use Qayamat ke din usi se azab diya jayega."
"871","Hamein Al-Humaydi ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: hamein Sufyan ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: hamein Muhammad ibn Ajlan ne bayan kiya, Sa'id ibn Abi Sa'id al-Maqburi se, un se jis ne un se bayan kiya, Uqba ibn Amir se, unhon ne kaha: main Nabi Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ke sath ek ghati se utra, to Aap ne mujh se farmaya: kaho, ae Uqba. Main ne kaha: ae Allah ke Rasool, main kya kahun? Aur hum juda ho gaye. Main ne kaha: ae Allah, ise mujhe Apne Nabi se wapas dila de. Phir hum mile aur Aap ne mujh se farmaya: kaho, ae Uqba. Main ne kaha: ae Allah ke Rasool, main kya kahun? Phir hum juda ho gaye. Main ne kaha: ae Allah, ise mujhe Apne Nabi se wapas dila de. Phir hum mile aur Aap ne mujh se farmaya: kaho, ae Uqba. Main ne kaha: ae Allah ke Rasool, main kya kahun? Aap ne farmaya: kaho: Woh Allah hai, Woh Ek hai, aur: kaho: main subah ke Rab ki panah mangta hun, aur: kaho: main logon ke Rab ki panah mangta hun. Panah mangne wale ne kabhi in jaisi cheezon se panah nahi mangi aur hifazat chahne wale ne kabhi in jaisi cheezon se hifazat nahi chahi."
"872","Hamein Al-Humaydi ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: hamein Sufyan ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: hamein Humayd al-A'raj ne bayan kiya, Muhammad ibn Ibrahim se, apni qaum ke ek shakhs se jise Mu'adh ya Ibn Mu'adh kaha jata tha: ke Rasool Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne logon ko Mina mein un ki manazil mein thahraya, Muhajirin ko thahraya aur Ansar ko un ke mohalle mein thahraya. Unhon ne kaha: aur Aap ne logon ko un ke manasik sikhaye. Unhon ne kaha: aur Allah ne hamari sama'at khol di, chunache hum apne thikanon mein hote hue sunte the. Jo kuch Aap ne hamein sikhaya us mein se tha ke Aap ne farmaya: jab tum Jamra ko kankariyan maro to khadhf wali kankariyon jaisi kankariyon se maro."
"873","Hamein Al-Humaydi ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: hamein Sufyan ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: hamein Abd Allah ibn Abi Bakr ibn Muhammad ibn Amr ibn Hazm ne bayan kiya, Abd al-Malik ibn Abi Bakr ibn Abd al-Rahman ibn al-Harith ibn Hisham se, Khallad ibn al-Sa'ib se, apne walid al-Sa'ib ibn Khallad se, unhon ne kaha: Rasool Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya: Jibril Alaihis Salam mere paas aaye aur farmaya: apne sathiyon ko hukm dein ke ihlal ke sath, ya farmaya talbiya ke sath, apni awazein buland karein. Sufyan ne kaha: Ibn Jurayj ne mujh se ek hadees chhupai thi. Jab Abd Allah ibn Abi Bakr hamare paas aaye to main ne unhein us ki khabar na di. Jab woh Medina ki taraf rawana hue to main ne unhein woh bayan ki, aur unhon ne mujh se kaha: ae Awf, tum hum se hadeesein chhupate ho, aur jab un wale chale jate hain to tum hamein un se agah karte ho; main ise tum se riwayat nahi karunga. Kya tum chahte ho ke main ise tum se riwayat karun? Aur unhon ne Abd Allah ibn Abi Bakr ko khat likha, aur Abd Allah ibn Abi Bakr ne unhein woh likh bheja. Aur Ibn Jurayj ise riwayat karte the: mujhe Abd Allah ibn Abi Bakr ne likha."
"874","Hamein Al-Humaydi ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: hamein Sufyan ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: hamein Abd Allah ibn Abi Bakr ne bayan kiya, apne walid se, Abu al-Baddah se, apne walid se: ke Rasool Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne charwahon ko ijazat di ke woh ek din kankariyan marein aur ek din chhod dein."
"875","Hamein Al-Humaydi ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: hamein Sufyan ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: hamein Isma'il ibn Abi Khalid ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: main ne Qays ibn Abi Hazim ko kehte hue suna: main ne al-Mustawrid, Banu Fihr ke bhai, ko kehte hue suna: main ne Rasool Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ko farmate hue suna: ye dunya Akhirat ke muqable mein sirf is tarah hai jaise tum mein se koi apni ungli samandar mein dale, phir dekhe ke woh kya lekar laut-ti hai. Sufyan ne kaha: Ibn Abi Khalid is mein kehte the: main ne al-Mustawrid, Banu Fihr ke bhai, se suna, is mein ghalat i'rab karte hue, to main ne kaha: Banu Fihr ke bhai, nasb ki halat mein."
"876","Hamein Al-Humaydi ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: hamein Sufyan ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: hamein Mansur ibn al-Mu'tamir ne bayan kiya, Hilal ibn Yasaf se, Salama ibn Qays al-Ashja'i se, unhon ne kaha: Rasool Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya: jab tum wuzu karo to naak mein pani dalo, aur jab pathron se istinja karo to taaq adad istemal karo."
"877","Hamein Al-Humaydi ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: hamein Sufyan ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: hamein Salim Abu al-Nadr ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: mujhe Zur'a ibn Muslim ibn Jarhad ne bayan kiya, apne dada Jarhad se, unhon ne kaha: Rasool Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam mere paas se guzre jabke main masjid mein ek chadar mein tha aur meri raan khuli hui thi. Nabi Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya: apni raan dhanko, ae Jarhad, kyunke raan satr hai."
"878","Hamein Al-Humaydi ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: hamein Sufyan ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: hamein Abu al-Zinad ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: mujhe Jarhad ke ghar walon ne bayan kiya, Jarhad se, Nabi Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam se, isi jaisi hadees."
"879","Hamein Al-Humaydi ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: hamein Sufyan ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: hamein Amr ibn Dinar ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: main ne Jabir ibn Zayd se kaha: woh da'wa karte hain ke Rasool Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne ghar ke gadhon ke gosht se mana farmaya tha. Unhon ne kaha: al-Hakam ibn Amr al-Ghifari hamare darmiyan Rasool Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam se yahi kehte the; lekin Bahr, yani Ibn Abbas, ne is se inkar kiya, ye tilawat karte hue: kaho: main us mein jo meri taraf wahi ki gayi hai koi haram cheez nahi pata, ayat ke akhir tak."
"880","Hamein Al-Humaydi ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: hamein Sufyan ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: hamein Isma'il ibn Abi Khalid ne bayan kiya, Hakim ibn Jabir se, apne walid se, unhon ne kaha: main Rasool Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ki khidmat mein hazir hua aur Aap ke paas kaddu dekha. Main ne kaha: ye kya hai, ae Allah ke Rasool? Aap ne farmaya: hum is se apne ghar walon ke khane mein izafa karte hain."
"881","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abd al-Malik ibn Umayr ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Maine Umara ibn Ruwayba al-Thaqafi ko kehte hue suna: Maine Allah ke Rasool Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ko farmate hue suna: Jo shakhs suraj nikalne se pehle aur suraj ghurub hone se pehle namaz padhe woh kabhi Jahannam mein dakhil nahi hoga."
"882","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Isma'il ibn Abi Khalid ne hum se bayan kiya, Abu Bakr ibn Umara ibn Ruwayba se, unhon ne kaha: Ahl-e-Basra mein se ek shakhs mere walid ke paas aaya aur kaha: Kya aap ne Allah ke Rasool Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ko farmate hue suna: Jo shakhs suraj nikalne se pehle aur suraj ghurub hone se pehle namaz padhe woh kabhi Jahannam mein dakhil nahi hoga? Mere walid ne kaha: Haan. Us Basra wale ne, is haal mein ke woh gawahi deta hai, kaha: Unhon ne yaqeenan ise Allah ke Rasool Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam se suna hai."
"883","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Isma'il ibn Umayya ne hum se bayan kiya, Muzahim ibn Abi Muzahim se, Abd al-Aziz ibn Abd Allah ibn Khalid ibn Asid se, Muharrish al-Ka'bi se, unhon ne kaha: Allah ke Rasool Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne al-Ji'rana se raat mein umra kiya, aur maine Aap ki pusht ko dekha goya ke woh chandi ki eent thi, aur Aap ne wahan raat guzar kar subah ki. Al-Humaydi ne kaha: Sufyan is mein kehte the: Muharrish al-Ka'bi, aur jab koi un se poochta to woh kehte: Muharrish, ya Mukharrish, ya Mikhrash, kabhi ye kehte aur kabhi woh, aur woh hamesha naam mein shak karte the. Al-Humaydi ne kaha: Aur woh Mukharrish hain."
"884","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Maine al-Zuhri ko kehte hue suna: Mujhe Safwan ibn Abd Allah ibn Safwan ne khabar di, Umm al-Darda se, Ka'b ibn Asim al-Ash'ari se, ke Allah ke Rasool Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya: Safar mein roza rakhna neki nahi hai."
"885","Sufyan ne kaha: Aur mujh se zikr kiya gaya ke al-Zuhri is mein kehte the, halanke maine ise khud nahi suna: Safar mein roza rakhna neki nahi hai, Himyar ki boli mein."
"886","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hisham ibn Urwa ne hum se bayan kiya, apne walid se, Abd Allah ibn al-Zubayr se, Sufyan ibn Abi Zuhayr se, unhon ne kaha: Maine Allah ke Rasool Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ko farmate hue suna: Yaman fatah hoga, to kuch log aayenge apne oonton ko hankte hue, apne ghar walon aur apni itaat karne walon ko lekar chalte hue, halanke Madina un ke liye behtar hai, kaash woh jaante. Phir Iraq fatah hoga, to kuch log aayenge apne oonton ko hankte hue, apne ghar walon aur apni itaat karne walon ko lekar chalte hue, halanke Madina un ke liye behtar hai, kaash woh jaante. Phir Sham fatah hoga, to kuch log aayenge apne oonton ko hankte hue, apne ghar walon aur apni itaat karne walon ko lekar chalte hue, halanke Madina un ke liye behtar hai, kaash woh jaante."
"887","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abd al-Malik ibn Sa'id ibn Abjar ne hum se bayan kiya, Iyad ibn Laqit se, Abu Rimtha al-Sulami se, unhon ne kaha: Main apne walid ke saath Allah ke Rasool Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ki khidmat mein hazir hua, aur mere walid ne Aap ki pusht par jo tha woh dekha aur kaha: Mujhe aap ki pusht par jo hai us ka ilaaj karne dijiye, kyunke main tabib hun. Aap ne farmaya: Tum rafiq ho, aur Allah Tabib hai. Unhon ne kaha: Aur Allah ke Rasool Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne mere walid se farmaya: Tumhare saath ye kaun hai? Unhon ne kaha: Mera beta hai; main aap ke samne is ke liye gawahi deta hun. Nabi Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya: Beshak tum is ke jurm par nahi pakde jaoge aur na woh tumhare jurm par pakda jayega. Aur unhon ne zikr kiya ke unhon ne Allah ke Rasool Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam par mehndi ka nishan dekha."
"888","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Asim al-Ahwal ne hum se bayan kiya, Abd Allah ibn Sarjis se, unhon ne kaha: Maine Allah ke Rasool Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ki pusht par jo tha use musht ki tarah dekha. Sufyan ne kaha: Bade seenghi ke nishan ki tarah."
"889","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sa'd ibn Sa'id ibn Qays al-Ansari ne hum se bayan kiya, Muhammad ibn Ibrahim ibn al-Harith al-Taymi se, Qays se jo Sa'd ke dada hain, unhon ne kaha: Allah ke Rasool Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne mujhe subah ki namaz ke baad do rak'atein padhte hue dekha aur farmaya: Ae Qays, ye do rak'atein kya hain? Maine kaha: Ae Allah ke Rasool, maine Fajr ki do rak'atein nahi padhi thin, to ye wohi do rak'atein hain. Phir Allah ke Rasool Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam khamosh rahe. Sufyan ne kaha: Ata ibn Abi Rabah ye hadith Sa'd ibn Sa'id se riwayat karte the."
"890","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ibn Abi al-Haytham al-Kufi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Maine Yusuf ibn Abd Allah ibn Salam ko kehte hue suna: Allah ke Rasool Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne mera naam Yusuf rakha."
"891","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Muhammad ibn al-Munkadir ne hum se bayan kiya, ke unhon ne Yusuf ibn Abd Allah ibn Salam ko yeh kehte hue suna: Nabi Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne Ansar ke ek mard aur ek aurat se farmaya: Ramazan ke mahine mein umrah karo, kyunke is mein tum dono ke liye ek umrah Hajj ke barabar hai."
"892","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Yazid ibn Yazid ibn Jabir al-Azdi ne hum se bayan kiya, Makhul se, Ziyad ibn Jariyah se, Habib ibn Maslamah al-Fihri se, unhon ne farmaya: Main ne Rasul Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ko muhim ke aaghaz mein teesra hissa izafi maal-e-ghanimat ke taur par dete hue dekha."
"893","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Hisham ibn Urwah ne hum se bayan kiya, apne walid se, Abd Allah ibn Arqam al-Zuhri se: ke woh kuch logon ke hamrah Makkah ki taraf nikle aur woh unhen namaz parhaya karte the, ek din unhon ne namaz ki iqamat kahi, ek aadmi ko imamat ke liye aage kiya, aur farmaya: Rasul Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya: Jab namaz ki iqamat kahi jaye aur tum mein se kisi ko qaza-e-hajat ki hajat mehsoos ho to use chahiye ke pehle qaza-e-hajat se farigh ho."
"894","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Amr ibn Dinar ne hum se bayan kiya, Ibn Shihab se, Ka'b ibn Malik ke bete se, unhon ne apne walid se: ke jab un ki maut ka waqt qareeb aaya to Umm Mubashshir ne un se kaha: Mubashshir ko salam pohuncha dena, Ka'b ne un se kaha: Ai Umm Mubashshir, kya yahi woh baat hai jo Rasul Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmayi thi, unhon ne kaha: Main nahin janti, main kamzor ho gayi hun, pas main Allah se bakhshish talab karti hun, phir Ka'b ne farmaya: Rasul Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya: Momin ki rooh ek sabz parinda hai jo Jannat ke phalon se khata hai."
"895","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: al-Zuhri ne farmaya: Mujhe Ka'b ibn Malik ke bete ne khabar di, unhon ne apne chacha se: ke jab Rasul Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne fulan shakhs ko — al-Zuhri ne us ka naam liya tha — Ibn Abi al-Huqayq ke muqable par bheja to unhon ne use aurton aur bachon ko qatl karne se mana farmaya."
"896","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Main ne al-Zuhri ko yeh kehte hue suna: Mujhe Abu Idris al-Khawlani ne khabar di, Abu Tha'labah al-Khushani se: ke Rasul Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne daant wale har darinde ke khane se mana farmaya, al-Zuhri ne farmaya: Main ne yeh hadith us waqt tak nahin suni thi jab tak main Sham nahin aaya."
"897","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: al-Zuhri ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Mujhe Ubayd Allah ibn Abd Allah ibn Umar ibn al-Khattab ne khabar di, Iyas ibn Abd Allah ibn Abi Dhubab se, unhon ne farmaya: Rasul Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya: Allah ki bandiyon ko na maro, unhon ne farmaya: Phir Umar aaye aur kaha: Ai Allah ke Rasul, jab se aap ne unhen marne se mana farmaya hai aurten apne shoharon par diler ho gayi hain, pas aap ne unhen marne ki ijazat de di aur unhon ne mara, phir bahut si aurten shikayat karti hui Muhammad ke ghar walon ke gird jama ho gayin, aur Rasul Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya: Aaj raat Muhammad ke ghar walon ke gird sattar aurten jama hui hain, un mein se har ek apne shohar ki shikayat karti hai, aur tum un mardon ko apne mein se behtareen nahin paoge."
"898","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Hisham ibn Urwah ne hum se bayan kiya, apne walid se, al-Hajjaj al-Aslami se, unhon ne apne walid se, unhon ne farmaya: Main ne kaha: Ai Allah ke Rasul, doodh pilane ka gunah mujh se kya door karega, Aap ne farmaya: Ek ghulam ya ek laundi ka iwaz."
"899","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: al-Zuhri ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Mujhe Haram ibn Sa'd ne khabar di — Sufyan ne farmaya: yahi woh hain jin ke bare mein koi shak nahin — aur mera khayal hai ke unhon ne usay apne walid se zikr kiya: ke Muhayyisah ne Nabi Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam se apne ek seenghi lagane wale ki kamai ke bare mein pucha to Aap ne use us se mana farmaya, woh Aap se baat karte rahe yahan tak ke Aap ne un se farmaya: Use apne pani lane wale oont ko khilao ya apne ghulamon ko khilao."
"900","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Ziyad ibn Sa'd aur Muhammad ibn Ajlan ne hum se bayan kiya, ke un dono ne Amir ibn Abd Allah ibn al-Zubayr ko apne walid se riwayat karte hue suna: ke unhon ne Rasul Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ko namaz mein is tarah dua karte hue dekha, aur al-Humaydi ne apni chaar ungliyon ko band kiya aur shahadat ki ungli se ishara kiya, Abu Ali — ya'ni Bishr ibn Musa — ne farmaya: Abu Bakr hi hain jinhon ne humen usay bayan karke bataya, al-Humaydi ne farmaya: Aur Sufyan ne farmaya: Ziyad ibn Sa'd ne mujh se chaar ahadith bayan ki thin jo Ibn al-Zubayr ne Nabi Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam se suni thin, aur main ne unhen bayan kiya tha lekin is ek ke siwa unhen bhool gaya, phir Ziyad ne mujh se kaha: Woh sirf chaar hi hain."
"901","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hisham ibn Urwah ne hum se bayan kiya, apne walid se, Najiyah al-Khuzai se, jo Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ke qurbani ke oonton par muqarrar thay, unhon ne kaha: Main ne arz kiya: Ya Rasoolullah, jo hadi ke oont raste mein aajiz ho kar baith jayen un ke sath main kya karoon? Aap ne farmaya: Use zibah kar do, phir us ke naal ko us ke khoon mein dubo do, phir us se us ke pehlu par nishan lagao, phir use logon ke liye chhor do."
"902","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Asim ibn Bahdalah ne hum se bayan kiya, hamen khabar dete hue ke Zirr ibn Hubaysh ne kaha: Main Safwan ibn Assal al-Muradi ki khidmat mein hazir hua to unhon ne mujh se kaha: Tumhen kya cheez layi hai? Main ne kaha: Ilm talab karna. Unhon ne kaha: Farishte talib-e-ilm ke liye apne par jhuka dete hain, us se khush ho kar jo woh talab karta hai. Main ne kaha: Qaza-e-hajat ke baad mozon par masah ke bare mein mere zehen mein khalish paida hui hai, aur aap Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ke Sahaba mein se ek shakhs thay, is liye main aap se puchne ke liye aaya hoon: Kya aap ne is bare mein Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam se kuch suna hai? Unhon ne kaha: Haan, Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam jab hum safar mein hote to hamen hukm farmate ke teen din aur un ki raaton tak janabat ke siwa apne moze na utaren, lekin pakhana, peshab aur neend ke liye hum masah karte thay. Main ne kaha: Kya aap ne Aap ko muhabbat ke bare mein kuch zikr farmate hue suna hai? Unhon ne kaha: Haan, jab hum Aap ke sath Aap ke ek safar mein thay, ek dehati ne Aap ko buland awaz se pukara: Ya Muhammad. Nabi Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne unhi ke lehje mein jawab farmaya: Hazir hoon. Hum ne us se kaha: Apni awaz past karo, kyunke tumhen is se mana kiya gaya hai. Us ne kaha: Nahin, Allah ki qasam, main apni awaz past nahin karoon ga. Phir us ne kaha: Ya Rasoolullah, ek shakhs ek qaum se muhabbat karta hai lekin abhi tak un se ja nahin mila? Aap ne farmaya: Aadmi unhi ke sath hai jin se woh muhabbat karta hai. Unhon ne kaha: Phir Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam hum se bayan farmate rahe yahan tak ke farmaya: Maghrib ki taraf ek darwaza hai jis ki chaudai chalis ya sattar saal ki musafat hai, jise Allah ne us din tauba ke liye khola jis din Us ne aasmanon aur zameen ko paida kiya, aur Use us waqt tak band nahin karega jab tak suraj us ki taraf se tulu na ho jaye."
"903","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: al-Amash ne hum se bayan kiya, Zayd ibn Wahb se, Abd al-Rahman ibn Hasanah se, unhon ne kaha: Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne baith kar peshab farmaya, ek dhal ke pichhe pardah farmate hue, aur logon ne kaha: Woh aurat ki tarah peshab karte hain. Phir Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya: Bani Israil mein se jab kisi ko peshab lag jata to use qainchi se kaat dalta tha, aur un ke sathi ne unhen is se mana kiya, to ab use apni qabr mein azab diya ja raha hai."
"904","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu al-Zara Amr ibn Amr ne hum se bayan kiya, apne chacha Abu al-Ahwas Awf ibn Malik al-Jushami se, apne walid se, unhon ne kaha: Main Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ki khidmat mein hazir hua, to Aap ne mujhe upar se niche tak dekha phir farmaya: Kya tum oonton wale ho ya bakriyon wale ho? Aur oonton wala bakriyon wale se apni waza se pehchana jata tha. Main ne kaha: Allah ne mujhe har qism mein se kasrat se ata farmaya hai. Aap ne farmaya: Kya tum unhen sahi aankhon aur kaanon wale paida nahin karte, phir tum is ko kaat kar kehte ho ke yeh buton ke liye hai, aur is ko cheer kar kehte ho ke yeh Bahirah hai? Allah ka hath zyada zabardast hai aur Us ki chhuri zyada tez hai; agar Woh chahta ke woh tumhare paas baghair kate kaan ke aayen to Woh aisa kar deta. Phir main ne kaha: Ya Rasoolullah, aap kis cheez ki dawat dete hain? Aap ne farmaya: Sirf Allah aur sila rehmi ki. Main ne kaha: Ya Rasoolullah, aap kis cheez ke sath bheje gaye hain? Aap ne farmaya: Mere Rab ki taraf se mere paas ek paigham aaya aur main us se tang dil hua, mujhe darr hua ke meri qaum mujhe jhutlayegi, aur mujh se kaha gaya: Tum zaroor use poora karoge. Main ne kaha: Ya Rasoolullah, mera chachazad mere paas aata hai to main qasam khata hoon ke na use doon ga aur na sila rehmi karoon ga. Aap ne farmaya: Apni qasam ka kaffara ada karo. Unhon ne kaha: Phir unhon ne farmaya: Mujhe batao, agar tumhare do ghulam hon, ek jo na tum se khayanat karta hai, na tum se koi khabar chhupata hai, aur na tum se jhoot bolta hai, aur dusra jo tum se jhoot bolta hai, tum se chhupata hai, aur tum se khayanat karta hai, to un dono mein se tumhen kaun zyada mehboob hai? Main ne kaha: Jo na mujh se jhoot bolta hai, na mujh se khayanat karta hai, aur na mujh se chhupata hai. Phir Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya: To isi tarah tum apne Rab ki nazar mein ho."
"905","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Husayn ibn Abd al-Rahman ne hum se bayan kiya, Hilal ibn Yasaf se, unhon ne kaha: Main al-Raqqah mein Ziyad ibn Abi al-Jad ke sath tha, aur Ziyad ibn Abi al-Jad ne mera hath pakda aur mujhe al-Raqqah mein ek shakhs ke samne khada kiya aur kaha: Yeh shakhs dawa karta hai ke Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne ek shakhs ko saf ke pichhe akele namaz padhte hue dekha to Nabi Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne use namaz dohrane ka hukm farmaya. Aur un ka naam Wabisah ibn Mabad hai."
"906","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Asim ibn Kulayb al-Jarmi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Main ne apne walid ko kehte hue suna: Main ne Wail ibn Hujr al-Hadrami ko kehte hue suna: Main ne Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ko dekha ke Aap ne apne dono hath uthaye jab Aap ne namaz shuru ki, jab ruku kiya, aur jab Aap ne ruku se apna sar uthaya. Aur main ne Aap ko dekha ke jab Aap namaz mein baithe to Aap ne apna bayan paon bicha diya, apna dayan paon khada rakha, apna bayan hath apni bayan raan par rakha use phailate hue, apna dayan hath apni dayan raan par rakha, do ungliyan band kin, halqah banaya, aur is tarah dua mangi. Aur Al-Humaydi ne shahadat ki ungli uthai. Wail ne kaha: Phir main sardiyon mein un ke paas aaya to unhen apne hath apni chadaron ke andar uthate hue dekha."
"907","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Misar ne hum se bayan kiya, Abd al-Jabbar ibn Wail se, un ke walid se, unhon ne kaha: Nabi Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ki khidmat mein Zamzam ke pani ka ek dol laya gaya. Aap ne piya, phir wuzu farmaya aur kulli farmai, phir use mushk ke taur par ya unhon ne kaha, mushk se zyada meetha dol mein thook diya, aur dol ke bahar naak jhari."
"908","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ayyub al-Sakhtiyani ne hum se bayan kiya, Said ibn Jubayr se, unhon ne kaha: Abd Allah ibn Mughaffal ke ek rishtedar ne un ke samne kankariyan phenkin to unhon ne use is se mana kiya aur kaha: Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne is se mana farmaya aur farmaya: Na yeh shikar karti hai aur na dushman ko nuqsan pahunchati hai, lekin yeh aankh phod deti hai aur daant tod deti hai. Phir woh palta aur dobara kankariyan phenkne laga to Ibn Mughaffal ne us se kaha: Main tum se Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam se bayan karta hoon ke Aap ne is se mana farmaya, phir bhi tum isi ki taraf lautte ho? Main tum se phir kabhi baat nahin karoon ga."
"909","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abd al-Malik ibn Umayr ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Atiyyah al-Qurazi ko kehte hue suna: Jis din Sad ibn Muadh ne Banu Qurayzah ke bare mein faisla diya, main ladka tha. Unhon ne meri izaar band ko dekha aur nahin paya ke main balig ho gaya hoon, to yeh main tumhare darmiyan maujood hoon."
"910","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ibn Abi Najih ne hum se bayan kiya, Mujahid se, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Kufah ki masjid mein ek shakhs ko kehte hue suna: Jis din Sad ibn Muadh ne Banu Qurayzah ke bare mein faisla diya, main ladka tha aur mere bare mein shak kiya gaya. Unhon ne mujhe dekha aur nahin paya ke mujh par ustra istemal hua hai, to mujhe chhor diya gaya."
"911","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ibn Abi Khalid ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Main Abu Juhayfah ke hamrah Namaz-e-Jumuah ke liye gaya aur un se kaha: Kya aap ne Rasul Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ko dekha hai? Unhon ne kaha: Haan, aur al-Hasan ibn Ali un se mushabeh the."
"912","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Zakariyya ibn Abi Zaidah aur Misar ne hum se bayan kiya, Ali ibn al-Aqmar se, Abu Juhayfah se, ke Rasul Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya: Main tek laga kar khana nahin khata."
"913","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Maine Malik ibn Mighwal ko kehte hue suna: Maine Awn ibn Abi Juhayfah ko un ke walid se riwayat karte hue suna, unhon ne kaha: Bilal Rasul Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ke wuzu ka bacha hua pani lekar bahar aaye. Unhon ne kaha: Log us ki taraf daure aur maine baghair koshish me kotahi kiye us me se kuch hasil kar liya. Unhon ne kaha: Aur Bilal ne ek chhota neza nasb kiya, aur Rasul Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam us ki taraf rukh karke namaz padhi, jabke kutta, aurat aur gadha un ke samne se guzarte the."
"914","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ibn Abi Khalid ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Maine Qays ko kehte hue suna: Dukayn ibn Said al-Muzani ne mujh se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hum Rasul Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ki khidmat me char sau sawaron ke hamrah khana talab karne aaye. Aap ne farmaya: Ae Umar, jao aur unhen khilao aur do. Unhon ne kaha: Ae Allah ke Rasul, mere paas khajooron ke chand saon ke siwa kuch nahin jo mere ghar walon ko garmiyon bhar bhi kifayat na karen. Phir Abu Bakr ne kaha: Suno aur itaat karo. To Umar ne kaha: Sunna aur itaat karna hai. Unhon ne kaha: Phir Umar gaye yahan tak ke apne ek bala khane par aaye, apne tahband se ek chabi nikali aur use khola. Unhon ne logon se kaha: Dakhil ho jao. Wo dakhil hue, aur main dakhil hone walon me sab se aakhir me tha. Maine liya, phir main palta to dekha ke khajooron ka ek oont ke bachche ke barabar baqi tha."
"915","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ismail ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Maine Qays ko kehte hue suna: Adi ibn Amirah al-Kindi ne mujh se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Maine Rasul Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ko farmate hue suna: Ae logo, tum me se jise hum kisi kaam par muqarrar karen, use chahiye ke us ka thoda aur zyada le aaye. Jo hum se ek dhaga ya ek sui chhupaye, aur us se zyada jo kuch bhi ho, wo khayanat hai jise wo Qayamat ke Din lekar aayega. Phir Ansar me se ek past qad siyah faam shakhs un ki taraf khada hua - goya main use ab bhi dekh raha hun - aur kaha: Ae Allah ke Rasul, apna kaam mujh se wapas le lijiye. Rasul Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya: Aur wo kya hai? Unhon ne kaha: Jo aap ne abhi farmaya hai. Phir Nabi Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya: Aur main ab kehta hun: tum me se jise hum kisi kaam par muqarrar karen, use chahiye ke us ka thoda aur zyada le aaye. Us me se jo use diya jaye, wo le le, aur jis se use roka jaye, use us se ruk jana chahiye."
"916","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ibn Tawus ne hum se bayan kiya, apne walid se, unhon ne kaha: Rasul Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne Ubadah ibn al-Samit ko sadqe par muqarrar farmaya, phir un se farmaya: Khabardar raho, ae Abu al-Walid, kahin tum Qayamat ke Din apni gardan par bilbilata hua oont, ya raankti hui gaaye, ya memiyati hui bakri uthaye hue na aao. Unhon ne kaha: Ae Allah ke Rasul, kya waqai aisa hi hai? Aap ne farmaya: Haan. Ubadah ne kaha: Qasam us Zaat ki Jis ne aap ko haq ke sath bheja hai, main aayindah kabhi do aadmiyon par bhi kaam nahin karunga."
"917","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Misar ne hum se bayan kiya, Ibn al-Qibtiyyah se, Jabir ibn Samurah se, unhon ne kaha: Hum Nabi Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ke sath namaz padhte the, aur jab hum me se koi salam pherta to apne dayen aur bayen apne hath se is tarah ishara karta: Assalamu Alaikum, Assalamu Alaikum. Phir Nabi Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya: Tumhen kya hua hai ke tum apne hathon se aise ishare karte ho goya wo sarkash ghodon ki dumain hain? Kya tum me se ek ke liye ye kafi nahin hai - balke tum me se ek ke liye ye kafi hai - ke wo apna hath apni raan par rakhe, phir apne bhai ko apne dayen aur bayen salam kahe: Assalamu Alaikum wa Rahmatullah, Assalamu Alaikum wa Rahmatullah."
"918","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Mamar ne hum se bayan kiya, al-Zuhri se, Abd al-Rahman ibn Azhar se, unhon ne kaha: Khalid ibn al-Walid Hunayn ke din zakhmi hue, aur Rasul Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam mere paas se guzre jabke main ladka tha, farmate hue: Mujhe Khalid ibn al-Walid ke saman tak kaun pahunchayega? To main Rasul Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam se aage daudta hua nikla, kehte hue: Khalid ibn al-Walid ke saman tak kaun pahunchayega? Yahan tak ke Rasul Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam un ke paas aaye jabke wo zakhmi halat me ek kathi se tek lagaye hue the. Rasul Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam un ke pehlu me baithe aur un ke liye dua farmayi. Unhon ne kaha: Aur mera khayal hai ke is me shamil hai: aur un par phoonka."
"919","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: al-Zuhri ne mujh se aag se chhui hui cheez ke bare me kayi ahadith bayan kin - un me se kuch kehti thin ke us ki wajah se wuzu kiya jata hai, aur kuch kehti thin ke us ki wajah se wuzu nahin kiya jata - to wo mujh par mushtabah ho gayin. Un logon me jo kehte the ke aag se chhui hui cheez se wuzu wajib hai, Abu Salamah, Umar ibn Abd al-Aziz, Umm Habibah Nabi Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam se, Abu Hurayrah Nabi Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam se, aur Zayd ibn Thabit Nabi Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam se the. Sufyan ne kaha: Aur al-Zuhri ne hum se bayan kiya, hamen batate hue ke Ali ibn Abd Allah ibn Abbas ne unhen un ke walid se khabar di, aur Jafar ibn Amr ibn Umayyah al-Damri ne apne walid se: ke Rasul Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne bakri ke shane se gosht kaat kar us me se khaya, phir namaz ke liye khade hue aur baghair wuzu kiye namaz padhi. Aur dusre ne kaha: Nabi Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne gosht khaya aur baghair wuzu kiye namaz padhi. Mujhe koi shak nahin ke al-Zuhri ne hum se un donon se bayan kiya; mujhe sirf is liye shak hai ke main ek ki hadith ko dusre ki hadith se alag nahin karta. Sufyan ne kaha: Aur al-Zuhri aag se chhui hui cheez se wuzu karte the."
"920","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ibn Uyaynah ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ibn Said al-Thawri ne hum se bayan kiya - Sufyan ne kaha: aur ye sab se behtareen hai jo hum ne un ke paas paya - unhon ne kaha: Bukayr ibn Ata al-Laythi ne mujhe khabar di, Abd al-Rahman ibn Yamar al-Dili se, unhon ne kaha: Maine Rasul Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ko farmate hue suna: Hajj Arafat hai. Jo Fajr se pehle Arafah pa le, us ne Hajj pa liya. Mina ke din teen hain; jo do din me jaldi kare, us par koi gunah nahin, aur jo takheer kare, us par koi gunah nahin."
"921","Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, farmaya: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, farmaya: Ismail ibn Abi Khalid ne hum se bayan kiya, Sha'bi se, unhon ne farmaya: Maine Urwah ibn Mudarris ibn Aws ibn Harithah ibn Lam al-Tai ko farmate hue suna: Main Rasul Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ki khidmat me Muzdalifah me hazir hua aur arz kiya: Ya Rasul Allah, main Tayyi ke dono paharon se aaya hun, aur Allah ki qasam, main yahan tak na pahuncha magar yeh ke maine apne aap ko thaka diya aur apni sawari ko khasta kar diya, aur maine koi teela nahi chhora jis par maine wuquf na kiya ho, phir Rasul Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya: Jo hamare sath is namaz me hazir ho, jab ke is se pehle raat ya din me Arafah me wuquf kar chuka ho, to us ka Hajj mukammal ho gaya aur us ne apne manasik ada kar liye."
"922","Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, farmaya: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, farmaya: Zakariyya ibn Abi Zaidah ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: aur ye dono me se is hadith ko zyada yaad rakhne wale the, Sha'bi se, unhon ne farmaya: Maine Urwah ibn Mudarris ibn Aws ibn Harithah ibn Lam al-Tai ko farmate hue suna: Main Rasul Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ki khidmat me Muzdalifah me hazir hua aur arz kiya: Ya Rasul Allah, main abhi Tayyi ke dono paharon se aap ki khidmat me aaya hun, apni sawari ko khasta kar ke aur apne aap ko thaka kar, to kya mere liye koi Hajj hai, phir Rasul Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya: Jo hamare sath is namaz me hazir ho aur hamare sath thahra rahe yahan tak ke hum rawana hon, jab ke is se pehle raat ya din me Arafah me wuquf kar chuka ho, to us ka Hajj mukammal ho gaya aur us ne apne manasik ada kar liye."
"923","Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, farmaya: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, farmaya: Maine Zuhri ko Suraqah ke bete ya Suraqah ke bhatije se khabar dete hue suna, Suraqah se, unhon ne farmaya: Main Rasul Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ki khidmat me Jiranah me hazir hua, aur main na janta tha ke Aap se kis bare me sawal karun, to maine arz kiya: Ya Rasul Allah, main apne hauz ko bharta hun apne oonton ke mere paas aane ke intezar me, phir bhatke hue oont aakar pee lete hain, to kya is me mere liye koi ajr hai, phir Rasul Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya: Tumhare liye har tar jigar wali zinda cheez me ajr hai, Sufyan ne farmaya: Zuhri se maine yahi yaad rakha, halanke is ke shuru ka kuch hissa mujh par mushtabah ho gaya, aur Wail ibn Dawud ne mujhe Zuhri se inhi alfaz me se kuch ki khabar di, main juda nahi kar sakta ke Zuhri se maine kya yaad rakha aur Wail ne mujhe kya bataya, Suraqah ne farmaya: Main Nabi Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ki khidmat me hazir hua jab ke Aap Jiranah me the, aur main Ansar ke sawar daston me se kisi daste ke paas se na guzarta magar ve mere sar par marte aur kehte: Hat ja, hat ja, phir jab main Aap tak pahuncha to maine dastawez utha kar kaha: Main hun, Ya Rasul Allah, Aap ne kagaz ke tukre par mere liye aman ki zamanat likh di thi, aur Nabi Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya: Han, aaj wafa, neki aur sachchai ka din hai."
"924","Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, farmaya: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, farmaya: Zuhri ne hum se bayan kiya, farmaya: Maine A'raj ko Ibn Buhaynah se riwayat karte hue suna, unhon ne farmaya: Rasul Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne hume namaz parhai, mera khayal hai ke Asr thi, phir dusri rak'at me baithe baghair khare ho gaye, phir jab Aap apni namaz ke aakhir me the to salam pherne se pehle do sajde kiye."
"925","Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, farmaya: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, farmaya: Aur Yahya ibn Said ne hum se bayan kiya, A'raj se, Ibn Buhaynah se, Nabi Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam se isi tarah, siwa is ke ke unhon ne farmaya: Aap us rak'at me khare ho gaye jis me baithne ke liye sukoon kiya jata hai, aur kabhi Sufyan farmate: Abdullah ibn Buhaynah, aur kabhi farmate: Abdullah ibn Malik ibn Buhaynah."
"926","Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, farmaya: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, farmaya: Muhammad ibn Ishaq ne hum se bayan kiya, is haal me ke unhon ne ise Said ibn Abi Hind se suna, unhon ne ise Mutarrif ibn Abdullah ibn al-Shikhkhir se suna, unhon ne farmaya: Maine Usman ibn Abi al-As al-Saqafi ko farmate hue suna: Rasul Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya: Apni qaum ko namaz parhao aur un ka andaza un me se sab se zaeef ke mutabiq lagao, kyunke un me buzurg, kamzor aur hajat wale hote hain."
"927","Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, farmaya: Fudayl ibn Iyad ne hum se bayan kiya, Ash'as se, Hasan se, Usman ibn Abi al-As se, unhon ne farmaya: Rasul Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne mujh se farmaya: Aur aisa muazzin muqarrar karo jo apni azan par ujrat na le."
"928","Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, farmaya: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, farmaya: Qan'ab al-Tamimi ne hum se bayan kiya, aur ve siqah aur behtareen the, Alqamah ibn Marsad se, Sulaiman ibn Buraidah se, un ke walid se, unhon ne farmaya: Rasul Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya: Mujahideen ki aurton ki hurmat peeche rehne walon par maon ki hurmat ki tarah hai, peeche rehne walon me se koi shakhs kisi mujahid se us ke ghar walon ke bare me khiyanat nahi karta magar yeh ke use Qayamat ke Din us ke samne khara kiya jayega aur us se kaha jayega: Ai falan, ye falan bin falan hai jis ne tujh se khiyanat ki, pas is ki nekiyon me se jo chahe le le, phir Rasul Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam hamari taraf mutawajjah hue aur farmaya: To tumhara kya khayal hai."
"929","Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, farmaya: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, farmaya: Abu Ghalib jo kore ke nigran the ne hum se bayan kiya, farmaya: Maine Abu Umamah al-Bahili ko dekha ke unhon ne Khawarij ke sar Dimashq ki seerhiyon par dekhe, aur farmaya: Maine Rasul Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ko farmate hue suna: Jahannam walon ke kutte, Jahannam walon ke kutte, Jahannam walon ke kutte, phir ve ro pare aur farmaya: Aasman ke sayeban ke neeche sab se bure maqtool, aur behtareen maqtool ve hain jinhen ye qatl karen, Abu Ghalib ne farmaya: Kya tum ne ye khud Rasul Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam se suna hai, unhon ne farmaya: Han, warna phir main yaqeenan jurrat karne wala hota, maine ise Rasul Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam se ek se zyada martaba suna, do ya teen martaba nahi."
"930","Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, farmaya: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, farmaya: Muttarih Abu al-Muhallab ne hum se bayan kiya, Ubaid Allah ibn Zahr se, Qasim Abu Abd al-Rahman se, Abu Umamah se, ke Rasul Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya: Mere chahne walon me se mere nazdeek martabe me sab se zyada qabil-e-rashk halke maal wala momin shakhs hai, namaz me se hissa rakhne wala, logon me gumnaam, us ki maut jaldi aati hai, us par rone wale kam hote hain, aur us ki wirasat thori hoti hai."
"931","Humein Al-Humaydi ne bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Humein Sufyan ne bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Humein Muttarih Abu al-Muhallab ne bayan kiya, Ubayd Allah ibn Zahr se, Al-Qasim Abu Abd al-Rahman se, Abu Umamah se ke Allah ke Rasool Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya: Gaane wali londi ki qeemat haram hai aur us ka bechna aur us ka khareedna aur use sunna bhi."
"932","Humein Al-Humaydi ne bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Humein Sufyan ne bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Humein Muhammad ibn Amr ibn Alqamah Al-Laythi ne bayan kiya, apne walid se, apne dada se, Bilal ibn al-Harith Al-Muzani se, Nabi Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam tak marfooan bayan karte hue ke Aap ne farmaya: Aadmi kabhi Allah ke ghazab wali koi baat kehta hai aur use khayal nahi hota ke wo kahan tak pahunchegi to Allah us ki wajah se us par apna ghazab likh deta hai Qayamat ke din tak, aur aadmi kabhi Allah ki raza wali koi baat kehta hai aur use khayal nahi hota ke wo kahan tak pahunchegi to Allah us ki wajah se us ke liye apni raza likh deta hai Qayamat ke din tak. Al-Humaydi ne farmaya: Yehi mere paas hai, marfooan bayan karte hue jaise wo pehle kaha karte the."
"933","Humein Al-Humaydi ne bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Humein Sufyan ne bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Humein Amr ibn Dinar ne bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Mujhe Abu al-Minhal ne khabar di, unhon ne farmaya: Maine Iyas ibn Abd Al-Muzani ko suna jab unhon ne logon ko pani farokht karte hue dekha farmate hue: Pani mat becho kyunke maine Allah ke Rasool Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ko pani bechne se mana farmate hue suna hai. Amr ibn Dinar ne farmaya: Aur main nahi janta ke wo kaun sa pani hai. Sufyan ne farmaya: Hamare nazdeek is se murad ye hai ke use us jagah becha jaye jahan Allah ne use nikala ho, aur Nabi Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam se marvi hai ke Aap ne kunwen ke faazil pani ko bechne se mana farmaya. [4"
"934","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan farmaya, kehte hue: Sufyan ne hum se bayan farmaya, kehte hue: Zakariyya ibn Abi Za'idah ne hum se bayan farmaya, Al-Sha'bi se, Adi ibn Hatim se, jinhon ne kaha: Main ne Allah ke Rasool Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam se mi'rad se shikar ke baare mein poocha to unhon ne farmaya: Na khao magar jise tum shara'i tareeqe se zibah karo."
"935","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Mujalid ne hum se bayan kiya, Al-Sha'bi se, Adi ibn Hatim se, unhon ne farmaya: Main ne Rasul Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam se mi'rad se shikar ke bare mein pucha, to Aap ne farmaya: Jise woh apni dhaar se zakhmi kare use khao; aur jise woh apne pehlu se mare use na khao, kyunke woh chot kha kar mara hai."
"936","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Mujalid ne hum se bayan kiya, Al-Sha'bi se, Adi ibn Hatim se, unhon ne farmaya: Rasul Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya: Tumhara kya haal hoga jab akeli musafir aurat door daraz Yaman se Hira ke mehlo tak aayegi aur Allah ke siwa kisi se nahi daregi? Main ne kaha: Ya Rasul Allah, apne sawaro aur mardo samet Tayyi' ka kya banega? Aap ne farmaya: Allah Tayyi' aur tamam dusro ke muqable mein kifayat karega. Mujalid ne farmaya: Aur waqai akeli musafir aurat Hadramawt se nikalti thi hatta ke Hira pahunch jati thi."
"937","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, Mujalid se, Al-Sha'bi se, Adi ibn Hatim se, unhon ne farmaya: Main ne Rasul Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam se roze ke bare mein pucha, to Aap ne farmaya: Yahan tak ke safed dhaga siyah dhage se wazeh ho jaye. Adi ne farmaya: To main ne do rassiyan leen, ek safed aur dusri siyah, aur unhen dekhne laga. Phir Rasul Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne kuch farmaya. Sufyan ne farmaya: Kuch jo mujhe yaad na raha, aur Aap ne farmaya: Woh to sirf raat aur din hai. Sufyan se kaha gaya: Kya tum ne ye Mujalid se suna hai? Unhon ne farmaya: Haan, aur woh ise achhi tarah ada karte the, lekin mujhe is ka sab kuch yaad na raha."
"938","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, Mujalid se, Al-Sha'bi se, Adi ibn Hatim se, unhon ne farmaya: Main ne Rasul Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam se sikhaye hue kutte se shikar ke bare mein pucha, to Aap ne farmaya: Jab tum apne sikhaye hue kutte ko chhodo aur Allah ka naam lo, to jo woh tumhare liye rok rakhe us mein se khao. Agar woh kha le to na khao, kyunke us ne sirf apne liye roka. Main ne kaha: Ya Rasul Allah, agar dusre kutte hamare kutto mein mil jayen to kya hoga? Aap ne farmaya: Tum ne Allah ka naam sirf apne kutte par liya tha."
"939","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Abu Farwah al-Hamdani ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Main ne Al-Sha'bi ko kehte hue suna: Main ne Al-Nu'man ibn Bashir ko mimbar par kehte hue suna: Main ne Rasul Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ko farmate hue suna: Halal wazeh hai, haram wazeh hai, aur un dono ke darmiyan shubhe wali cheezen hain. Jo shakhs gunah ke shubhe wali cheez ko chhod dega woh wazeh cheez se aur bhi zyada bachega, aur jo shakhs shubhe wali cheez ka irtikab karega woh qareeb hai ke haram mein par jaye. Har badshah ki ek charagah hoti hai, aur zameen par Allah ki charagah Us ki nafarmaniyan hain."
"940","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Mujalid ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Main ne Al-Sha'bi ko kehte hue suna: Main ne Al-Nu'man ibn Bashir ko mimbar par kehte hue suna: Main ne Rasul Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ko suna — Al-Sha'bi ne farmaya: Jab bhi main Al-Nu'man ibn Bashir ko mimbar par kehte hue sunta: Main ne Rasul Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ko suna, to main samajhta ke un ke baad kisi se kabhi ye sunne ko nahi milega: Main ne Rasul Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ko suna — phir unhon ne farmaya: Main ne Rasul Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ko farmate hue suna: Mominon ki apas mein sakhawat, muhabbat aur rehmat mein misaal insani jism jaisi hai: jab us ka ek uzv takleef ki shikayat karta hai to baqi sara jism bukhar aur bedari ke sath us ka sath deta hai."
"941","Unhon ne farmaya: Aur maine Allah ke Rasul Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ko farmate hue suna: Insaan ke andar gosht ka ek tukda hai: jab woh salim aur durust hota hai to us ki wajah se sara jism salim aur durust rehta hai; aur jab woh bimar hota hai to us ki wajah se sara jism bimar aur fasid ho jata hai; aur woh dil hai."
"942","Aur maine Allah ke Rasul Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ko farmate hue suna: Allah ke huqooq mein mudahanat karne wale, un mein girne wale aur unhen qaim rakhne wale ki misaal teen aadmiyon ki tarah hai jo kashti mein sawar hue aur us ki jaghon ke liye qura andazi ki. Un mein se ek ko us ka sab se nichla, khurdura aur badtareen hissa mila, aur us ka aana jana aur pani bahana unhen takleef deta tha. Jab woh us mein the to achanak us ne unhen hairan kar diya ke us ne kulhadi pakad rakhi thi. Unhon ne us se kaha: Tum kya kar rahe ho? Us ne kaha: Main apne hisse mein surakh karunga taake us mein mere aane jane aur pani bahane ke sath pani tak pahunchna mere liye zyada qareeb ho jaye. Un mein se kuch ne kaha: Use chhor do - Allah use halak kare - apne hisse mein jaisa chahe surakh kare. Dusron ne kaha: Use chhedne mat do, kahin woh hamen bhi halak kar de aur khud bhi halak ho jaye. Agar woh us ka hath pakad len to woh bach jayega aur woh bhi us ke sath bach jayenge; aur agar woh us ka hath na pakden to woh halak ho jayega aur woh bhi us ke sath halak ho jayenge."
"943","Unhon ne farmaya: Aur maine Allah ke Rasul Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ko farmate hue suna: Halal wazeh hai, haram wazeh hai, aur un ke darmiyan mushtabiha umoor hain. Jo shakhs gunah mein se jis cheez mein use shubha ho use chhor dega woh jis cheez ke wazeh hone se zyada bachne wala hoga, aur jo shakhs jis cheez mein use shubha ho us par dilerana qadam rakhega woh haram mein parne ke qareeb hai - us ki tarah jo charagah ke kinare charta hai, qareeb hai ke us mein ja pare. Har badshah ki ek charagah hoti hai, aur zameen par Allah ki charagah Us ki nafarmaniyan hain."
"944","Unhon ne farmaya: Aur maine Al-Nu'man ibn Bashir ko farmate hue suna: Mere walid ne mujhe ek ghulam ladka ata kiya, aur meri walida Amrah bint Rawahah ne un se kaha: Nabi Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ke paas jao aur unhen gawah banao. To woh Nabi Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ke paas aaye taake unhen gawah banayen, aur unhon ne farmaya: Kya tum ne apne har bete ko is jaisa ata kiya hai? Unhon ne kaha: Nahin. Phir Nabi Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya: Main sirf haq par gawahi deta hun. Aur unhon ne us par gawahi dene se inkar kar diya."
"945","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Ibrahim ibn Muhammad ibn Al-Muntashir ne hum se bayan kiya, apne walid se, Habib ibn Salim se, apne walid se, Al-Nu'man ibn Bashir se - Al-Humaydi ne farmaya: Sufyan is mein ghalti kiya karte the - ke Allah ke Rasul Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam Eid ki namaz mein parha karte the: Apne buland Rab ke naam ki tasbeeh karo, aur: Kya tumhare paas chha jane wali ki khabar pahunchi hai? Aur jab Jumuah muwafiq aata to woh in dono ko dono mein parha karte the."
"946","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Jarir ibn Abd Al-Hamid Al-Dabbi ne hum se bayan kiya, Ibrahim ibn Al-Muntashir se, apne walid se, Habib ibn Salim se, Al-Nu'man ibn Bashir se, Nabi Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam se isi ma'na ke sath, siwa is ke ke unhon ne is mein apne walid se ka zikr nahin kiya."
"947","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Al-Zuhri ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Humayd ibn Abd Al-Rahman aur Muhammad ibn Al-Nu'man ne mujhe khabar di, ke un donon ne Al-Nu'man ibn Bashir ko bayan karte hue suna: ke un ke walid ne unhen ek tohfa ata kiya, aur woh Nabi Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ke paas aaye taake unhen gawah banayen. Phir Nabi Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya: Kya tum ne apne har bete ko is jaisa ata kiya hai? Unhon ne kaha: Nahin. Unhon ne farmaya: Phir use wapas le lo."
"948","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Dawud ibn Qays Al-Farra ne hum se bayan kiya, Ubayd Allah ibn Abd Allah ibn Aqram Al-Khuzai se, apne walid se, jinhon ne farmaya: Maine Allah ke Rasul Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ko Namirah mein Al-Qa mein namaz parhte hue dekha, aur jab unhon ne sajda kiya to maine un ki baghlon ki safedi dekhi."
"949","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Al-Zuhri ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Maine Sahl ibn Sad Al-Saidi ko farmate hue suna: Ek shakhs ne Nabi Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ke hujre mein surakh se jhanka jabke Nabi Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ke paas lohe ki kanghi thi jis se woh apna sar khujla rahe the. Unhon ne farmaya: Agar mujhe maloom hota ke tum dekh rahe ho to main use tumhari aankh mein ghonp deta. Ijazat talab karna sirf dekhne ki wajah se muqarrar kiya gaya tha."
"950","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Abu Hazim ne hum se bayan kiya, ke unhon ne Sahl ibn Sad Al-Saidi ko farmate hue suna: Allah ke Rasul Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya: Main bheja gaya hun, main aur Qayamat, is tarah is se. Aur Sufyan ne shahadat aur darmiyani ungliyon se ishara kiya."
"951","Al-Humaydi ne hum se riwayat ki, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se riwayat ki, unhon ne kaha: Abu Hazim ne hum se bayan kiya: Logon ne Sahl ibn Sa'd se poocha: Rasool Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ka mimbar kis cheez se bana tha? Unhon ne kaha: Logon mein mujh se zyada is ko janne wala koi baqi nahi raha, wo al-Ghabah ke jhau se hai; falan ke azaad kardah falan ne Aap ke liye use banaya tha, main ne Rasool Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ko dekha jab Aap us par chadhe: Aap ne qible ki taraf rukh farmaya, takbeer kahi, qirat farmayi, ruku farmaya, phir ulte qadam utre aur sajda farmaya, phir chadhe aur qirat farmayi, phir ruku farmaya, phir ulte qadam utre aur sajda farmaya."
"952","Al-Humaydi ne hum se riwayat ki, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se riwayat ki, unhon ne kaha: Abu Hazim ne hum se riwayat ki, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Sahl ibn Sa'd ko kehte hue suna: Rasool Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam Banu Amr ibn Awf ke darmiyan sulah karane ke liye tashreef le gaye, un ke darmiyan jo jhagra waqe hua tha yahan tak ke unhon ne ek dusre par pathar phenke, namaz ka waqt aa gaya, Bilal ne azan kahi, Rasool Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam me der hui, aur Abu Bakr aage badhe aur logon ko namaz padhayi, phir Rasool Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam tashreef laye, safon mein rasta banate hue, jab Aap Abu Bakr ke sath wali saf tak pahunche to log taliyan bajane lage, aur Abu Bakr aise shakhs the jo namaz mein tawajjoh na pherte the, jab unhon ne ye suna to unhon ne tawajjoh ki aur Rasool Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ko dekha, Rasool Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne un ki taraf ishara farmaya ke apni jagah par qaim rahen, lekin Abu Bakr ne apna sar aasman ki taraf uthaya, Allah ki hamd ki aur peeche hat gaye, Rasool Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam aage badhe, aur jab Rasool Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne apni namaz mukammal farmayi to farmaya: Aye Abu Bakr, jab main ne tumhari taraf ishara farmaya to tumhein kis cheez ne roka? Unhon ne kaha: Abu Quhafah ke bete ke liye ye munasib na tha ke wo Rasool Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ke aage dekha jaye, phir Rasool Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam logon ki taraf mutawajjeh hue aur farmaya: Aye logon, tumhein kya ho gaya hai ke jab tumhein tumhari namaz mein koi mamla pesh aata hai to tum taliyan bajane lagte ho? Taliyan bajana aurton ke liye hai aur tasbeeh kehna mardon ke liye hai, jo shakhs apni namaz mein kisi mamle mein mubtala ho to use chahiye ke kahe: Subhan Allah."
"953","Al-Humaydi ne hum se riwayat ki, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se riwayat ki, unhon ne kaha: Abu Hazim ne hum se riwayat ki ke unhon ne Sahl ibn Sa'd al-Sa'idi ko kehte hue suna: Main Rasool Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ke sath logon mein maujood tha jab ek aurat Aap ki khidmat mein aayi aur arz kiya: Aye Allah ke Rasool, main ne apne aap ko Aap ke liye pesh kiya hai, to mere mamle par ghaur farmayen, ek mard khada hua aur arz kiya: Aye Allah ke Rasool, is ka nikah mujh se kar dijiye agar Aap ko is ki hajat na ho, farmaya: Rasool Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam khamosh rahe, phir wo khadi hui aur isi tarah kaha, aur Rasool Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne us mard se farmaya: Kya tumhare paas use dene ke liye kuch hai? Us ne kaha: Nahi, Aap ne farmaya: Jao aur kuch talash karo, to wo gaya aur wapas aaya aur arz kiya: Aye Allah ke Rasool, mujhe kuch na mila, Aap ne farmaya: Jao aur talash karo, agarche lohe ki anguthi hi ho, to wo gaya aur wapas aaya aur arz kiya: Aye Allah ke Rasool, mujhe kuch na mila, lohe ki anguthi bhi nahi, phir Rasool Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya: Kya tumhare paas Quran mein se kuch hai? Us ne kaha: Ji haan, falan falan surat aur falan falan surat, Aap ne farmaya: Phir jao, main ne Quran mein se jo tumhare paas hai us ke badle is ka nikah tum se kar diya."
"954","Al-Humaydi ne hum se riwayat ki, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se riwayat ki, unhon ne kaha: Abu Hazim ne hum se riwayat ki, unhon ne kaha: Logon ne ikhtilaf kiya ke Uhud ke din Rasool Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ke zakhm ka ilaj kis cheez se kiya gaya tha, to unhon ne Sahl se poocha - aur wo Madinah mein Rasool Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ke Sahaba mein se baqi rehne walon mein sab se aakhri mein se the - to unhon ne kaha: Logon mein mujh se zyada is ko janne wala koi baqi nahi raha, Fatimah Rasool Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ke chehre se khoon dho rahi thin, Ali apni dhal mein pani la rahe the, ek chatai layi gayi aur jalayi gayi, aur Aap ke zakhm mein us ko bhar diya gaya."
"955","Al-Humaydi ne hum se riwayat ki, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se riwayat ki, unhon ne kaha: Abu Hazim ne hum se riwayat ki, Sahl ibn Sa'd se, unhon ne kaha: Rasool Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya: Jannat mein kode barabar jagah duniya aur jo kuch us mein hai us se behtar hai."
"956","Al-Humaydi ne hum se riwayat ki, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se riwayat ki, unhon ne kaha: Ibrahim ibn Maysarah ne hum se riwayat ki: Wahb ibn Abd Allah ibn Qarib - ya Marib - ne mujhe khabar di, apne walid se, apne dada se, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Rasool Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ko Hajjatul Wada mein farmate hue suna: Allah sar mundwane walon par rehem farmaye, aur unhon ne apne hath se is tarah ishara kiya, aur Al-Humaydi ne apna dayan hath phelaya, logon ne arz kiya: Aye Allah ke Rasool, aur katwane walon par? Aap ne farmaya: Allah sar mundwane walon par rehem farmaye, unhon ne arz kiya: Aye Allah ke Rasool, aur katwane walon par? Aap ne farmaya: Allah sar mundwane walon par rehem farmaye, unhon ne arz kiya: Aye Allah ke Rasool, aur katwane walon par? Phir Rasool Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya: Aur katwane walon par, aur Al-Humaydi ne apne hath se ishara kiya lekin use is tarah na phelaya jaise pehle phelaya tha, Sufyan ne kaha: Main ne apni kitab mein paya Ibrahim ibn Maysarah se, Wahb ibn Abd Allah ibn Marib se - jabke mera hifz Qarib hai - aur log kehte hain Qarib jaisa maine hifz kiya hai, to main kehta hun Qarib ya Marib."
"957","Al-Humaydi ne hum se riwayat ki, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se riwayat ki, unhon ne kaha: Dawud ibn Yazid Abu Yazid al-Awdi ne hum se riwayat ki, al-Sha'bi se, Ibn Khanbash se, unhon ne kaha: Rasool Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya: Ramazan ke mahine mein umrah Hajj ki tarah hai."
"958","Al-Humaydi ne hum se riwayat ki, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ibn Uyaynah ne hum se riwayat ki, unhon ne kaha: al-Zuhri ne hum se riwayat ki, unhon ne kaha: Sa'id ibn al-Musayyib ne mujhe khabar di, Abu Hurayrah se, unhon ne kaha: Rasool Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya: Jab padhne wala aameen kahe to aameen kaho, kyunke farishte aameen kehte hain, jis shakhs ki aameen farishton ki aameen ke muwafiq ho gayi us ke guzishta gunah bakhsh diye jayenge."
"959","Al-Humaydi ne hum se riwayat ki, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se riwayat ki, unhon ne kaha: Main ne al-Zuhri se suna - aur maine is ko un se hifz kiya - Sa'id ibn al-Musayyib se ke unhon ne unhein khabar di, Abu Hurayrah se, unhon ne kaha: Rasool Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya: Jab Juma ka din hota hai to masjid ke har darwaze par farishte hote hain jo logon ko un ki tarteeb se likhte hain, pehle phir pehle, jab imam nikalta hai to saheefe lapet diye jate hain aur wo khutba sunte hain, jo shakhs Juma ke liye jaldi aata hai wo us shakhs ki tarah hai jo oont pesh karta hai, phir us ke baad wala us ki tarah jo gaaye pesh karta hai, phir us ke baad wala us ki tarah jo mendha pesh karta hai - yahan tak ke unhon ne murgi aur ande ka zikr farmaya, Abu Bakr ne kaha: Sufyan se kaha gaya: Is hadith mein al-Agharr se, Abu Hurayrah se zikr karte hain, Sufyan ne kaha: Main ne al-Zuhri ko al-Agharr ka zikr karte hue kabhi nahi suna, maine unhein sirf Sa'id se kehte hue suna ke unhon ne unhein Abu Hurayrah se khabar di."
"960","Al-Humaydi ne hum se riwayat ki, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se riwayat ki: Main ne al-Zuhri se suna, Sa'id ibn al-Musayyib se, Abu Hurayrah se, unhon ne kaha: Rasool Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya: Jab tum namaz ki taraf aao to us ki taraf daudte hue na aao, us ki taraf chalte hue aao, tum par sukoon lazim ho, jo tum pa lo wo padho, aur jo tum se reh jaye use poora karo."
"961","Hamen Al-Humaydi ne bayan kiya, farmaya: Hamen Sufyan ne bayan kiya, farmaya: Main ne Al-Zuhri ko farmate hue suna: Mujhe Sa'id ibn Al-Musayyib ne khabar di, Abu Hurayrah se riwayat hai, ke Rasool Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya: Fitrat paanch hain - ya farmaya paanch cheezen fitrat me se hain: khatna karna, zere naf bal mundna, nakhun tarashna, baghlon ke baal ukherna, aur moonchhen katna."
"962","Hamen Al-Humaydi ne bayan kiya, farmaya: Hamen Sufyan ne bayan kiya, farmaya: Main ne Al-Zuhri ko Sa'id ibn Al-Musayyib se riwayat karte hue suna, Abu Hurayrah se, unhon ne farmaya: Ek aadmi khara hua aur Nabi Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam se sawal kiya: Kya hum me se koi ek kapre me namaz parh sakta hai? To Nabi Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya: Kya tum me se har ek ke paas do kapre hain? Aur Abu Hurayrah ne un se sawal karne wale ek aadmi se farmaya: Kya tum Abu Hurayrah ko jante ho? Woh ek hi kapre me namaz parhta hai jabke us ke kapre khunti par rakhe hue hote hain."
"963","Hamen Al-Humaydi ne bayan kiya, farmaya: Hamen Sufyan ne bayan kiya, farmaya: Hamen Al-Zuhri ne bayan kiya jese main tumhen batata hun, is bare me mujhe kisi aur ki hajat nahi, farmaya: Mujhe Sa'id ibn Al-Musayyib ne khabar di, Abu Hurayrah se, unhon ne farmaya: Ek dehati masjid me dakhil hua jabke Nabi Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam baithe hue the, farmaya: Phir woh khara hua aur namaz parhi, aur jab apni namaz se farigh hua to kaha: Ae Allah, mujh par aur Muhammad par rehem farma, aur hamare sath kisi aur par rehem na farma, to Rasool Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam us ki taraf mutawajjeh hue aur farmaya: Tum ne wasee cheez ko tang kar diya, phir thori der baad us ne masjid me peshab kar diya, aur log us ki taraf daure, phir Rasool Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya: Is par pani ka ek dol, ya pani ka ek bartan baha do, phir farmaya: Tum aasani karne wale bana kar bheje gaye ho aur sakhti karne wale bana kar nahi bheje gaye."
"964","Hamen Al-Humaydi ne bayan kiya, farmaya: Hamen Sufyan ne bayan kiya, farmaya: Hamen Al-Zuhri ne bayan kiya, farmaya: Aur main ne us se yad kiya, farmaya: Mujhe Sa'id ibn Al-Musayyib ne khabar di, Abu Hurayrah se, unhon ne farmaya: Jab Rasool Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam subah ki namaz ki aakhri rak'at se apna sar uthate to farmate: Ae Allah, Al-Walid ibn Al-Walid, Salamah ibn Hisham, Ayyash ibn Abi Rabi'ah aur Makkah me mustaz'afeen ko nijat de, Ae Allah, Mudar par Apni pakar sakht farma, aur un par Yusuf ke saalon jese saal musallat farma."
"965","Hamen Al-Humaydi ne bayan kiya, farmaya: Hamen Sufyan ne bayan kiya, farmaya: Hamen Al-Zuhri ne bayan kiya, Sa'id ibn Al-Musayyib se, Abu Hurayrah se, unhon ne farmaya: Rasool Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya: Meri is masjid me ek namaz doosri masajid me hazaar namazon se behtar hai siwae Masjid-e-Haram ke."
"966","Hamen Al-Humaydi ne bayan kiya, farmaya: Hamen Sufyan ne bayan kiya, farmaya: Hamen Ziyad ibn Sa'd ne bayan kiya, farmaya: Mujhe Sulayman ibn Atiq ne khabar di, farmaya: Main ne Ibn Al-Zubayr ko mimbar par farmate hue suna: Main ne Umar ibn Al-Khattab ko farmate hue suna: Masjid-e-Haram me ek namaz doosri masajid me sau namazon se behtar hai, Al-Humaydi ne farmaya: Sufyan ne farmaya: Pas woh samajhte hain ke Masjid-e-Haram me namaz Rasool ki masjid ke siwa doosri masajid me ek lakh namazon se behtar hai, kyunke unhon ne use sau namazon se doosron par fazilat di hai."
"967","Hamen Al-Humaydi ne bayan kiya, farmaya: Hamen Sufyan ne bayan kiya, farmaya: Hamen Al-Zuhri ne bayan kiya, farmaya: Mujhe Sa'id ibn Al-Musayyib ne khabar di, Abu Hurayrah se, ke Rasool Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya: Jab garmi shadeed ho jaye to namaz ko thanda karke parho, kyunke garmi ki shiddat Jahannum ki bhaap se hai."
"968","Aur unhon ne farmaya: Aag ne apne Rab se shikayat ki, kaha: Ae mere Rab, mere baaz hisse ne baaz ko kha liya hai, to Us ne use do saanson ki ijazat di: sardi me ek saans aur garmi me ek saans, pas sab se shadeed garmi jo tum mehsoos karte ho woh us ki garmi se hai, aur sab se shadeed sardi jo tum mehsoos karte ho woh us ki sakht sardi se hai."
"969","Hamen Al-Humaydi ne bayan kiya, farmaya: Hamen Sufyan ne bayan kiya, farmaya: Hamen Al-Zuhri ne bayan kiya, Sa'id ibn Al-Musayyib se, Abu Hurayrah se, ke Rasool Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya: Kajawe nahi bandhe jate magar teen masajid ki taraf: Masjid-e-Haram, meri yeh masjid, aur Masjid-e-Aqsa."
"970","Hamen Al-Humaydi ne bayan kiya, farmaya: Hamen Abd Al-Aziz ibn Abi Hazim ne bayan kiya, farmaya: Mujhe Yazid ibn Abd Allah ibn Usamah ibn Al-Had ne bayan kiya, Muhammad ibn Ibrahim Al-Taymi se, Abu Salamah ibn Abd Al-Rahman se, Abu Hurayrah se, unhon ne farmaya: Mujhe Basrah ibn Abi Basrah Al-Ghifari ne khabar di ke Rasool Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya: Sawariyan taiyar nahi ki jatin magar teen masajid ki taraf: Masjid-e-Haram, meri yeh masjid, aur Bait-ul-Maqdis ki masjid."
"971","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: al-Zuhri ne hum se bayan kiya, us shakhs se jis ne Abu Hurayrah se suna - ya to Sa'id ya Abu Salamah, aksar Sa'id se kehte hue - Abu Hurayrah se, ke Rasool Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya: Mujhe paanch cheezen ata ki gayi hain jo mujh se pehle kisi ko ata nahi ki gayin: poori zameen mere liye masjid aur paaki ka zariya bana di gayi hai, meri madad rob ke zariye ki gayi hai, maal-e-ghaneemat mere liye halal kiya gaya hai, mujhe surkh o siyah (sab logon) ki taraf bheja gaya hai, aur mujhe shafa'at ata ki gayi hai."
"972","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: al-Zuhri ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: mujhe Abu Salamah ibn Abd al-Rahman ne khabar di, Abu Hurayrah se, ke Rasool Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya: Jis ne namaz ki ek rak'at pa li us ne namaz pa li."
"973","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: al-Zuhri ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: mujhe Abu Salamah ibn Abd al-Rahman ne khabar di, Abu Hurayrah se, ke Rasool Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya: Shaitan tum me se kisi ke paas us ki namaz me aata hai aur us ki namaz us par mushtabah kar deta hai yahan tak ke woh nahi janta ke us ne kitni namaz parhi hai, pas tum me se koi jab ye paye to baithe hue do sajde kar le."
"974","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: al-Zuhri ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Salamah ne hum se bayan kiya, Abu Hurayrah se, ke Rasool Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya: Namaz me tasbeeh kehna mardon ke liye hai aur taali bajana aurton ke liye hai."
"975","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: main ne al-Zuhri ko Abu Salamah se, Abu Hurayrah se bayan karte hue suna, ke Rasool Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya: Allah ne kisi cheez ki taraf is tarah kaan laga kar nahi suna jis tarah Us ne Qur'an ko khush ilhani se parhne wale nabi ki taraf suna hai."
"976","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: al-Zuhri ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: mujhe Abu Salamah ne khabar di, Abu Hurayrah se, ke Rasool Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya: Jis ne Ramazan ke roze iman ke saath aur sawab talab karte hue rakhe us ke guzishta gunah bakhsh diye jayenge, aur jis ne Shab-e-Qadr me iman ke saath aur sawab talab karte hue qiyam kiya us ke guzishta gunah bakhsh diye jayenge."
"977","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: al-Zuhri ne hum se bayan kiya, Abu Salamah se, Abu Hurayrah se, ke Rasool Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya: Jab tum me se koi neend se jaage to apna haath bartan me na dale jab tak use teen martaba dho na le, kyunke woh nahi janta ke us ka haath raat me kahan raha."
"978","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu al-Zinad ne hum se bayan kiya, al-A'raj se, Abu Hurayrah se, Nabi Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam se isi tarah, Sufyan ne kaha: Ye un logon ki raaye ki taeed karta hai jo kehte hain ke sharmgah ko chhune se wuzu wajib hota hai."
"979","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: al-Zuhri ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: main ne Ibn Ukaymah al-Laythi ko Sa'id ibn al-Musayyib se bayan karte hue suna, unhon ne kaha: main ne Abu Hurayrah ko kehte hue suna: Rasool Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne humein fajr ki namaz parhayi, phir jab Nabi Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam faarigh hue to farmaya: Kya tum me se kisi ne mere saath qiraat ki hai, to ek aadmi ne kaha: Ji haan main ne ki hai, tab Nabi Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya: Main kehta hun, mere saath Qur'an me jhagda kyun kiya ja raha hai, Sufyan ne kaha: Phir al-Zuhri ne kuch kaha jo main na samajh saka, aur baad me Ma'mar ne mujhe bataya ke unhon ne kaha: Pas log us qiraat se ruk gaye jis me Rasool Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam buland aawaz se qiraat karte the, Abu Bakr ne kaha: Aur Sufyan is hadith ke baare me kehte the: Rasool Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne humein ek namaz parhayi - mera khayal hai ke woh fajr ki namaz thi - ek muddat tak, phir Sufyan ne hum se kaha: main ne apni kitaab me dekha to us me mere paas paya: Rasool Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne humein fajr ki namaz parhayi."
"980","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu al-Zinad ne hum se bayan kiya, al-A'raj se, Abu Hurayrah se, unhon ne kaha: Rasool Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya: Hum sab se aakhir me aane wale hain aur sab se aage hone wale hain, is tarah ke unhe Kitaab hum se pehle di gayi aur humein un ke baad di gayi, ye woh din hai jis ke baare me unhon ne ikhtilaf kiya aur Allah ne humein is ki hidayat di, pas log is me humare taabe hain: Yahood kal wale hain aur Nasara parson wale hain."
"981","Hamein Al-Humaydi ne bayan kiya, farmaya: Hamein Sufyan ne bayan kiya, farmaya: Aur hamein Ibn Tawus ne usay bayan kiya, apne walid se, Abu Hurairah se, Nabi Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam se isi tarah, siwaye is ke ke unhon ne farmaya: Us mein - us ki wazahat yeh hai: kyunke woh."
"982","Hamein Al-Humaydi ne bayan kiya, farmaya: Hamein Sufyan ne bayan kiya, farmaya: Hamein Abu al-Zinad ne bayan kiya, al-A'raj se, Abu Hurairah se, unhon ne bayan kiya: Rasool Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya: Main ne Isha ki namaz qaim karne ka irada kiya tha, phir apne naujawano ko hukm deta ke woh un logon ke gharon tak jayen jo Isha ki namaz se peeche reh jate hain aur un par unhen lakdiyon ke gatthon samet aag me jala den, agar un mein se koi janta ke woh do umda gosht wali haddiyan ya ek charbi wali haddi payega to woh namaz me zaroor hazir hota."
"983","Hamein Al-Humaydi ne bayan kiya, farmaya: Hamein Sufyan ne bayan kiya, farmaya: Hamein Abu al-Zinad ne bayan kiya, al-A'raj se, Abu Hurairah se, unhon ne bayan kiya: Rasool Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya: Jab tum me se koi pathron se istinja kare to taak adad me kare, aur jab woh naak jhare to taak adad me kare."
"984","Hamein Al-Humaydi ne bayan kiya, farmaya: Hamein Sufyan ne bayan kiya, farmaya: Hamein Abu al-Zinad ne bayan kiya, al-A'raj se, Abu Hurairah se, unhon ne bayan kiya: Rasool Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya: Imam zimmedar hai, pas agar woh baith kar namaz parhe to baith kar parho, aur agar woh khare ho kar namaz parhe to khare ho kar parho."
"985","Hamein Al-Humaydi ne bayan kiya, farmaya: Hamein Sufyan ne bayan kiya, Ismail ibn Abi Khalid se, Qays ibn Abi Hazim se, Abu Hurairah se, unhon ne bayan kiya: Rasool Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne isi ki manind farmaya, siwaye is ke ke unhon ne farmaya: Kyunke ameer us ka imam hai."
"986","Hamein Al-Humaydi ne bayan kiya, farmaya: Hamein Sufyan ne bayan kiya, farmaya: Hamein Abu al-Zinad ne bayan kiya, al-A'raj se, Abu Hurairah se, unhon ne bayan kiya: Rasool Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya: Shaitan tum me se kisi ki gaddi par teen girah lagata hai, har girah ki jagah par maar kar: Tum par lambi raat hai, pas so jao, pas agar woh raat me bedar ho aur Allah Taala ko yaad kare to ek girah khul jati hai, agar woh wuzu kare to do girahen khul jati hain, agar woh namaz parhe to tamam girahen khul jati hain, pas woh subah khush dil aur chust uthta hai, warna woh ganda dil aur sust uthta hai."
"987","Hamein Al-Humaydi ne bayan kiya, farmaya: Hamein Sufyan ne bayan kiya, farmaya: Hamein Abu al-Zinad ne bayan kiya, al-A'raj se, Abu Hurairah se, unhon ne bayan kiya: Rasool Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya: Kya tum mera yeh qibla dekhte ho, mujh se na tumhara ruku chhupa hai aur na tumhara khushu - ya farmaya: tumhara ruku aur na tumhara sajda - chhupa hai."
"988","Hamein Al-Humaydi ne bayan kiya, farmaya: Hamein Sufyan ne bayan kiya, farmaya: Hamein Dawud ibn Shabur, Humayd al-A'raj aur Ibn Abi Najih ne bayan kiya, Mujahid se, Allah Azza wa Jalla ke farman ke bare me: Aur sajda karne walon me tumhara phirna - unhon ne farmaya: Rasool Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam namaz me apne peeche aise hi dekhte the jaise apne samne dekhte the."
"989","Hamein Al-Humaydi ne bayan kiya, farmaya: Hamein Sufyan ne bayan kiya, farmaya: Hamein Abu al-Zinad ne bayan kiya, al-A'raj se, Abu Hurairah se, unhon ne bayan kiya: Rasool Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya: Tum me se koi yeh na kahe: Ae Allah, agar Tu chahe to mujhe bakhsh de, Ae Allah, agar Tu chahe to mujh par rehem farma, balke woh pukhtagi ke sath sawal kare, kyunke Usay majboor karne wala koi nahi - ya unhon ne farmaya: Us par jabr karne wala koi nahi."
"990","Hamein Al-Humaydi ne bayan kiya, farmaya: Hamein Sufyan ne bayan kiya, farmaya: Hamein Abu al-Zinad ne bayan kiya, al-A'raj se, Abu Hurairah se, unhon ne bayan kiya: Rasool Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya: Tum me se koi ek kapre me namaz na parhe jabke us me se kuch us ke kandhe par na ho."
"991","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Abu al-Zinad ne hum se bayan kiya, al-A'raj se, Abu Hurairah se, unhon ne farmaya: Allah ke Rasool Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya: Agar ye baat na hoti ke main momineen par mashaqqat dalunga to main unhen Isha ki namaz mein takheer ka hukum deta aur har namaz ke waqt miswak ka hukum deta."
"992","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Abu al-Zinad ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Abdur Rahman al-A'raj ne mujhe khabar di, unhon ne farmaya: Maine Abu Hurairah ko farmate hue suna: Allah ke Rasool Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya: Jab tum Jumuah ke din apne saathi se kaho jabke imam khutba de raha ho: Khamosh raho, to tum ne laghv kiya, Abu al-Zinad ne farmaya: Ye Abu Hurairah ki lughat hai, durust lafz laghauta hai."
"993","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Abu al-Zinad ne hum se bayan kiya, al-A'raj se, Abu Hurairah se, unhon ne farmaya: Allah ke Rasool Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya: Jab tum me se kisi ke bartan me kutta chaat le to use saat martaba dhoye."
"994","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Ayyub al-Sakhtiyani ne hum se bayan kiya, Muhammad ibn Sirin se, Abu Hurairah se isi tarah, ek martaba marfu'an, siwa is ke ke unhon ne farmaya: Un me se pehli, ya un me se ek, mitti ke saath ho."
"995","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Abu al-Zinad ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Musa ibn Abi Uthman ne mujhe khabar di, apne walid se, Abu Hurairah se, ke Allah ke Rasool Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya: Tum me se koi thehre hue pani me peshab na kare phir us se ghusl kare."
"996","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Ayyub ne hum se bayan kiya, Muhammad ibn Sirin se, Abu Hurairah se, ke Allah ke Rasool Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya: Tum me se koi thehre hue pani me jo behta na ho peshab na kare phir us se ghusl kare."
"997","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Asim ibn Ubaidullah al-Umari ne hum se bayan kiya, Abu Ruhm ke aazad karda ghulam se, unhon ne farmaya: Abu Hurairah ek khushbu lagai hui aurat se mile aur farmaya: Ai Jabbar ki bandi, kahan ka irada hai, us ne kaha: Masjid ka, unhon ne farmaya: Aur kya tum ne is ke liye khushbu lagai hai, us ne kaha: Haan, unhon ne farmaya: Wapas jao aur ghusl karo, pas maine Allah ke Rasool Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ko farmate hue suna: Jo bhi aurat khushbu lagakar phir masjid ka irada karke nikle to us se koi namaz qubool nahi ki jati, aur na falan falan, hatta ke wo wapas jaye aur ghusl kare jaisa ke janabat se ghusl karti hai."
"998","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Abu Bakr ke aazad karda ghulam Sumayy ne hum se bayan kiya, Abu Salih se, Abu Hurairah se: ke Allah ke Rasool Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam bala ki sakhti se, badbakhti ke aa gherne se, buri taqdeer se aur dushmanon ke khush hone se panah manga karte the, Sufyan ne farmaya: In chaar me se teen."
"999","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: al-Huraqah ke aazad karda ghulam al-Ala ibn Abdur Rahman ibn Yaqub ne mujh se bayan kiya, apne walid se, Abu Hurairah se, unhon ne farmaya: Allah ke Rasool Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya: Allah Ta'ala ne farmaya: Maine namaz ko Apne aur Apne bande ke darmiyan taqseem kar diya hai, pas jab banda kehta hai: Tamam ta'rif Allah ke liye hai jo tamam jahanon ka Rabb hai, to Allah Azza wa Jalla farmata hai: Mere bande ne Meri hamd ki, jab wo kehta hai: Nihayat Rahm karne wala, Behad Reham wala, to farmata hai: Mere bande ne Meri sana ki, ya: Mere bande ne Meri buzrugi bayan ki, jab banda kehta hai: Roz-e-Jaza ka Malik, to farmata hai: Mere bande ne apne aap ko Mere supurd kar diya, jab wo kehta hai: Hum Teri hi ibadat karte hain aur Tujh hi se madad mangte hain, to ye Mere aur Mere bande ke darmiyan hai, aur Mere bande ke liye wo hai jo us ne manga, jab wo kehta hai: Hamen Seedhe Raste ki hidayat de, un logon ke raste ki jin par Tune in'am farmaya, na un ke jin par ghazab hua aur na gumrahon ke, to ye Mere bande ke liye hai, aur Mere bande ke liye wo hai jo us ne manga."
"1000","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Sufyan, Abd al-Aziz al-Darawardi aur Ibn Abi Hazim ne hum se bayan kiya, al-Ala se, un ke walid se, Abu Hurairah se, ke Allah ke Rasool Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya: Har wo namaz jis me Fatihat al-Kitab na parhi jaye wo naqis hai, wo naqis hai, Abdur Rahman ne farmaya: Pas maine Abu Hurairah se kaha: Lekin main imam ki qiraat sunta hun, to unhon ne apne haath se mujhe ishara kiya aur farmaya: Ai Farsi, ya unhon ne farmaya: Ai Farsi ke bete, use apne dil me parh."
"1001","Hamen Al-Humaydi ne bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Hamen Sufyan ne bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Hamen Muslim ibn Abi Maryam ne Abu Salih se bayan kiya, ke unhon ne Abu Hurayrah ko suna, ek martaba marfu'an bayan karte hue, farmate the: A'mal har Peer aur Jumerat ko pesh kiye jate hain, aur Allah Ta'ala un dono dinon me har us shakhs ko bakhsh deta hai jo Allah ke sath kisi cheez ko shareek nahi karta, siwaye us mard ke jiske darmiyan aur uske bhai ke darmiyan dushmani ho. Kaha jata hai: In dono ko chhor do yahan tak ke ye sulah kar len, in dono ko chhor do yahan tak ke ye sulah kar len."
"1002","Hamen Al-Humaydi ne bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Hamen Sufyan ne bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Hamen Suhayl ibn Abi Salih ne apne walid se, unhon ne Abu Hurayrah se bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Hamen Rasool Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne Jumu'ah ki namaz ke baad chaar (rak'aten) parhne ka hukm diya. Sufyan ne farmaya: Aur mere siwa dusron ne kaha ke Nabi Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya: Tum me se jo Jumu'ah ke baad namaz parhe to chaar rak'aten parhe. Aur ye behtar hai, lekin jo maine yaad kiya hai woh pehli riwayat hai."
"1003","Hamen Al-Humaydi ne bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Hamen Sufyan ne bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Hamen Muhammad ibn Ajlan ne Said al-Maqburi se bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Ek mard ne Abu Hurayrah se kaha: Main ghane balon wala mard hun, aur mujhe teen chullu (pani) kafi nahi hote. To unhon ne farmaya: Rasool Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ke baal tum se zyada ghane the aur tum se zyada khushbudar the; woh apne sar par teen chullu dalte the."
"1004","Hamen Al-Humaydi ne bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Hamen Sufyan ne bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Hamen Muhammad ibn Amr ibn Alqamah ne Abu Salamah se, unhon ne Abu Hurayrah se bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Rasool Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya: Allah ki bandiyon ko Allah ki masjidon se na roko, aur woh siwaye sada halat me baghair zeenat ya khushbu ke na niklen."
"1005","Hamen Al-Humaydi ne bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Hamen Sufyan ne bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Hamen Muhammad ibn Ishaq ne Muhammad ibn Ibrahim al-Taymi se, unhon ne Abu Salamah ibn Abd al-Rahman se, unhon ne Abu Hurayrah se bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Rasool Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya: Beshak Allah Ta'ala subah aur sham logon par barkat nazil farmata hai, phir bhi un me se baaz subah iska inkar karte hue kufr karte hain, kehte hain: Hamen falan sitare se barish di gayi. Muhammad ibn Ibrahim ne farmaya: To maine ye Said ibn al-Musayyib ko bayan kiya, to unhon ne farmaya: Hum ne ye Abu Hurayrah se suna hai, lekin mujhe us shakhs ne khabar di jis ne Umar ko logon ko barish ke liye namaz parhate hue dekha ke unhon ne farmaya: Ae Abbas, ae Rasool Allah ke chacha, Surayya ke tulu' me kitna baqi hai? Unhon ne farmaya: Iske janne wale da'wa karte hain ke woh apne ghurub ke saat (raaton) baad ufuq par zahir hota hai. Unhon ne farmaya: To saatwin (raat) guzri bhi na thi ke hamen barish de di gayi."
"1006","Hamen Al-Humaydi ne bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Hamen Sufyan ne bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Hamen Ibn Tawus ne apne walid se, unhon ne Abu Hurayrah se bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Rasool Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya: Allah ke azab se Allah ki panah mango, zindagi aur maut ke fitne se Allah ki panah mango, qabr ke azab se Allah ki panah mango, Masih Dajjal ke fitne se Allah ki panah mango."
"1007","Hamen Al-Humaydi ne bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Hamen Sufyan ne bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Hamen Amr ibn Dinar ne Tawus se, unhon ne Abu Hurayrah se, Nabi Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam se isi tarah ki riwayat bayan ki."
"1008","Hamen Al-Humaydi ne bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Hamen Sufyan ne bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Hamen Abu al-Zinad ne al-Araj se, unhon ne Abu Hurayrah se, Nabi Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam se isi tarah ki riwayat bayan ki."
"1009","Hamen Al-Humaydi ne bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Hamen Sufyan ne bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Hamen Ayyub ne Muhammad ibn Sirin se, unhon ne Abu Hurayrah se bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Hamen Rasool Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne dopahar ki do namazon me se ek me, ya'ni Zuhr ya Asr, aur mera ghalib gumaan hai ke woh Asr thi, do rak'aten parhayin, phir masjid me khajoor ke tane ki taraf gaye aur ghusse ki halat me us se tek lagayi. Jaldi karne wale log nikal gaye kehte hue: Namaz kam kar di gayi, namaz kam kar di gayi. Logon me Abu Bakr aur Umar bhi the, lekin woh un se baat karne se mar'oob the. To Dhu al-Yadayn khare hue aur kaha: Ae Allah ke Rasool, kya namaz kam kar di gayi hai ya aap bhool gaye hain? To Rasool Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya: Dhu al-Yadayn kya keh raha hai? Unhon ne kaha: Woh sach keh raha hai. To Rasool Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne hamen do rak'aten parhayin, phir salam phera, phir takbeer kahi aur apne (namaz ke) sajde ki tarah ya us se lamba sajda kiya, phir sar uthaya, phir takbeer kahi aur sajda kiya, phir takbeer kahi aur sar uthaya. Muhammad ne farmaya: Aur mujhe Imran ibn Husayn ki sanad se, Nabi Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam se khabar di gayi, ke unhon ne farmaya: Aur unhon ne salam phera."
"1010","Hamen Al-Humaydi ne bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Hamen Sufyan ne bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Hamen Ibn Abi Labid ne Abu Salamah se, unhon ne Abu Hurayrah se Ayyub ki hadees ki manind riwayat bayan ki, aur us me ye izafa kiya: To Rasool Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne dayen aur bayen dekha aur farmaya: Dhu al-Yadayn kya keh raha hai?"
"1011","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ayyub ne hum se bayan kiya, Muhammad se, Abu Hurayrah se, unhon ne kaha: Rasool Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya: Jab tum mein se koi raat ko uthe to do mukhtasar rakatein parhe jin se woh apni namaz ka aaghaz kare."
"1012","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ayyub ne hum se bayan kiya, Muhammad se, Abu Hurayrah se, unhon ne kaha: Abu al-Qasim Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya: Beshak Juma mein ek sa'at hai jise koi Musalman banda namaz mein khara Allah Azza wa Jal se us mein khair mangte hue nahi pata magar Woh use ata farmata hai, aur unhon ne apne hath se us ke mukhtasar hone ki taraf ishara kiya, aur Sufyan ne (ungliyan) bhinch kar kaha: Thori si."
"1013","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ismail ibn Abi Khalid ne hum se bayan kiya, apne walid se, unhon ne kaha: Main Madinah aaya aur Abu Hurayrah ke paas thehra, aur un ke aur mere aaqaon ke darmiyan rishtedari thi, aur Abu Hurayrah logon ko namaz parhate the aur use halka karte the, to main ne kaha: Ai Abu Hurayrah, kya yehi Rasool Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ki namaz thi, unhon ne kaha: Haan, aur is se bhi chhoti."
"1014","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Muhammad ibn Ajlan ne hum se bayan kiya, al-Qaqa se, Abu Salih se, Abu Hurayrah se, ke Rasool Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya: Main tumhare liye sirf baap ki manind hun, tumhein sikhata hun, pas jab tum mein se koi qazae hajat ke liye jaye to pakhana ya peshab karte waqt na qible ki taraf munh kare aur na us ki taraf peeth kare, aur unhon ne humein teen patharon se istinja karne ka hukm diya, aur gobar aur gali sari haddiyon se mana farmaya, aur is se ke aadmi apne dayein hath se istinja kare."
"1015","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Muhammad ibn Amr ibn Alqamah ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Malih ibn Abd Allah al-Sadi ko Abu Hurayrah se riwayat karte hue suna, unhon ne kaha: Beshak jo imam se pehle apna sar uthata aur jhukata hai us ki peshani shaitan ke hath mein hai, Abu Bakr ne kaha: Aur Sufyan kabhi ise (Nabi tak) uthate the aur kabhi nahi uthate the."
"1016","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ibn Jurayj ne hum se bayan kiya, Ata se, unhon ne kaha: Hum ne Abu Hurayrah ko kehte hue suna: Har namaz mein qirat hai, jo kuch Rasool Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne humein sunaya hum tumhein sunate hain aur jo kuch unhon ne hum se poshida rakha hum tum se poshida rakhte hain, har namaz jis mein Umm al-Quran na parhi jaye woh naqis hai, ek aadmi ne un se kaha: Agar main use akele parhun to kya woh mujhe kifayat karegi, unhon ne kaha: Agar tum us par bas karo to woh tumhein kifayat karegi aur agar tum mazeed parho to woh behtar hai."
"1017","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ayyub ibn Musa ne hum se bayan kiya, Ata ibn Mina se, Abu Hurayrah se, unhon ne kaha: Hum ne Rasool Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ke sath Iza al-Sama Unshaqqat aur Iqra Bismi Rabbik mein sajda kiya, Sufyan ne kaha: Aur Ata ibn Mina Abu Hurayrah ke mashhoor sathiyon mein se the."
"1018","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Yahya ibn Said ne hum se bayan kiya, Abu Bakr ibn Muhammad ibn Amr ibn Hazm se, Umar ibn Abd al-Aziz se, Abu Bakr ibn Abd al-Rahman ibn al-Harith ibn Hisham se, Abu Hurayrah se, unhon ne kaha: Hum ne Rasool Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ke sath Iza al-Sama Unshaqqat aur Iqra Bismi Rabbik Allazi Khalaq mein sajda kiya, Al-Humaydi ne kaha: Sufyan se kaha gaya: Iqra Bismi Rabbik samet, unhon ne kaha: Haan."
"1019","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ismail ibn Umayyah ne hum se bayan kiya, Abu Muhammad ibn Amr ibn Hurayth al-Udhri se, apne dada se, Abu Hurayrah se, unhon ne kaha: Abu al-Qasim Rasool Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya: Jab tum mein se koi namaz parhe to apne chehre ke samne koi cheez rakhe, agar kuch na paye to laathi gaar le, agar laathi na paye to lakeer kheench le, phir jo kuch us ke samne se guzre woh use nuqsan nahi dega."
"1020","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hakim ibn Jubayr ne hum se bayan kiya, Abu Salih se, Abu Hurayrah se, unhon ne kaha: Rasool Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya: Har cheez ki ek bulandi hai, aur Quran ki bulandi Surah al-Baqarah hai, us mein ek ayat hai jo Quran ki ayaton ki sardar hai, woh jis ghar mein ho jis mein shaitan ho us mein parhi nahi jati magar woh us se nikal jata hai, woh Ayat al-Kursi hai."
"1021","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ismail ibn Umayyah ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Mujh se dehat walon me se ek Aae'rabi ne bayan kiya, us ne kaha: Main ne Abu Hurayrah ko kehte hue suna: Abu al-Qasim Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya: Jab tum me se koi La Uqsimu Bi Yawm Al-Qiyamah parhe aur us ke aakhir Alaysa Dhalika Bi Qadirin Ala An Yuhyi Al-Mawta tak pahunche to kahe: Haan beshak, aur jab Wal-Mursalati Urfan parhe aur us ke aakhir Fa Bi Ayyi Hadithin Bae'dahu Yu'minun tak pahunche to kahe: Hum Allah par iman laye, aur jab Wat-Teeni Waz-Zaitun parhe aur us ke aakhir Alays Allahu Bi Ahkam Al-Hakimin tak pahunche to kahe: Haan beshak, aur kabhi Sufyan kehte: Haan beshak, aur main is par gawahon me se hun, Sufyan ne kaha: Ismail ne kaha: Pas main ne us Aae'rabi se hadith dohrane ke liye kaha to us ne kaha: Ae mere bhai ke bete, kya tum khayal karte ho ke main ne ise yaad nahin kiya, main ne saath hajj kiye hain aur un me se koi hajj aisa nahin magar main us oont ko janta hun jis par main ne use ada kiya."
"1022","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ubayd Allah ibn Abi Yazid ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Mujhe us shakhs ne khabar di jis ne Abu Hurayrah ko suna ke unhon ne kaha: Abu al-Qasim Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya: Jo shakhs janabat ki halat me ho woh us waqt tak na soye jab tak namaz jaisa wuzu na kar le."
"1023","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abd al-Malik ibn Umayr ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Main ne ek aadmi ko kehte hue suna: Main ne Abu Hurayrah ko kehte hue suna: Main ne Rasul Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ko dekha ke khare ho kar aur baith kar namaz parh rahe the, aur nange paon aur jute pehen kar, aur main ne Aap ko dayen aur bayen phirte hue dekha, Sufyan ne kaha: Unhon ne kaha: Ye Abu al-Awbar hai."
"1024","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Umar ibn Said ibn Masruq al-Thawri ne hum se bayan kiya, Ashath ibn Sulaym al-Muharibi se, woh apne walid se, unhon ne kaha: Abu Hurayrah masjid me baithe hue the ke unhon ne ek aadmi ko azaan ke baad masjid se nikalte hue dekha to unhon ne kaha: Raha ye shakhs to is ne Abu al-Qasim Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ki nafarmani ki."
"1025","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, al-Aa'mash se, Abu Salih se, Abu Hurayrah se, Nabi Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam se marfu'an, Aap ne farmaya: Imam zimmedar hai aur muazzin amanatdar hai, Ae Allah, imamon ko hidayat de aur muazzino ko bakhsh de."
"1026","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Muhammad ibn Ajlan ne hum se bayan kiya, apne walid se - ya Said al-Maqburi se - Abu Hurayrah se, unhon ne kaha: Rasul Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya: Mardon ki sab se behtar safen un ki pehli safen hain aur un ki sab se buri un ki aakhri hain, aur aurton ki sab se behtar safen un ki aakhri hain aur un ki sab se buri un ki pehli hain."
"1027","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abd Allah ibn Raja ne hum se bayan kiya, Ibn Ajlan se, woh apne walid se, Abu Hurayrah se, Nabi Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam se, isi tarah ki riwayat ke sath."
"1028","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sumayy, Abu Bakr ke azaad kardah, ne hum se bayan kiya, Abu Salih se, Abu Hurayrah se, unhon ne kaha: Rasul Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya: Hajj mabroor ka sawab Jannat ke siwa kuch nahin, aur ek umrah dusre umrah tak un ke darmiyan ke gunahon ka kaffara hai."
"1029","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu al-Zinad ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Mujhe Musa ibn Abi Uthman ne khabar di, apne walid se, Abu Hurayrah se: Ke Rasul Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ka guzar ek aadmi par hua jo qurbani ke oont ko haank raha tha to farmaya: Is par sawar ho ja, us ne kaha: Ye qurbani ka janwar hai, farmaya: Is par sawar ho ja, us ne kaha: Ye qurbani ka janwar hai, farmaya: Is par sawar ho ja, tera bura ho - ya: tujh par afsos hai, is par sawar ho ja."
"1030","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Mansur ibn al-Mutamir ne hum se bayan kiya, Abu Hazim al-Ashjai se, Abu Hurayrah se, unhon ne kaha: Rasul Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya: Jo shakhs is Ghar ka hajj kare aur wapas aane tak fahash kalami kare na fisq o fujur to woh is tarah lautta hai jaise us din tha jis din us ki maan ne use jana tha."
"1031","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Al-Zuhri ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hanzalah al-Aslami ne mujhe khabar di, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Abu Hurayrah ko kehte hue suna: Allah ke Rasool Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya: Us Zaat ki qasam jis ke Haath mein meri jaan hai, Maryam ke bete zaroor wadi-e-al-Rawha se Hajj karne wale ya Umrah karne wale ke taur par ihram bandhenge, ya woh dono ko jama karenge."
"1032","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ibn Ajlan ne hum se bayan kiya, Said se, Abu Hurayrah se, ke Allah ke Rasool Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya: Koi aurat teen se zyada (din ki musafat) ka safar na kare magar mahram ke saath."
"1033","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Al-Zuhri ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Salamah ibn Abd al-Rahman ne mujhe khabar di, Abu Hurayrah se, ke Allah ke Rasool Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya: Jis ne Ramadan ke roze iman ke saath aur sawab talab karte hue rakhe us ke pichle gunah bakhsh diye jayenge, aur jis ne Shab-e-Qadr mein iman ke saath aur sawab talab karte hue qiyam kiya us ke pichle gunah bakhsh diye jayenge."
"1034","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Al-Zuhri ne hum se bayan kiya, aur main ne ise un se yaad kiya, unhon ne kaha: Humayd ibn Abd al-Rahman ne mujhe khabar di, Abu Hurayrah se: Ke ek shakhs Nabi Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ke paas aaya aur kaha: Ai Allah ke Rasool, main halak ho gaya. Unhon ne farmaya: Tumhe kya hua? Us ne kaha: Main ne Ramadan mein apni biwi se jima kiya. To Nabi Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne us se farmaya: Kya tum ek ghulam aazad kar sakte ho? Us ne kaha: Nahin. Unhon ne farmaya: Kya tum do mahine lagatar roze rakh sakte ho? Us ne kaha: Nahin. Unhon ne farmaya: Kya tum saath miskino ko khana khila sakte ho? Us ne kaha: Nahin, mujhe (istaat) muyassar nahin. Nabi Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya: Baith jao. Pas woh baith gaya, aur jab woh isi halat mein tha, Nabi Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ke paas khajooron se bhara ek bara tokra laya gaya - aur al-araq bara tokra hota hai - to Nabi Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne us se farmaya: Jao aur ise sadqa kar do. Us ne kaha: Ai Allah ke Rasool, kya hum se zyada mohtaj par? Us Zaat ki qasam jis ne aap ko haq ke saath bheja, is ke dono harron ke darmiyan hum se zyada mohtaj koi ghar nahin. To Allah ke Rasool Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam hanse yahan tak ke un ke nawajiz zahir ho gaye - aur kabhi Sufyan kehte: un ke dadh ke daant - phir unhon ne farmaya: Jao aur ise apne ghar walon ko khilao."
"1035","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu al-Zinad ne hum se bayan kiya, al-Araj se, Abu Hurayrah se, unhon ne kaha: Allah ke Rasool Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya: Wisal mat karo. Unhon ne kaha: Ai Allah ke Rasool, lekin aap to wisal karte hain? Unhon ne farmaya: Main tum mein se kisi ki tarah nahin hoon; main apne Rab ke paas raat guzarta hoon woh mujhe khilata hai aur pilata hai."
"1036","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu al-Zinad ne hum se bayan kiya, al-Araj se, Abu Hurayrah se, unhon ne kaha: Allah ke Rasool Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya: Allah Tabarak wa Taala ne farmaya: Ibn-e-Adam ka har amal us ke liye hai siwaye roze ke; woh Mere liye hai, aur Main hi us ka badla doonga."
"1037","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Amr ibn Dinar ne hum se bayan kiya, Ubayd ibn Umayr se, Nabi Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam se, isi tarah ki riwayat ke saath."
"1038","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu al-Zinad ne hum se bayan kiya, al-Araj se, Abu Hurayrah se, unhon ne kaha: Allah ke Rasool Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya: Jab tum mein se kisi ko khane ki dawat di jaye jabke woh roze se ho, to use kehna chahiye: Main roze se hoon."
"1039","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ibn Ajlan ne hum se bayan kiya, al-Maqburi se, Abu Hurayrah se, Nabi Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam se, isi tarah ki riwayat ke saath."
"1040","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu al-Zinad ne hum se bayan kiya, al-Araj se, Abu Hurayrah se, unhon ne kaha: Allah ke Rasool Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya: Jab tum mein se koi subah roze ki halat mein kare to na fahsh goi kare aur na jahalat kare; agar koi shakhs use gaali de ya us se jhagda kare to use kehna chahiye: Main roze se hoon."
"1041","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, Ibn Ajlan se, Said al-Maqburi se, Abu Hurayrah se, Nabi Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam se, isi tarah ki riwayat ke sath."
"1042","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu al-Zinad ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Mujhe Musa ibn Abi Uthman ne khabar di, apne walid se, Abu Hurayrah se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya: Koi aurat Ramazan ke mahine ke ilawa kisi din ka roza na rakhe jabke us ka shohar maujud ho magar us ki ijazat se."
"1043","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Amr ibn Dinar ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Mujhe Yahya ibn Jadah ne khabar di, Abd Allah ibn Amr al-Qari se, unhon ne kaha: Maine Abu Hurayrah ko kehte hue suna: Maine Jumuah ke din roza rakhne se mana nahi kiya, lekin Muhammad ne is Ghar ke Rabb ki qasam is se mana farmaya."
"1044","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Amr ibn Dinar ne hum se bayan kiya, Mujhe Yahya ibn Jadah ne khabar di, Abd Allah ibn Amr al-Qari se, unhon ne kaha: Maine Abu Hurayrah ko kehte hue suna: Ye maine nahi kaha ke jo subah janabat ki halat me kare us ka roza toot gaya, lekin Muhammad ne is Kaaba ke Rabb ki qasam ye farmaya."
"1045","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Suhayl ibn Abi Salih ne hum se bayan kiya, apne walid se, Abu Hurayrah se: Ke kuch aurton ne kaha: Ae Allah ke Rasul, hum mardon ki wajah se aap ki majlis tak nahi pahunch saktin, to kya aap hamare liye koi waqt muqarrar farma den jab hum aap ki khidmat me hazir hon, to Nabi Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya: Tumhara waada falan aurat ka ghar hai, pas wo un ke muqarrar waqt par aayin, aur Rasulullah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam tashrif laye, aur un se jo batein farmayin un me se ye thi ke aap ne farmaya: Jo bhi aurat teen bache kho de aur sawab ki niyyat se sabr kare magar wo Jannat me dakhil hogi, ek aurat ne kaha: Ya do, Ae Allah ke Rasul, Aap ne farmaya: Ya do."
"1046","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Maine ise Ibn Shihab al-Zuhri ke munh se suna, unhon ne kaha: Mujhe Said ibn al-Musayyib ne khabar di, Abu Hurayrah se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya: Koi Musalman teen bache kho de to wo Aag me dakhil nahi hoga magar qasam puri karne ke liye."
"1047","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hum se Sumayy jo Abu Bakr ke azaad karda ghulam hain ne bayan kiya, Abu Salih se, Abu Hurayrah se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya: Jo janaze par namaz parhe us ke liye ek qirat hai, aur jo us ke sath rahe yahan tak ke us ka muamala mukammal ho jaye us ke liye do qirat hain, un me se ek Uhud jaisa hai."
"1048","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Maine al-Zuhri ko Said ibn al-Musayyib se, Abu Hurayrah se riwayat karte hue suna, ke Rasulullah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya: Janaze ko jaldi le jao, kyunke agar wo nek tha to ye bhalai hai jis ki taraf tum use aage badha rahe ho, aur agar wo us ke ilawa tha to ye burai hai jise tum apni gardanon se utar rahe ho."
"1049","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hum se al-Zuhri ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Mujhe Abu Salamah ibn Abd al-Rahman ne khabar di, Abu Hurayrah se, unhon ne kaha: Jab Najashi ka inteqal hua to Nabi Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya: Us ke liye maghfirat talab karo."
"1050","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hum se Ibn Ajlan ne bayan kiya, Wahb ibn Kaysan se, us shakhs se jis ne Abu Hurayrah ko kehte hue suna: Umar ibn al-Khattab ne ek rone wali aurat ki awaz suni aur use mana kiya, to Nabi Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne un se farmaya: Use chor do, Ae Abu Hafs, kyunke ahad naya hai, aur aankh ro rahi hai, aur jaan musibat me hai."
"1051","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hamzah ibn al-Mughirah al-Kufi - aur woh aazad kardah logon ke sardaron mein se thay - ne hum se bayan kiya, Suhayl se, unhon ne apne walid se, unhon ne Abu Hurayrah se, unhon ne kaha: Rasool Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya: Ae Allah, meri qabr ko butt na banana, Allah un logon par lanat kare jinhon ne apne nabiyon ki qabron ko masjiden bana liya."
"1052","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Al-Zuhri ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Said ibn al-Musayyib ne hum se bayan kiya, Abu Hurayrah se, unhon ne kaha: Rasool Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya: najsh na karo, aur koi shakhs apne bhai ke saude par sauda na kare, aur na apne bhai ke paigham par paigham bheje, aur na shehri dehati ke liye beche, aur koi aurat apni behan ki talaq ka mutalba na kare taake woh us ke bartan mein jo hai usay ulat le."
"1053","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu al-Zinad ne hum se bayan kiya, al-Araj se, Abu Hurayrah se, unhon ne kaha: Rasool Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya: qafilon se aage ja kar mulaqat na karo, aur najsh na karo, aur na shehri dehati ke liye beche, aur koi shakhs apne bhai ke saude par sauda na kare, aur na apne bhai ke paigham par paigham bheje."
"1054","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu al-Zinad ne hum se bayan kiya, al-Araj se, Abu Hurayrah se, unhon ne kaha: Abul Qasim Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya: oonton aur bakriyon ke thanon ko na bandho, tum mein se jo shakhs un mein se kuch khareede to usay do baton mein se behtar ka ikhtiyar hai: agar chahe to usay rakhe, aur agar chahe to usay khajooron ke ek sa ke sath wapas kar de, gehon ke sath nahi."
"1055","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ayyub ne hum se bayan kiya, Muhammad ibn Sirin se, unhon ne kaha: main ne Abu Hurayrah ko kehte hue suna: Abul Qasim Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya: jo shakhs musarrah janwar khareede usay ikhtiyar hai: agar chahe to usay rakhe, aur agar chahe to usay khajooron ke ek sa ke sath wapas kar de, gehon ke sath nahi."
"1056","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Al-Ala ne hum se bayan kiya, apne walid se, Abu Hurayrah se, ke Rasool Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya: jhooti qasam saman ko farokht dilati hai magar nafa ko mita deti hai."
"1057","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Damrah ne hum se bayan kiya, Yunus ibn Yazid al-Ayli se, Ibn Shihab se, Said ibn al-Musayyib se, Abu Hurayrah se, Nabi Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam se, isi tarah ki riwayat."
"1058","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu al-Zinad ne hum se bayan kiya, al-Araj se, Abu Hurayrah se, unhon ne kaha: Rasool Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya: maaldar ka adayegi mein takheer karna zulm hai, jab tum mein se kisi ka hawala kisi maaldar par kiya jaye to usay hawala qabool kar lena chahiye."
"1059","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Al-Ala ibn Abd al-Rahman ne hum se bayan kiya, apne walid se, Abu Hurayrah se: ke Nabi Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ghalla bechne wale ek shakhs ke paas se guzre jo Aap ko pasand aaya, to Aap ne us mein apna hath dala to usay geela ghalla paya, to Nabi Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya: jo humen dhoka de woh hum mein se nahi."
"1060","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Salim Abu al-Nadr ne hum se bayan kiya, ek shakhs se, Abu Hurayrah se: ke ek shakhs har saal Nabi Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ko sharab ka ek mashkeeza hadiya karta tha, to ek saal us ne Aap ko hadiya kiya jab ke woh haram ki ja chuki thi, to Nabi Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya: woh haram kar di gayi hai, us shakhs ne kaha: kya main usay farokht na kar dun, Unhon ne farmaya: be shak Jis ne us ka peena haram kiya Us ne us ka bechna bhi haram kiya, us ne kaha: kya main usay Yahudiyon ko hadiya na kar dun, Unhon ne farmaya: be shak Jis ne usay haram kiya Us ne usay Yahudiyon ko hadiya karna bhi haram kiya, us ne kaha: main us ka kya karun, Unhon ne farmaya: usay khuli zameen par baha do."
"1061","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Amr ibn Dinar ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Mujhe Hisham ibn Yahya al-Makhzumi ne khabar di, Abu Hurayrah se, unhon ne kaha: Rasul Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya: Jo shakhs apna samaan ba'aynihi maujood paye kisi aise aadmi ke paas jo muflis ho gaya ho to woh us ka zyada haqdar hai."
"1062","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Yahya ibn Said ne hum se bayan kiya, Abu Bakr ibn Muhammad ibn Amr ibn Hazm se, Umar ibn Abd al-Aziz se, Abu Bakr ibn Abd al-Rahman ibn al-Harith ibn Hisham se, Abu Hurayrah se, Nabi Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam se isi tarah ki riwayat ke saath."
"1063","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu al-Zinad ne hum se bayan kiya, al-Araj se, Abu Hurayrah se, unhon ne kaha: Rasul Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya: Meri misaal aur mujh se pehle ambiya ki misaal us shakhs ki si hai jis ne ek imarat banayi aur use khoob umda, mukammal aur khubsurat banaya, siwaye ek eent ki jagah ke, to log us ke gird phirne lage kehte hue: Hum ne is se zyada khubsurat imarat kabhi nahi dekhi siwaye is eent ki jagah ke, beshak main hi woh eent hun."
"1064","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu al-Zinad ne hum se bayan kiya, al-Araj se, Abu Hurayrah se, unhon ne kaha: Rasul Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya: Meri misaal aur logon ki misaal us shakhs ki si hai jis ne aag jalayi, jab us ne us ke liye roshni kar di to parwane aur patange us me girne lage, pas main tumhen tumhare kamarbandon se pakad kar Aag se rok raha hun jabke tum us me ghuse ja rahe ho."
"1065","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu al-Zinad ne hum se bayan kiya, al-Araj se, Abu Hurayrah se, unhon ne kaha: Rasul Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya: Agar ye na hota ke main momineen par mashaqqat dalunga to main koi lashkar na bhejta magar ye ke us se peeche reh jata, mere paas sawar karane ke liye sawaariyan nahi hain aur mujh par ye bhari hai ke woh mere baad peeche reh jayen."
"1066","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu al-Zinad ne hum se bayan kiya, al-Araj se, Abu Hurayrah se, unhon ne kaha: Rasul Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya: Us Zaat ki qasam jis ke Haath me meri jaan hai, main pasand karta hun ke Allah ki raah me qatl kiya jaun phir zinda kiya jaun phir qatl kiya jaun phir zinda kiya jaun phir qatl kiya jaun, Abu Hurayrah ne teen martaba kaha: Allah ki qasam main gawahi deta hun."
"1067","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu al-Zinad ne hum se bayan kiya, al-Araj se, Abu Hurayrah se, unhon ne kaha: Rasul Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya: Ae Allah, main Tujh se ek ehad leta hun jise Tu kabhi nahi todega: jis Musalman aadmi ko main takleef pahunchaun khwah main use koda marun ya use la'nat karun to use us ke liye salat, taharat aur us ke haq me dua bana de, Abu al-Zinad ne kaha: Ye Abu Hurayrah ki boli hai aur asal me ye hai: Main ne use koda mara, main ne use la'nat ki."
"1068","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu al-Zinad ne hum se bayan kiya, al-Araj se, Abu Hurayrah se, unhon ne kaha: Rasul Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya: Koi nau-maulood aisa nahi magar Shaitan use chubhota hai, siwaye Isa aur un ki walida ke, kyunke farishton ne un dono ka ihata kar liya tha, aur agar chaho to padho: Aur main use aur us ki aulad ko Shaitan mardood se Teri panah me deti hun."
"1069","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ubayd Allah ibn Abi Yazid ne hum se bayan kiya, Nafi ibn Jubayr ibn Mutim se, Abu Hurayrah se, unhon ne kaha: Main Rasul Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ke saath din ke kuch hisse me nikla, na woh mujh se baat kar rahe the aur na main un se, yahan tak ke woh Qaynuqa ke bazaar aaye phir wapas laute yahan tak ke Aishah ke sehan me aaye aur us me baith gaye, phir farmaya: Kya woh hai, kya woh hai, yani Hasan, mera khayal tha ke un ki walida ne unhen sirf ghusl dene aur haar pehnane ke liye rok rakha hai, zyada der na guzri ke woh daudte hue aaye yahan tak ke dono me se har ek ne doosre ko gale lagaya, to Rasul Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya: Ae Allah, main us se muhabbat karta hun pas Tu us se muhabbat farma aur jo us se muhabbat kare us se muhabbat farma."
"1070","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu al-Zinad ne hum se bayan kiya, al-Araj se, Abu Hurayrah se, unhon ne kaha: Rasul Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya: Log is muamle me Quraysh ke tab'e hain: un ke Musalman un ke Musalmanon ke tab'e hain aur un ke kafir un ke kafiron ke tab'e hain."
"1071","Humein Al-Humaydi ne bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Humein Sufyan ne bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Humein Abu al-Zinad ne bayan kiya, al-Araj se, Abu Hurayrah se, unhon ne farmaya: Rasulullah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya: Tum logon ko ma'dinon ki tarah paoge: Jahiliyyat mein un mein se jo sab se behtar thay, wahi Islam mein bhi sab se behtar hain jab woh samajh hasil kar lein."
"1072","Humein Al-Humaydi ne bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Humein Sufyan ne bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Mujhe Tumah ibn Amr al-Jafari ne bayan kiya, Yazid ibn al-Asamm se, Abu Hurayrah se, Nabi Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam se, isi tarah ki riwayat ke sath."
"1073","Humein Al-Humaydi ne bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Humein Sufyan ne bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Humein Abu al-Zinad ne bayan kiya, al-Araj se, Abu Hurayrah se, unhon ne farmaya: Rasulullah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya: ... (Sanad, ha)."
"1074","Aur Humein Sufyan ne bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Humein Ibn Tawus ne bayan kiya, apne walid se, Abu Hurayrah se, unhon ne farmaya: Rasulullah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya: Oonton par sawar hone wali behtareen aurtein. Un mein se ek ne kaha: Quraysh ki nek aurtein. Aur doosre ne kaha: Quraysh ki aurtein, bachche par us ke bachpan mein sab se zyada shafqat karne wali aur shohar ke maal ke bare mein sab se zyada hifazat karne wali hain."
"1075","Humein Al-Humaydi ne bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Humein Sufyan ne bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Humein Abu al-Zinad ne bayan kiya, al-Araj se, Abu Hurayrah se, unhon ne farmaya: Rasulullah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya: Allah ki qasam, Aslam, Ghifar, Juhaynah aur Muzaynah do haleefon - Asad aur Ghatfan - se aur Banu Tamim aur Banu Amir ibn Sasah se behtar hain. Unhon ne ise buland awaz se farmaya."
"1076","Humein Al-Humaydi ne bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Humein Sufyan ne bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Humein Abu al-Zinad ne bayan kiya, al-Araj se, Abu Hurayrah se, unhon ne farmaya: Rasulullah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya: Tumhare paas Ahl-e-Yaman aaye hain; woh dilon ke lehaz se sab se zyada raqeeq aur sab se zyada narm hain. Iman Yamani hai aur hikmat Yamani hai, jabke sakhti, sangdili aur dilon ki sakhti buland awaz wale oon walon ke han hai, oonton ki dumon ki jadon ke paas, Rabiah aur Mudar me se. Sufyan ne farmaya: Aur unhon ne apne is qaul se: Tumhare paas Ahl-e-Yaman aaye hain, sirf Ahl-e-Tihamah murad liye hain, kyunke Makkah Yaman hai, aur woh Tihami hai, aur yahi un ka qaul hai: Iman Yamani hai aur hikmat Yamani hai."
"1077","Humein Al-Humaydi ne bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Humein Sufyan ne bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Humein Abu al-Zinad ne bayan kiya, al-Araj se, Abu Hurayrah se, unhon ne farmaya: Al-Tufayl ibn Amr al-Dawsi Rasulullah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ki khidmat mein hazir hue aur arz kiya: Ya Rasulullah, Daws ne nafarmani ki aur inkar kiya, pas un ke khilaf dua farmaiye. To Rasulullah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam qible ki taraf mutawajjeh hue aur apna hath buland kiya, aur logon ne kaha: Daws halak ho gaya. To Nabi Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya: Ae Allah, Daws ko hidayat de aur unhein le aa. Do martaba."
"1078","Humein Al-Humaydi ne bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Humein Sufyan ne bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Humein Ibn Ajlan ne bayan kiya, Said ibn Abi Said al-Maqburi se, Abu Hurayrah se: Ke ek dehati aadmi ne Nabi Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ko ek oont tohfe mein diya, to Nabi Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne use teen (oont badle mein) diye lekin woh razi na hua, phir use mazeed teen diye lekin woh razi na hua, phir use mazeed teen diye, to woh nau par razi ho gaya. To Nabi Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya: Maine irada kiya tha ke Qurashi, Ansari, Thaqafi ya Dawsi ke siwa kisi ka tohfa qabool na karun. Sufyan ne farmaya: Aur Ibn Ajlan ke ilawa doosron ne kaha: Abu Hurayrah ne farmaya: Jab Rasulullah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne ye baat farmayi, to Aap ne mur kar mujhe dekha, to Aap ko sharm mehsoos hui aur farmaya: Ya Dawsi."
"1079","Humein Al-Humaydi ne bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Humein Sufyan ne bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Humein Amr ne bayan kiya, Tawus se: Ke ek dehati ne Nabi Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ko tohfa diya, to Aap ne use badla diya lekin woh razi na hua, phir use badla diya lekin woh razi na hua, phir use badla diya to woh razi ho gaya. To Nabi Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya: Maine irada kiya tha ke Qurashi, Ansari ya Thaqafi ke siwa kisi ka tohfa qabool na karun."
"1080","Humein Al-Humaydi ne bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Humein Sufyan ne bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Humein Zaidah ibn Qudamah ne bayan kiya, Abd al-Malik ibn Umayr se, Abu Salamah ibn Abd al-Rahman se, Abu Hurayrah se, ke Rasulullah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya: Beshak kisi shair ka kaha hua sab se sacha sher, aur Ibn Abi al-Salt qareeb tha ke Islam qabool kar leta."
"1081","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu al-Zinad ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: al-Araj ne mujhe khabar di ke unhon ne Abu Salamah ibn Abd al-Rahman ko kehte hue suna: main ne Abu Hurayrah ko kehte hue suna: Rasool Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne hamein fajar ki namaz parhai, phir apne chehre ke saath logon ki taraf mutawajjeh hue aur farmaya: jabke ek aadmi ek gaaye ko haank raha tha, to woh thak gayi, pas us ne us par sawari ki aur use mara, to us ne kaha: hum is ke liye paida nahi kiye gaye, hum to sirf zameen mein hal chalane ke liye paida kiye gaye hain, logon ne kaha: Subhan Allah, kya gaaye bolti hai, pas Rasool Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya: main is par iman rakhta hun, main aur Abu Bakr aur Umar, aur woh wahan maujood na the, phir unhon ne farmaya: jabke ek aadmi apni bakriyon mein tha, to ek bhediye ne un mein se ek par hamla kiya, pas us ke malik ne use pa liya aur use bacha liya, to bhediye ne kaha: darindon ke din is ke liye kaun hoga, jis din mere siwa us ka koi charwaha na hoga, logon ne kaha: Subhan Allah, kya bhediya bolta hai, pas Nabi Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya: main is par iman rakhta hun, main aur Abu Bakr aur Umar, aur woh wahan maujood na the."
"1082","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Misar ne hum se bayan kiya, Sad ibn Ibrahim se, Abu Salamah ibn Abd al-Rahman se, Abu Hurayrah se, Nabi Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam se, isi tarah ki riwayat, siwa is ke ke unhon ne kaha: main is par iman rakhta hun, main aur Abu Bakr aur Umar."
"1083","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ismail ibn Abi Khalid ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: main ne Qays ko kehte hue suna: main ne Abu Hurayrah ko kehte hue suna: main ne Rasool Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ke saath teen saal guzare, aur un saalon mein main kisi cheez ka is se zyada harees na tha ke koi cheez yaad kar lun, main ne Rasool Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ko farmate hue suna: tum mein se koi apni rassi le aur us se lakriyan jama kare, phir use apni peeth par laade hue aaye aur use beche, phir us se khaye ya sadqa kare, ye us ke liye is se behtar hai ke woh kisi aise aadmi ke paas aaye jise Allah ne apne fazl se ghani kar diya ho aur us se mange, chahe woh use de ya rok le, kyunke upar wala haath neeche wale haath se behtar hai."
"1084","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu al-Zinad ne hum se bayan kiya, al-Araj se, Abu Hurayrah se, jinhon ne kaha: Rasool Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya: tum mein se koi apni rassi le aur apni peeth par lakriyan jama kare, phir use beche aur us se khaye aur sadqa kare, ye us ke liye is se behtar hai ke woh kisi aise aadmi ke paas aaye jise Allah ne ghani kar diya ho aur us se mange, chahe woh use de ya rok le, kyunke upar wala haath neeche wale haath se behtar hai."
"1085","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Muhammad ibn Ajlan ne hum se bayan kiya, Said se, Abu Hurayrah se, Nabi Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam se, isi tarah ki riwayat, aur unhon ne is mein izafa kiya: aur un se ibtida karo jin ki tum kifalat karte ho."
"1086","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: hum ne al-Hajari se Abu Iyad se Abu Hurayrah se riwayaat suni, ye un mein se ek hai, jinhon ne kaha: Rasool Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya: miskeen woh nahi hai jise ek ya do khajoor ya ek ya do luqme lautate hon, balke miskeen woh hai jo na mangta ho aur na us ka haal maloom ho ke use diya jaye."
"1087","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu al-Zinad ne hum se bayan kiya, al-Araj se, Abu Hurayrah se, jinhon ne kaha: Rasool Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya: Ayyub par sone ke tidde utare gaye, to woh apna kapra phelate hue unhein us mein jama karne lage, to unhein pukara gaya: Ay Ayyub, kya jo hum ne tumhein diya woh tumhein kafi na tha, unhon ne kaha: Ay mere Rab, tere fazl se kaun be-niyaz ho sakta hai."
"1088","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu al-Zinad ne hum se bayan kiya, al-Araj se, Abu Hurayrah se, jinhon ne kaha: Rasool Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya: behtareen sadqa doodh dene wali sawari hai jo aariyatan di gayi ho, jo subah doodh ke bartan ke saath jati hai ya shaam ko doodh ke bartan ke saath wapas aati hai."
"1089","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Muhammad ibn Ajlan ne hum se bayan kiya, Said al-Maqburi se, Abu Hurayrah se, Nabi Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam se, isi tarah ki riwayat, aur unhon ne is mein izafa kiya: aur Allah us ke liye har dohne par jo woh dohta hai ek neki likhta hai, ya unhon ne kaha: das nekiyan, us ke doodh dene ke mutabiq, chahe woh thoda doodh de ya zyada."
"1090","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu al-Zinad ne hum se bayan kiya, al-Araj se, Abu Hurayrah se, jinhon ne kaha: Rasool Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya: maaldari maal ki kasrat se nahi hai, balke maaldari dil ki maaldari hai."
"1091","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu al-Zinad ne hum se bayan kiya, al-Araj se, Abu Hurayrah se, unhon ne kaha: Rasool Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya: kharch karne wale aur bakhil ki misaal un do aadmiyon jaisi hai jin par un ke seenon se un ki hansliyon tak lohe ki do zirahen hon. Jab kharch karne wala kharch karne ka irada karta hai to zirah us par kushada ho jati hai - ya guzar jati hai - yahan tak ke us ki ungliyon ke poron ko dhamp leti hai aur us ke nishanat ko mita deti hai. Aur jab bakhil kharch karne ka irada karta hai to zirah us par simat jati hai aur har halqa apni jagah par rehta hai yahan tak ke us ki hansli ko jakad leti hai - ya unhon ne kaha: us ki gardan ko. Abu Hurayrah ne kaha: pas main gawahi deta hun ke main ne Rasool Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ko apne hath se is tarah farmate hue dekha. Aur Sufyan ne apne hath se apne gale ki taraf ishara kiya, aur woh use kushada karte hain lekin woh kushada nahin hoti. Do martaba."
"1092","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ibn Jurayj ne hum se bayan kiya, al-Hasan ibn Muslim ibn Yannaq se, Tawus se, Abu Hurayrah se, Nabi Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam se, isi tarah ki riwayat ke sath, siwaye is ke ke unhon ne kaha: Aur woh use kushada karta hai lekin woh kushada nahin hoti."
"1093","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu al-Zinad ne hum se bayan kiya, al-Araj se, Abu Hurayrah se, unhon ne kaha: Rasool Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya: jab tum mein se koi us shakhs ko dekhe jo maal aur jism mein us se bartar hai to use chahiye ke us shakhs ko dekhe jo is mein us se kamtar hai."
"1094","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, Abu al-Zinad se, al-Araj se, Abu Hurayrah se, unhon ne kaha: Rasool Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya: Allah ne farmaya: ae Ibn Adam, kharch kar Main tujh par kharch karunga. Unhon ne farmaya: Allah ka dayan hath bhara hua hai, beh raha hai, raat aur din use koi cheez kam nahin karti."
"1095","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu al-Zinad ne hum se bayan kiya, al-Araj se, Abu Hurayrah se, unhon ne kaha: Rasool Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya: do ka khana teen ko kafi hai, aur teen ka khana char ko kafi hai."
"1096","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu al-Zinad ne hum se bayan kiya, al-Araj se, Abu Hurayrah se, unhon ne kaha: Rasool Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya: budhe aadmi ka dil do cheezon ki mohabbat mein jawan rehta hai: maal ki mohabbat aur zindagi ki mohabbat. Aur kabhi Sufyan kehte: Zindagi."
"1097","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu al-Zinad ne hum se bayan kiya, al-Araj se, Abu Hurayrah se, unhon ne kaha: Rasool Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya: jab tum mein se kisi ka khadim us ke khane ki tayyari mein use kifayat kare aur us ke liye us ki garmi aur us ka dhuan bardasht kare to use chahiye ke use bitha le aur use apne sath khilaye. Agar woh inkar kare to use chahiye ke ek luqma le, use tar kare, phir use de de."
"1098","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ibn Ajlan ne hum se bayan kiya, Said se, Abu Hurayrah se, Nabi Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam se, isi tarah ki riwayat ke sath."
"1099","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, Ibn Abi Khalid se, un ke walid se, Abu Hurayrah se, Nabi Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam se, isi tarah ki riwayat ke sath."
"1100","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abd Allah ibn Dinar ne hum se bayan kiya, ke unhon ne Sulayman ibn Yasar ko Irak ibn Malik se riwayat karte hue suna, Abu Hurayrah se, Rasool Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam se, unhon ne farmaya: Musalman par us ke ghulam mein na us ke ghode mein koi sadqa hai."
"1101","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ayyub ibn Musa ne hum se bayan kiya, Makhul se, Sulayman ibn Yasar se, Irak se, Abu Hurayrah se, Nabi Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam se isi tarah ki riwayat ke sath."
"1102","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Yazid ibn Yazid ibn Jabir ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Maine Irak ibn Malik ko Abu Hurayrah se isi tarah ki riwayat bayan karte hue suna, lekin unhon ne ise marfu bayan nahi kiya."
"1103","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Maine al-Zuhri ko kehte hue suna: Maine Abd al-Rahman al-Araj ko kehte hue suna: Maine Abu Hurayrah ko kehte hue suna: Rasulullah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya: Jab tum me se koi apne padosi se apni deewar me shahteer lagane ki ijazat mange to wo use na roke, phir jab unhon ne ye un se bayan kiya to unhon ne apne sar jhuka liye to unhon ne kaha: Mujhe kya hai ke main tumhen munh pherte hue dekhta hun, Allah ki qasam main ise zaroor tumhare kandhon ke darmiyan dalunga, Sufyan ne kaha: Mujhe wo jagah yaad hai jahan maine ise al-Zuhri se suna tha, unhon ne is me al-Araj ke siwa kisi ka zikr nahi kiya, unhon ne is me Said ibn al-Musayyib ka zikr nahi kiya."
"1104","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ayyub ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ikrimah ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Kya main tumhen un mukhtasar baton ki khabar na dun jo hum ne Abu Hurayrah se suni thin, ye un me se ek hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya: Tum me se koi apne padosi ko apni deewar me shahteer lagane se na roke, Ayyub ne kaha: Agar main tum se kahun ke jab Ikrimah Basrah aaye to al-Hasan ne tashreeh ka aksar hissa tark kar diya yahan tak ke unhon ne ise chhod diya to main sacha hunga."
"1105","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu al-Zinad ne hum se bayan kiya, al-Araj se, Abu Hurayrah se, jinhon ne kaha: Rasulullah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya: Agar koi shakhs baghair ijazat tumhari taraf dekhe aur tum use kankari maro aur us ki aankh phod do to tum par koi gunah nahi."
"1106","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: al-Zuhri ne hum se bayan kiya aur unhon ne mujh se bayan kiya jabke na mere sath koi tha aur na un ke sath koi tha, unhon ne kaha: Mujhe Said ibn al-Musayyib aur Abu Salamah ibn Abd al-Rahman ne khabar di, Abu Hurayrah se, ke Rasulullah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya: Be-zuban janwar ka zakhm muaf hai, kaan muaf hai, aur kunwan muaf hai, aur dafeena me panchwan hissa hai."
"1107","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu al-Zinad ne hum se bayan kiya, al-Araj se, Abu Hurayrah se, Nabi Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam se isi tarah ki riwayat ke sath."
"1108","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: al-Zuhri ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Mujhe Abu Salamah ibn Abd al-Rahman ne khabar di, Abu Hurayrah se, ke Nabi Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya: Kaddu ke bartan aur roghan lage hue bartanon me nabidh na banao, phir Abu Hurayrah ne apni taraf se kaha: Aur hantam martabanon aur naqir se bacho."
"1109","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ayyub ibn Musa ne hum se bayan kiya, Said ibn Abi Said se, Abu Hurayrah se, ke Rasulullah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya: Jab tum me se kisi ki laundi zina kare aur us ka zina zahir ho jaye to wo use hadd lagaye aur use malamat na kare, phir agar wo laut kar zina kare aur us ka zina zahir ho jaye to wo use hadd lagaye aur use malamat na kare, phir agar wo laut kar aaye aur us ka zina zahir ho jaye to use bech de agarche balon ki choti ke badle ho yani rassi ke badle."
"1110","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ziyad ibn Sad ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne ise Hilal ibn Abi Maymunah se suna, wo ise Abu Maymunah se bayan kar rahe the, jinhon ne kaha: Ek Farsi mard aur us ki biwi Abu Hurayrah ke paas apne ek bete ke bare me jhagadte hue aaye, Farsi ne kaha: Ai Abu Hurayrah ye baligh hai, Abu Hurayrah ne kaha: Main tum dono ke darmiyan zaroor usi tarah faisla karunga jaisa maine Rasulullah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ko faisla karte hue dekha: Ai ladke ye tere walid hain aur ye teri walida hain pas un dono me se jise chahe chun le, phir Abu Hurayrah ne kaha: Pas maine Rasulullah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ko dekha jab ek mard aur ek aurat un ke paas apne ek bete ke bare me jhagadte hue aaye, us mard ne kaha: Ai Allah ke Rasul mera beta Abu Inabah ke kunwen se mere liye pani nikalta hai, Rasulullah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya: Ai ladke ye tere walid hain aur ye teri walida hain pas un dono me se jise chahe chun le."
"1111","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: al-Zuhri ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: mujhe Sa'id ibn al-Musayyib ne khabar di, Abu Hurayrah se, unhon ne kaha: Banu Fazarah ka ek dehati Nabi Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ki khidmat me hazir hua aur arz kiya: Ya Rasul Allah, meri biwi ne ek siyah faam ladke ko janam diya hai, Nabi Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya: Kya tumhare paas oont hain, us ne kaha: Ji han, Aap ne farmaya: Un ke rang kya hain, us ne kaha: Surkh, Nabi Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya: Kya un me koi khakistari mai'l bhi hai, us ne kaha: Beshak un me khakistari mai'l bhi hain, Aap ne farmaya: Yeh un me kahan se aa gaya, us ne kaha: Shayad kisi nasli riq ne use kheench liya ho, Rasul Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya: Aur yeh bachcha bhi, shayad kisi nasli riq ne use kheench liya ho."
"1112","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: maine al-Zuhri ko Sa'id se [ya Abu Salamah se] — un dono me se ek se, ya dono se — riwayat karte hue suna; Sufyan kabhi un me se ek ka akela zikr karte, kabhi dono ko jama karte, aur kabhi shak ka izhar karte, lekin aksar auqat woh ise Sa'id se riwayat karte — Abu Hurayrah se, ke Rasul Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya: Bachcha firash wale ka hai, aur zanikar ke liye pathar hai."
"1113","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu al-Zinad ne hum se bayan kiya, al-A'raj se, Abu Hurayrah se, ke Rasul Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya: Badgumani se bacho, kyunke badgumani sab se jhooti baat hai."
"1114","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu al-Zinad ne hum se bayan kiya, al-A'raj se, Abu Hurayrah se, unhon ne kaha: Rasul Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya: Allah ne us shakhs ke liye zamanat li hai jo Us ke raste me jihad karte hue apne ghar se nikalta hai, jise jihad ke siwa koi cheez nahi nikalti, Mujh par iman aur Mere Rasul ki tasdeeq ki wajah se: agar Main use maut dun to Main use Jannat me dakhil karunga, aur agar Main use wapas lautaun to Main use us ghar ki taraf lautaaunga jise woh chhod kar gaya tha, jo bhi ajr ya ghanimat us ne hasil ki ho use pate hue."
"1115","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ibn 'Ajlan ne hum se bayan kiya, us shakhs se jis ne Abu Hurayrah ko Nabi Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam se is ki manind riwayat karte hue suna, siwa is ke ke unhon ne kaha: Allah ne Apne Zimme le liya hai, Sufyan ne kaha: Aur main Ibn 'Ajlan ki hadith ko zyada mazbooti se yaad rakhta hun."
"1116","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Aur maine Sufyan ko suna jabke un ke samne Ibn 'Ajlan ki hadith, al-Qa'qa' se, Abu Salih se, Abu Hurayrah se, Nabi Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam se, pesh ki gayi thi, aur unhon ne is ki tasdeeq ki, Al-Humaydi ne kaha: Aur mere liye is ke bare me un se sawal karna muqaddar nahi hua."
"1117","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu al-Zinad ne hum se bayan kiya, al-A'raj se, Abu Hurayrah se, unhon ne kaha: Rasul Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya: Teen shakhs Allah Azzawajal ki zamanat me hain: ek woh mard jo Allah Azzawajal ki masjido me se kisi masjid ki taraf apne ghar se nikalta hai, aur ek woh mard jo Allah Azzawajal ke raste me ladne ke liye nikalta hai, aur ek woh mard jo Hajj ada karne ke liye nikalta hai."
"1118","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Mis'ar ne hum se bayan kiya, Muhammad ibn 'Abd al-Rahman se, 'Isa ibn Talhah se, Abu Hurayrah se, unhon ne kaha: Rasul Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya: Allah ke raste ka ghubar aur Jahannam ka dhuan kisi Musalman ke andar jama nahi hote."
"1119","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, Abu al-Zinad se, al-A'raj se, Abu Hurayrah se, unhon ne kaha: Rasul Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya: Jo bhi Allah ke raste me zakhmi hota hai — aur Allah behtar janta hai ke kaun Us ke raste me zakhmi hota hai — magar woh Qayamat ke Din is haal me aayega ke rang khoon ka hoga aur khushbu mushk ki hogi."
"1120","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, Sa'id ibn Abi 'Arubah aur Yahya ibn Subaykh se, Qatadah se, al-Nadr ibn Anas se, Bashir ibn Nahik se, Abu Hurayrah se, Nabi Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam se marfu'an, Aap ne farmaya: Jab koi ghulam do admiyon ke darmiyan mushtarak milkiyat me ho aur un me se ek apna hissa azad kar de, to agar woh maldar ho to us par qeemat lagayi jayegi, aur agar us ke paas maal na ho to ghulam se us ke liye mehnat-mazduri karayi jayegi, us par naqabil-e-bardasht mashaqqat dale baghair."
"1121","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: al-Zuhri ne hum se bayan kiya, Sa'id ibn al-Musayyib se, Abu Hurayrah se, unhon ne kaha: Allah ke Rasul Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya: Jab Kisra halak ho jayega to us ke baad koi Kisra nahi hoga, aur jab Qaisar halak ho jayega to us ke baad koi Qaisar nahi hoga. Qasam Us Zaat ki Jiske Haath mein meri jaan hai, un ke khazane zaroor Allah Azzawajal ke raaste mein kharch kiye jayenge."
"1122","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: al-Zuhri ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sa'id ibn al-Musayyib ne mujhe khabar di, Abu Hurayrah se, unhon ne kaha: Allah ke Rasul Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya: Na koi fara' hai aur na koi 'atirah. Al-Zuhri ne kaha: Al-fara' pehli aulaad hai, aur al-'atirah Rajab mein har gharane ki taraf se zibah ki jane wali bakri hai."
"1123","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: al-Zuhri ne hum se bayan kiya, Sa'id ibn al-Musayyib se, Abu Hurayrah se, unhon ne kaha: Allah ke Rasul Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya: Allah Azzawajal ne farmaya: Ibn-e-Adam Mujhe takleef deta hai; woh zamane ko bura kehta hai, halanke Main hi Zamana hoon; muamla Mere Haath mein hai, Main raat aur din ko ulat palat karta hoon."
"1124","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: al-Zuhri ne hum se bayan kiya, Sa'id ibn al-Musayyib se, Abu Hurayrah se, unhon ne kaha: Allah ke Rasul Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya: Ibn-e-Maryam qareeb hai ke tum mein ek aadil munsif aur aadil hukmaran ki haisiyat se nazil hon; woh saleeb ko todenge, khinzeer ko qatl karenge, jizya ko khatm kar denge, aur maal itna zyada ho jayega ke koi usay qabool nahi karega."
"1125","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: 'Imran ibn Zibyan al-Hanafi ne hum se bayan kiya, Banu Hanifah ke ek aadmi se, unhon ne kaha: Maine Abu Hurayrah ko kehte hue suna: Allah ke Rasul Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya: Ibn-e-Maryam qareeb hai ke tum mein ek hidayat dene wale rehnuma aur aadil munsif ki haisiyat se nazil hon; woh saleeb ko todenge, khinzeer ko qatl karenge, jizya ko khatm kar denge, aur maal itna zyada ho jayega ke koi usay qabool nahi karega."
"1126","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: al-Zuhri ne hum se bayan kiya, Sa'id ibn al-Musayyib se, Abu Hurayrah se, unhon ne kaha: Allah ke Rasul Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya: Aur woh 'karam' kehte hain, lekin asal karam momin ka dil hai."
"1127","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: al-Zuhri ne hum se bayan kiya, Sa'id ibn al-Musayyib se, Abu Hurayrah se, unhon ne kaha: Allah ke Rasul Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya: Qayamat qayam nahi hogi yahan tak ke tum aisi qaum se jang karo jinke chehre koot kar banayi hui dhalon ki tarah honge, aur Qayamat qayam nahi hogi yahan tak ke tum aisi qaum se jang karo jinke jootay baalon ke honge."
"1128","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, Ibn Abi Khalid se, Qays ibn Abi Hazim se, Abu Hurayrah se: Woh numayan log hain."
"1129","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu al-Zinad ne hum se bayan kiya, al-A'raj se, Abu Hurayrah se, unhon ne kaha: Allah ke Rasul Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya: Qayamat qayam nahi hogi yahan tak ke tum chhoti aankhon wale chapti naakon wale logon se jang karo."
"1130","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu al-Zinad ne hum se bayan kiya, al-A'raj se, Abu Hurayrah se, unhon ne kaha: Allah ke Rasul Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya: Qayamat is haal mein aayegi ke ek aadmi apni oontni ka doodh dooh raha hoga, aur Qayamat is haal mein aayegi ke ek aadmi apne hauz par lep kar raha hoga."
"1131","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu al-Zinad ne hum se bayan kiya, al-A'raj se, Abu Hurayrah se, unhon ne kaha: Rasool Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya: Qayamat qayam nahi hogi yahan tak ke do azeem giroh aapas me jang karen, un dono ka da'wa ek ho."
"1132","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: al-Zuhri ne hum se bayan kiya, Sa'id ibn al-Musayyib se: ke Umar ibn al-Khattab Hassan ke paas se guzre jabke woh masjid me she'r parh rahe the, aur unhon ne un ki taraf dekha, to Hassan ne kaha: Main is me us waqt she'r parha karta tha jab is me tum se behtar hasti maujood thi, phir woh Abu Hurayrah ki taraf mutawajjeh hue aur kaha: Main tumhen Allah ki qasam de kar poochta hun, kya tum ne Rasool Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ko ye farmate hue suna: Meri taraf se jawab do, aye Allah Rooh-ul-Qudus ke zariye is ki madad farma, unhon ne kaha: Aye Allah, haan."
"1133","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: al-Zuhri ne hum se bayan kiya, Abu Salamah ibn Abd al-Rahman se, Abu Hurayrah se, unhon ne kaha: al-Aqra ibn Habis ne Rasool Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ko al-Hasan ya al-Husayn ko bosa dete hue dekha, Allah un dono se raazi ho, aur kaha: Mere das bache hain aur main ne un me se kisi ko kabhi bosa nahi diya, to Nabi Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya: Beshak jo rehem nahi karta us par rehem nahi kiya jayega."
"1134","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: al-Zuhri ne hum se bayan kiya, Abu Salamah ibn Abd al-Rahman se, Abu Hurayrah se, ke Rasool Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya: Is kale dane ko lazim pakro, kyunke is me al-sam ke siwa har beemari ke liye shifa hai, aur al-sam maut hai, Sufyan ne kaha: Ya'ni al-shuniz."
"1135","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: al-Zuhri ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sulayman ibn Yasar aur Abu Salamah ibn Abd al-Rahman ne mujhe khabar di, Abu Hurayrah se, unhon ne kaha: Rasool Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya: Beshak Yahood aur Nasara khizab nahi lagate, pas un ki mukhalifat karo."
"1136","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: al-Zuhri ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Anbasah ibn Sa'id ibn al-As ne mujhe khabar di, Abu Hurayrah se, unhon ne kaha: Main Rasool Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam aur un ke sahaba ke paas Khaybar me us ke fatah hone ke baad aaya, aur main ne Rasool Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam se maal-e-ghaneemat me se mera hissa muqarrar karne ka sawal kiya, to Sa'id ibn al-As ke beton me se ek ne un se kaha: Aye Allah ke Rasool ise hissa na dijiye, to main ne kaha: Aye Allah ke Rasool ye Ibn Qawqal ka qatil hai, phir Ibn Sa'id ne kaha: Kitni ta'ajjub ki baat hai, bakriyon ke baade ki bulandi se hum par utarne wala ek wabar, mujhe ek Musalman aadmi ke qatl par malamat karta hai jise Allah ne mere haathon izzat bakhshi aur mujhe us ke haathon ruswa nahi kiya, Sufyan ne kaha: Aur main nahi janta ke unhon ne use hissa diya ya nahi."
"1137","Sufyan ne kaha: Aur al-Sa'idi ne bhi mujh se ye riwayat ki, apne dada se, Abu Hurayrah se, Nabi Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam se, matn matboo'a nuskhe me maujood nahi hai, sirf isnad hai."
"1138","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu al-Zinad ne hum se bayan kiya, al-A'raj se, Abu Hurayrah se, unhon ne kaha: Rasool Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya: Jannatiyon ke kanghe sone ke honge, aur un ki majmar oud ki hongi, Al-Humaydi ne kaha: Aloeswood se murad oud hai."
"1139","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu al-Zinad ne hum se bayan kiya, al-A'raj se, Abu Hurayrah se, unhon ne kaha: Rasool Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam se mushrikeen ke un bachon ke bare me poocha gaya jo kam umri me faut ho jate hain, to Rasool Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya: Allah hi behtar janta hai ke woh kya amal karte."
"1140","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu al-Zinad ne hum se bayan kiya, al-A'raj se, Abu Hurayrah se, unhon ne kaha: Rasool Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya: Allah Ta'ala ne farmaya: Mannat Ibn-e-Adam ke liye kuch hasil nahi karti jo main ne us ke liye muqaddar na ki ho, lekin ye ek cheez hai jis ke zariye main bakheel se nikalwata hun, woh is ke zariye mere liye woh lata hai jo woh bukhl ke zariye mere liye na lata."
"1141","Humein Al-Humaydi ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Humein Sufyan ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Humein Abu al-Zinad ne bayan kiya, al-A'raj se, Abu Hurayrah se, Allah ke Rasool Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam se."
"1142","Aur humein Amr ne bayan kiya, Tawus se, Abu Hurayrah se, unhon ne farmaya: Allah ke Rasool Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya: Har paida hone wala fitrat par paida hota hai, phir us ke walidain use Yahudi bana dete hain aur use Isai bana dete hain. Abu al-Zinad ne izafa kiya: Aur use Majusi bana dete hain [ya use mushrik bana dete hain]. Unhon ne farmaya: Aur Allah ke Rasool Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam se mushrikon ke un bachon ke bare mein sawal kiya gaya jo kam-umri mein faut ho jayen, to Aap ne farmaya: Allah hi khoob janta hai ke woh kya amal karne wale the."
"1143","Humein Al-Humaydi ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Humein Sufyan ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Humein Ibn Ajlan ne bayan kiya, Abu Rabiah ke khandan ke ek shakhs se, al-A'raj se, Abu Hurayrah se, unhon ne farmaya: Allah ke Rasool Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya: Taqatwar momin Allah Taala ke nazdeek kamzor momin se behtar aur zyada mehboob hai, aur har ek mein bhalai hai. Jo cheez tumhein nafa de us ki hirs karo aur aajiz mat ho; agar tum par koi cheez ghalib aa jaye to kaho: Allah ne taqdeer farmayi, aur jo Us ne chaha Us ne kiya; aur agar se bacho, kyunke woh shaitan ke kaam ko kholta hai."
"1144","Humein Al-Humaydi ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Humein Sufyan ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Humein Amr ibn Dinar ne bayan kiya, Tawus se, Abu Hurayrah se, unhon ne farmaya: Allah ke Rasool Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya: Adam aur Musa ne bahes ki. Musa ne Adam se kaha: Ae Adam, aap hamare walid hain; aap ne humein mehrum kiya aur humein Jannat se nikalwaya. Adam ne farmaya: Aap Musa hain; Allah ne aap ko Apne kalaam se muntakhab farmaya aur aap ke liye Takhtiyon mein Apne Haath se likha; kya aap mujhe us muamle par malamat karte hain jo Allah ne mujhe paida karne se chalis saal pehle mere liye muqaddar farma diya tha. Phir Allah ke Rasool Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya: Pas Adam Musa par ghalib aaye."
"1145","Humein Al-Humaydi ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Humein Sufyan ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Humein Abu al-Zinad ne bayan kiya, al-A'raj se, Nabi Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam se is hi ki manind."
"1146","Humein Al-Humaydi ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Humein Sufyan ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Humein Umarah ibn al-Qaqa ne bayan kiya, Abu Zurah ibn Amr ibn Jarir se, Abu Hurayrah se, Allah ke Rasool Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam se, Aap ne farmaya: Na chhoot hai aur na bad-shaguni hai; kharish-zada oont sau ko kharish-zada kar deta hai — to pehle ko kis ne bimari lagayi."
"1147","Humein Al-Humaydi ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Humein Sufyan ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Humein Umarah ibn al-Qaqa ne bayan kiya, Abu Zurah ibn Amr ibn Jarir se, Abu Hurayrah se, unhon ne farmaya: Ek shakhs Nabi Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ke paas aaya aur us ne kaha: Logon mein se meri husn-e-sohbat ka sab se zyada mustahiq kaun hai. Aap ne farmaya: Tumhari walida — do martaba; us ne kaha: Phir kaun. Aap ne farmaya: Tumhare walid. Sufyan ne farmaya: Pas woh walida ke liye neki ka do-tihai aur walid ke liye ek-tihai shumar karte hain."
"1148","Humein Al-Humaydi ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Humein al-Fudayl ibn Iyad ne bayan kiya, Hisham se, al-Hasan se, unhon ne farmaya: Neki ka do-tihai walida ke liye hai aur ek-tihai walid ke liye hai."
"1149","Humein Al-Humaydi ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Humein Sufyan ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Humein Ibn Ajlan ne bayan kiya, Said ibn Abi Said se, Abu Hurayrah se, ke Allah ke Rasool Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya: Tum mein se koi ye na kahe: Allah tera chehra aur us ke chehre ko ruswa kare jo tere chehre se mushabeh ho, kyunke Allah ne Adam ko us ki surat par paida farmaya."
"1150","Humein Al-Humaydi ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Humein Sufyan ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Humein Abu al-Zinad ne bayan kiya, al-A'raj se, Abu Hurayrah se, unhon ne farmaya: Allah ke Rasool Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya: Jab tum mein se koi mare to chehre se bache, kyunke Allah ne Adam ko us ki surat par paida farmaya."
"1151","Hamen Al-Humaydi ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: hamen Sufyan ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: hamen Abu al-Zinad ne bayan kiya, Al-A'raj se, Abu Hurayrah se, unhon ne kaha: Rasul Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya: Allah do admiyon par hansta hai, un mein se ek dusre ko qatl karta hai, phir bhi dono ek sath Jannat mein dakhil hote hain: un mein se ek kafir hai jo apne sathi ko qatl karta hai, phir woh Islam qabool karta hai aur shaheed ho jata hai."
"1152","Hamen Al-Humaydi ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: hamen Sufyan ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: hamen Abu al-Zinad ne bayan kiya, Al-A'raj se, Abu Hurayrah se, unhon ne kaha: Rasul Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya: Jis ne meri ita'at ki us ne Allah ki ita'at ki, aur jis ne mere ameer ki ita'at ki us ne meri ita'at ki."
"1153","Hamen Al-Humaydi ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: hamen Sufyan ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: hamen Abu al-Zinad ne bayan kiya, Al-A'raj se, Abu Hurayrah se, unhon ne kaha: Rasul Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya: Zayed pani ko roka na jaye taake us ke zariye ghaas ko roka jaye."
"1154","Hamen Al-Humaydi ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: hamen Sufyan ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: hamen Abu al-Zinad ne bayan kiya, Al-A'raj se, Abu Hurayrah se."
"1155","Aur Ibn Ajlan ne, apne walid se, Abu Hurayrah se, unhon ne kaha: Rasul Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya: Mujhe us par chhore rakho jis par main ne tumhen chhora hai, kyunke tum se pehle log sirf apne kasrat-e-sawal aur apne nabiyon se ikhtilaf ki wajah se halak hue, jis cheez se main tumhen mana karun us se ruk jao, aur jis cheez ka main tumhen hukm dun us mein se jitna kar sako utna karo, Ibn Ajlan ne izafa kiya: To main ne ise Aban ibn Salih ko bayan kiya, aur woh is jumle ko pasand kiya karte the: Us mein se jitna kar sako utna karo."
"1156","Hamen Al-Humaydi ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: hamen Sufyan ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: hamen Abu al-Zinad ne bayan kiya, Al-A'raj se, Abu Hurayrah se, unhon ne kaha: Rasul Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya: Allah ne farmaya: Meri rehmat mere ghazab par sabqat le gayi hai."
"1157","Hamen Al-Humaydi ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: hamen Sufyan ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: hamen Abu al-Zinad ne bayan kiya, Al-A'raj se, Abu Hurayrah se, unhon ne kaha: Rasul Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya: Beshak Allah ke nazdeek sab se zaleel naam us aadmi ka hai jiska naam malik al-muluk rakha gaya, Sufyan ne kaha: Shahanshah."
"1158","Hamen Al-Humaydi ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: hamen Sufyan ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: hamen Abu al-Zinad ne bayan kiya, Al-A'raj se, Abu Hurayrah se, unhon ne kaha: Rasul Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya: Momin zina nahi karta jabke woh zina karte waqt momin ho, aur woh chori nahi karta jabke woh chori karte waqt momin ho, aur woh sharab nahi peeta jabke woh peete waqt momin ho, aur woh loot ka maal nahi loot-ta jabke woh loot-te waqt momin ho."
"1159","Hamen Al-Humaydi ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: hamen Sufyan ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: hamen Abu al-Zinad ne bayan kiya, Al-A'raj se, Abu Hurayrah se, unhon ne kaha: Rasul Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya: Yeh aag Jahannam ki aag ke sattar hisson mein se ek hissa hai, ise pani se do martaba thanda kiya gaya, aur agar aisa na hota to koi is se koi faida na uthata."
"1160","Hamen Al-Humaydi ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: hamen Sufyan ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: hamen Abu al-Zinad ne bayan kiya, Al-A'raj se, Abu Hurayrah se, unhon ne kaha: Rasul Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya: Beshak Allah ke ninanwe Naam hain, ek kam sau, jo unhen mehfooz rakhega woh Jannat mein dakhil hoga, aur Woh Witr hai aur witr ko pasand karta hai."
"1161","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu al-Zinad ne hum se bayan kiya, al-A'raj se, Abu Hurayrah se, unhon ne kaha: Rasul Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya: Beshak Jannat mein ek darakht hai jis ke saye mein sawaar sau baras tak chalta rahega aur use uboor na kar sakega, pas agar tum chaho to padho: Aur phaila hua saya."
"1162","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu al-Zinad ne hum se bayan kiya, al-A'raj se, Abu Hurayrah se, unhon ne kaha: Rasul Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya: Tum logon mein sab se bure logon mein se do chehron wale ko paoge."
"1163","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu al-Zinad ne hum se bayan kiya, al-A'raj se, Abu Hurayrah se, unhon ne kaha: Rasul Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya: Allah Azza wa Jall ne farmaya: Maine Apne nek bandon ke liye woh tayyar kiya hai jo na kisi aankh ne dekha aur na kisi kaan ne suna aur na kisi insan ke dil mein us ka khayal guzra, aur agar tum chaho to padho: Pas koi jaan nahin janti jo un ke liye aankhon ki thandak mein se chhupa kar rakha gaya hai, jaza ke taur par us ki jo woh kiya karte the."
"1164","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu al-Zinad ne hum se bayan kiya, al-A'raj se, Abu Hurayrah se, unhon ne kaha: Rasul Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya: Mere waris deenar taqseem nahin karte; mere ahl-o-ayal ke kharch aur mere karkunon ki rozi ke baad jo main chhor jaun woh sadqa hai; aur mere waris deenar taqseem nahin karte."
"1165","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu al-Zinad ne hum se bayan kiya, al-A'raj se, Abu Hurayrah se, unhon ne kaha: Rasul Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya: Jab tum mein se kisi ka tasma toot jaye to woh ek joote ya ek chappal mein na chale hatta ke dusre ko durust kar le; aur jab joote pehne to daayen se ibtida kare, aur jab utare to baayen se ibtida kare; aur daayan pehna jane mein pehla aur utara jane mein aakhri ho."
"1166","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu al-Zinad ne hum se bayan kiya, al-A'raj se, Abu Hurayrah se, unhon ne kaha: Rasul Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya: Kya tum taajjub nahin karte ke Allah Azza wa Jall mujh se Quraysh ki badzubani aur un ki laanat ko kis tarah pher deta hai? Woh Mudhammam ko bura kehte hain aur Mudhammam par laanat karte hain, halanke main Muhammad Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam hun."
"1167","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu al-Zinad ne hum se bayan kiya, al-A'raj se, Abu Hurayrah se, unhon ne kaha: Rasul Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya: Jannat aur Jahannam ne jhagda kiya, ek ne kaha: Mujh mein jabbar aur mutakabbir dakhil honge, aur dusri ne kaha: Mujh mein kamzor aur mohtaj dakhil honge, pas Allah Azza wa Jall ne ek se farmaya: Tu Mera azab hai; Main tere zariye jise chahunga azab dunga, aur dusri se farmaya: Tu Meri rehmat hai; Main tere zariye jis par chahunga rehem karunga; Sufyan ne kaha: Aur mera gumaan hai ke is mein (ye bhi tha): Aur tum mein se har ek ke liye us ki bharai hogi."
"1168","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Muhammad ibn al-Munkadir ne hum se bayan kiya, jabke woh tawaf ke dauran mere hathon par tek lagaye hue the, unhon ne kaha: Mujhe us shakhs ne khabar di jis ne Abu Hurayrah se suna tha, kehte hue: Abu al-Qasim Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya: Jab tum mein se koi saye mein ho phir saya us se hat jaye hatta ke us ka kuch hissa dhoop mein aur kuch hissa saye mein ho jaye to use wahan se hat jana chahiye."
"1169","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: al-Ala ne hum se bayan kiya, apne walid se, Abu Hurayrah se, unhon ne kaha: Rasul Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya: Jab tum mein se koi jamahi le to use dabaye ya apna hath apne munh par rakh le."
"1170","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Suhayl ibn Abi Salih ne hum se bayan kiya, apne walid se, Abu Hurayrah se, Nabi Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam se marfu'an: Ke ek aadmi kaanton wali tehni ke paas se guzra to us ne use raste se hata diya, pas us ki maghfirat kar di gayi; aur Sufyan kabhi kehte: Pas Allah ne us ki qadr farmai aur use bakhsh diya."
"1171","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Ayyub al-Sakhtiyani ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Ikrimah ne hamen khabar di, unhon ne farmaya: Kya main tumhen mukhtasar baaten na bataun jo hum ne Abu Hurayrah se suneen? Unhon ne farmaya: Rasul Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne mashkize ke munh se peene se mana farmaya."
"1172","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Al-Zuhri ne hum se bayan kiya, ke unhon ne Abd al-Rahman al-A'raj ko kehte hue suna: Main ne Abu Hurayrah ko kehte hue suna: Log kehte hain ke Abu Hurayrah Rasul Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam se bahut riwayat karta hai, aur Allah muqarrar karne wala hai. Main ek muflis aadmi tha jo pet bharne ke liye Rasul Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ki suhbat mein rehta tha. Ansar apni jaidadon ki dekh bhaal mein mashgul the, aur Muhajirin bazaron mein tijarat mein mashgul the. Main Rasul Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ki ek majlis mein hazir tha jab Aap guftagu farma rahe the, aur Aap ne farmaya: Jo apni chadar bichhaye rakhe yahan tak ke main apni guftagu mukammal kar lun, phir use apni taraf samet le, to jo kuch us ne mujh se suna hai us mein se kuch nahi bhulega. To main ne ek chadar bichhai jo mujh par thi, aur jab Nabi Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne apni guftagu mukammal ki to main ne use apni taraf samet liya; aur Us Zat ki qasam Jis ne Aap ko haq ke sath bheja, us ke baad se jo kuch main ne Aap se suna us mein se kuch nahi bhula. Sufyan ne farmaya: Al-Mas'udi ne farmaya: Aur ek aur shakhs khada hua aur us ne apni chadar bichhai, to Nabi Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya: Naujavaan Dausi tum se is mein sabqat le gaya."
"1173","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Ayyub al-Sakhtiyani ne hum se bayan kiya, Muhammad ibn Sirin se, unhon ne farmaya: Logon ka mardo aur aurto ke bare mein ikhtilaf hua ke un mein se Jannat mein kaun zyada honge, to woh Abu Hurayrah ke paas aaye aur un se pucha. Unhon ne farmaya: Abul Qasim Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya: Jannat mein dakhil hone wala meri ummat ka pehla giroh chaundhvin raat ke chaand ki surat par hoga; phir un ke baad aane wale aasman ke sab se zyada roshan chamakdar sitare ki manind honge. Aur Sufyan kabhi kehte: Chamakdar; un mein se har ek ke liye do biviyan hongi, jin ki pindliyon ka gooda gosht ke peeche se nazar aayega, aur Jannat mein koi kunwara nahi hoga."
"1174","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Ayyub al-Sakhtiyani ne hum se bayan kiya, Muhammad se, Abu Hurayrah se, unhon ne farmaya: Rasul Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya: Mere naam par naam rakho, lekin meri kuniyat par kuniyat na rakho."
"1175","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ayyub ne hum se bayan kiya, Muhammad se, Abu Hurayrah se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya: Jab tum mein se koi aisa khwab dekhe jise wo napasand karta ho, to use chahiye ke do rakat namaz parhe, aur use kisi ko na bataye, pas wo use nuqsan nahi dega."
"1176","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ziyad ibn Sad Abu Abd al-Rahman al-Khurasani ne hum se bayan kiya, al-Zuhri se, Said ibn al-Musayyib se, Abu Hurayrah se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya: Kaabe ko Habsha ka Dhu al-Suwayqatayn munhadim karega."
"1177","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ibn Jurayj ne hum se bayan kiya, Abu al-Zubayr se, Abu Salih se, Abu Hurayrah se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya: Log qareeb hain ke ilm ki talash mein sawar unton ke pehluon ko ed lagayen, aur wo Madina ke aalim se zyada ilm wala koi aalim nahi payenge."
"1178","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, Abu Hafs Umar ibn Abd al-Rahman ibn Muhaysin al-Sahmi se, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Muhammad ibn Qays ibn Makhramah ko Abu Hurayrah se riwayat karte hue suna, unhon ne kaha: Jab Whoever does evil will be recompensed for it nazil hui, to ye Musalmanon par bhari guzri, pas Rasulullah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya: Sidhe raho, durust raho, aur khushkhabri hasil karo; pas jo kuch Musalman ko pesh aata hai wo us ke liye kaffara hai, hatta ke kanta jo use chubhta hai aur thokar jis se wo thokar khata hai."
"1179","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ata ibn al-Saib ne hum se bayan kiya, al-Agharr se, Abu Hurayrah se, Nabi Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam se, Aap ne farmaya: Allah Aziz o Jaleel ne farmaya: Takabbur Meri chadar hai, aur azmat Mera tehband hai; jo shakhs in dono mein se kisi mein Mujh se muqabla karega, Main use Aag mein dal dunga."
"1180","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sad al-Tai Abu Mujahid ne hum se bayan kiya — main ne un se us waqt suna jab main ladka tha — Abu Mudillah se, Abu Hurayrah se, unhon ne kaha: Unhon ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah, jab hum Aap ke paas hote hain to hamare dil ek halat mein hote hain, lekin jab hum Aap ke paas se nikal jate hain to wo dusri halat mein hote hain. Unhon ne kaha: Pas Rasulullah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya: Agar tum, jab tum mere paas se niklo, waise hi raho jaise tum mere paas hote ho, to farishte tum se musafaha karen. Unhon ne kaha: Aur Rasulullah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya: Jannat ki imarat sone ki ek eent aur chandi ki ek eent hai; us ka gaara tez khushbudar mushk hai, us ke kankar moti, zabarjad aur yaqut hain. Aur unhon ne ek taweel hadith zikr ki."
"1181","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Amr ibn Dinar ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Maine Ikrimah ko kehte hue suna: Maine Abu Hurayrah ko kehte hue suna: Beshak Allah ke Nabi Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya: Jab Allah aasman mein muamle ka faisla farmata hai to farishte Us ke farman ke samne jhukte hue apne par marte hain goya woh hamwar chattan par zanjeer ho, aur jab un ke dilon se ghabrahat door kar di jati hai to woh kehte hain: Tumhare Rabb ne kya farmaya? Woh kehte hain: Haq jo Us ne farmaya, aur Woh Buland Martaba, Bohat Bara hai, phir chori chhupe sunne wale use sun lete hain jabke chori chhupe sunne wale ek dusre ke upar hote hain, aur Sufyan ne un mein se baaz ko baaz ke upar bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: To ek kalima sunta hai aur use apne niche wale ki taraf dal deta hai, phir dusra use apne niche wale ki taraf dal deta hai, phir woh use jadugar ya kahin ki zaban par dal deta hai, to kabhi shihab use us se pehle pa leta hai ke woh use dale aur kabhi woh use dal deta hai is se pehle ke woh use pahunche, phir woh us ke sath sau jhoot milata hai, to kaha jata hai: Kya us ne humein falan falan din aasman se suni hui baat ke bare mein falan falan baat nahi batai thi? To aasman se suni hui us baat ki wajah se us ki tasdeeq ki jati hai."
"1182","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Yahya ibn Said ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Abu al-Hubab Said ibn Yasar ne humein khabar di, unhon ne farmaya: Maine Abu Hurayrah ko kehte hue suna: Allah ke Rasool Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya: Mujhe ek basti ki taraf hukm diya gaya jo bastiyon ko kha jati hai, woh kehte hain: Yathrib, lekin woh Madinah hai, woh logon ko is tarah nikal deti hai jaise bhatti lohe ke mail ko nikal deti hai."
"1183","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Hisham ibn Urwah ne hum se bayan kiya, apne walid se, Abu Hurayrah se, unhon ne farmaya: Allah ke Rasool Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya: Log sawal karte rahenge hatta ke woh kahenge: Ye Allah hai jis ne har cheez ko paida kiya to Allah ko kis ne paida kiya, unhon ne farmaya: To jab tum mein se koi ye paye to use kehna chahiye: Hum Allah par iman laye."
"1184","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Muhammad ibn Ajlan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Maine Abu al-Hubab Said ibn Yasar ko kehte hue suna: Maine Abu Hurayrah ko kehte hue suna: Allah ke Rasool Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya: Qasam Us Zaat ki Jis ke Hath mein meri jaan hai, koi banda halal kamai se sadqa nahi deta, aur Allah halal ke siwa kuch qabool nahi farmata, aur aasman ki taraf halal ke siwa kuch nahi chadhta, aur use us ke haqdar muqam mein rakhta hai, magar goya woh use Rehman ke Hath mein rakhta hai, aur Woh use us ke liye parwarish farmata hai jaise tum mein se koi apne bacha ghode ya apne oont ke bache ko palta hai, hatta ke luqma ya khajoor bhi Qayamat ke Din pahad e azeem ki tarah aati hai, aur unhon ne tilawat farmai: Aur Wohi hai Jo Apne bandon se tauba qabool farmata hai aur sadqat leta hai."
"1185","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Ibn Ajlan ne hum se bayan kiya, Bukayr ibn Abd Allah ibn al-Ashajj se, Ajlan se, Abu Hurayrah se, unhon ne farmaya: Allah ke Rasool Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya: Ghulam apne khane aur kapde ka haqdar hai, aur use kaam ka bojh nahi dala jayega magar jo woh bardasht kar sake."
"1186","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Ibn Ajlan ne hum se bayan kiya, Bukayr se, Ajlan se, Abu Hurayrah se, unhon ne farmaya: Allah ke Rasool Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya: Hum ne un se sulah nahi ki jab se hum ne un se jang ki hai, aur jo un mein se kisi ko darr ki wajah se chhod de woh mujh se nahi, yani saanp."
"1187","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, Sumayy se, Abu Salih se, Abu Hurayrah se: Ke Allah ke Rasool Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam jab chheenkte to apne chehre ko dhaanp lete aur apni chheenk ko dabate."
"1188","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Ibn Ajlan ne hum se bayan kiya, Said se, Abu Hurayrah se, ke Nabi Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya: Koi log kisi majlis mein nahi baithte jis mein woh Allah ko yaad nahi karte magar woh un ke liye hasrat ka sabab hogi."
"1189","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Ibn Ajlan ne hum se bayan kiya, Said se, Abu Hurayrah se, unhon ne farmaya: Allah ke Rasool Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya: Fahashi se bacho kyunke Allah fahash, badzaban se nafrat farmata hai, aur zulm se bacho kyunke zulm Qayamat ke Din andhere honge, aur bukhl se bacho kyunke us ne tum se pehle logon ko apna khoon bahane, apni rishtedariyan todne aur apni hurmaton ko halal samajhne par uksaya."
"1190","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Maine Abu Abd al-Aziz Musa ibn Ubaydah al-Rabadhi ko Muhammad ibn Thabit se, Abu Hurayrah se bayan karte hue suna, unhon ne farmaya: Allah ke Rasool Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya: Jab aadmi apne bhai se kahe: Allah tumhein bhalai ki jaza de, to us ne tareef mein kamaal kar diya."
"1191","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ibn Ajlan ne hum se bayan kiya, Saeed se, Abu Hurayrah se, unhon ne kaha: Rasool Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya: Cheenk Allah ki taraf se hai, aur jamahi Shaitan ki taraf se hai, pas jab tum mein se koi jamahi le to use chahiye ke woh apna haath apne munh par rakhe, aur jab woh Ha Ha kahe to woh sirf Shaitan hai jo us ke pet mein hansta hai."
"1192","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ibn Ajlan ne hum se bayan kiya, Saeed se, Abu Hurayrah se, Nabi Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam tak marfu bayan karte hue: Jab tum baithe hue logon ke paas aao to unhein salam karo, aur jab utho to salam karo, pas pehla aakhri se zyada haqdar nahin hai."
"1193","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Muhammad ibn Amr ibn Alqamah ne hum se bayan kiya, Abu Salamah ibn Abd al-Rahman se, Abu Hurayrah se ke Nabi Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya: Chaar nehrein Jannat se hain: Furat, Sayhan, Jayhan aur Neel."
"1194","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Al-Walid ibn Kathir ne hum se bayan kiya, Wahb ibn Kaysan se, unhon ne kaha: Maine Abu Hurayrah ko dekha ke woh Madinah mein logon ko namaz parha rahe the Mina se rawangi ke pehle din ki shaam ko, phir unhon ne kaha: Beshak Abu al-Qasim Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam nekiyon mein sabqat le gaye, aur beshak Marwan ke azaad karda ghulam Dhakwan ne hajiyon se sabqat ki, aur us ne logon ke bare mein aman mein khabar di hai. Sufyan ne kaha: Aur Dhakwan ne kaha: Maine us ka bojh khud par uthaya."
"1195","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Muhammad ibn Amr ibn Alqamah ne hum se bayan kiya, Abu Salamah se, Abu Hurayrah se, unhon ne kaha: Allah ke Rasool Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya: Bani Israil se riwayat karo, aur koi harj nahi; mujh se riwayat karo, lekin mujh par jhoot na bandho."
"1196","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, aur beshumar afrad ne mujh se bayan kiya, Abu Hurayrah se, ke Allah ke Rasool Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya: Jo shakhs jan boojh kar mujh par jhoot bole, woh Jahannum me apna thikana bana le."
"1197","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Harun Musa ibn Abi Isa al-Madini darzi ne hum se bayan kiya, ke unhon ne Abu Abd Allah al-Qarrazz ko kehte hue suna: Maine Abu Hurayrah ko kehte hue suna: Allah ke Rasool Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya: Jo bhi jabbar zalim Ahl-e-Madinah ke sath burai ka irada karega, Allah use Aag me is tarah pighla dega jaise namak pani me pighalta hai; aur jo is ki mashaqqat aur sakhti par sabr kare, magar Qayamat ke din me us ke liye gawah — ya sifarishi — hunga."
"1198","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu al-Zinad ne hum se bayan kiya, al-Araj se, Abu Hurayrah se, unhon ne kaha: Allah ke Rasool Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya: Beshak aurat pasli se paida ki gayi hai; woh tumhare liye kabhi ek raah par seedhi nahi rahegi. Agar tum us se lutf uthao to us se lutf uthate ho jabke us me terdhapan hai; aur agar tum use seedha karne lago to use tod doge, aur us ka tutna us ki talaq hai."
"1199","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Imran ibn Zibyan al-Hanafi ne hum se bayan kiya, ke unhon ne Banu Hanifah ke ek shakhs ko kehte hue suna: Maine Abu Hurayrah ko kehte hue suna: Main Allah ke Rasool Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ke sath Banu Qaynuqa ke Yahudiyon ke paas parhne ke liye gaya, aur Allah ke Rasool Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne khushbu me basa hua ek shakhs dekha, to maine kaha: Ya Rasool Allah, shayad woh dulha hai. Phir Allah ke Rasool Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya: Jao, use dho dalo, phir rago, phir dho, phir rago, phir dho, phir rago."
"1200","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ziyad ibn Sad ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Maine Sabit al-Araj ko Abu Hurayrah se riwayat karte hue suna, ke Nabi Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya: Bad-tareen khana waleeme ka khana hai: jo us par aate hain unhe us se roka jata hai, aur jo use napasand karte hain unhe us ki dawat di jati hai; aur jo dawat qabool na kare us ne Allah aur Us ke Rasool ki nafarmani ki."
